rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "If you name a card that has both a mana ability and another activated ability, the mana ability can be activated but the other ability can\'t be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "Pithing Needle affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards. For example, a player can\'t cycle Eternal Dragon or return an Eternal Dragon from their graveyard to hand if Pithing Needle naming Eternal Dragon is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "You can name any card, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You can\'t name a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Once Pithing Needle has left the battlefield, activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can be activated again.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form "[cost]: [effect]." Triggered abilities and static abilities of the named card work normally.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Paralyzing Grasp may target, and may enchant, an untapped creature. If it does, it will have no effect unless that creature becomes tapped somehow.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The enchanted creature can still be untapped by a spell or ability at other times.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You may target a creature you already control. You may target a creature that’s already untapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "A creature token that\'s a copy of a nontoken creature is still a token. It will get +1/+1, but the original nontoken creature will not."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "For each library, the search is complete only when you explicitly say it is. For example, you can look through one player\'s library, set that library down, look at another player\'s library, choose a nonland card in the first library, then choose a nonland card in the second library. Don\'t reveal any cards from those libraries to any other player until you exile them."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'If a card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast a card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast one, it will remain exiled. Jace\'s ability won\'t allow you to cast it later."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t pay alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "Jace\'s first ability creates a delayed triggered ability that triggers whenever a creature an opponent controls attacks. It doesn\'t matter which player or planeswalker that creature is attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Piles can be empty. If one of the piles is empty, you choose to put all the revealed cards in your hand or on the bottom of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "When casting a card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this card] only during combat,” must be followed."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "When resolving Jace\'s third ability, you search each player\'s library (including yours) and exile the nonland cards before casting any of them."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards by putting them on the stack one at a time, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "You pick one of your opponents when Jace\'s second ability resolves. The ability doesn\'t target that opponent. All players may see the revealed cards and offer opinions. You (not your opponent) choose which pile is put into your hand and which pile is put on the bottom of your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If that creature deals combat damage to a player at the same time it\'s dealt lethal damage (perhaps because it has trample and was blocked), it will die before the triggered ability resolves and puts +1/+1 counters on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If the target card is no longer in the graveyard when Cremate tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You must be able to target a card in a graveyard to cast Cremate.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If the value chosen for X is larger than the number of cards left in your library, you\'ll lose the game the next time state-based actions are performed."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'A blocking creature is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'A creature dealt damage by Annihilating Fire that dies this turn will be exiled even if it wasn’t the target of Annihilating Fire (say, because the damage was redirected somehow).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'A creature dealt damage by Annihilating Fire will be exiled no matter why the creature would die. It could be destroyed by another spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The creature can still regenerate.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Abilities that change the power of a creature (such as the one of Collective Blessing) affect only creatures on the battlefield. They won’t change a creature spell’s power on the stack.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Essence Backlash can target a creature spell that can’t be countered. If Essence Backlash resolves, it won’t counter the spell but it will still deal damage.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the creature’s power is * and it has an ability defining its power, use that ability to determine its power.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Although the target of the enters-the-battlefield ability must not be a land, lands with the same name as that permanent will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Detention Sphere leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability has resolved, its leaves-the-battlefield ability will trigger and do nothing. Then the enters-the-battlefield ability will resolve and exile the targeted nonland permanent and other permanents with that name indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target when the enters-the-battlefield ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No permanents will be exiled, including those with the same name as the target.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The enters-the-battlefield ability has only one target. The other permanents with that name aren’t targeted. For example, a permanent with protection from white will be exiled if it has the same name as the target nonland permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger when the two creatures enter the battlefield will be put on the stack after the fight, even if one or both creatures die.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Guild Feud has one target: the opponent. You’ll see what creature that player puts onto the battlefield before revealing the top three cards of your library and deciding whether to put a creature onto the battlefield yourself.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If no creatures or only one creature is put onto the battlefield this way, no fight happens.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Players can’t cast spells or activate abilities between the creatures being put onto the battlefield and them fighting each other. Notably, you can’t respond with a spell like Giant Growth.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Applying this redirection effect doesn’t change whether the damage is combat damage.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you control more than one Palisade Giant, you choose which redirection effect to apply. You can’t divide damage dealt by one source. For example, if an attacking creature would deal 8 damage to you and you control two Palisade Giants, you may have that damage dealt to either of the Palisade Giants. You can’t have 4 damage dealt to each Giant or choose to have the 8 damage dealt to you.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Ash Zealot’s ability doesn’t allow any player to cast cards from a graveyard. Such cards need another way to be cast, such as the flashback ability.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Ash Zealot’s ability doesn’t trigger if you put a card onto the battlefield from a graveyard (using Grave Betrayal’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Ash Zealot’s triggered ability will resolve before that spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Avenging Arrow doesn’t affect the damage the creature dealt. It isn’t retroactively prevented.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter what the creature dealt damage to. If the creature dealt damage to another creature or a planeswalker, it doesn’t matter whether that creature or planeswalker is still on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Axebane Guardian’s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. The number of creatures with defender you control is counted, and the color(s) of mana produced chosen, immediately after the ability is activated when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Bazaar Krovod’s ability can target an attacking creature that’s untapped (such as one with vigilance).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t cause it to stop attacking or remove it from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Blistercoil Weird will get +1/+1 and untap before that instant or sorcery spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Blistercoil Weird will get +1/+1 even if the instant or sorcery spell is countered or if Blistercoil Weird is untapped when its ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you copy an instant or sorcery spell on the stack (using Nivix Guildmage’s second ability, for example), the copy isn’t cast. Blistercoil Weird’s ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Chaos Imps will have trample if it has any +1/+1 counter on it, not just the one put on it by the unleash ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A creature with unleash can’t block if it has any +1/+1 counter on it, not just one put on it by the unleash ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Putting a +1/+1 counter on a creature with unleash that’s already blocking won’t remove it from combat. It will continue to block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The unleash ability applies no matter where the creature is entering the battlefield from.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You make the choice to have the creature with unleash enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter or not as it’s entering the battlefield. At that point, it’s too late for a player to respond to the creature spell by trying to counter it, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Chronic Flooding becoming attached to a tapped land won’t cause its ability to immediately trigger. That land must go from untapped to tapped.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Chronic Flooding’s ability will trigger whenever the enchanted land becomes tapped for any reason, not just because its controller taps it for mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Civic Saber’s bonus can range from +0/+0 (for a colorless creature) to +5/+0 (for a creature that’s all five colors).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the equipped creature becomes a different number of colors, the bonus will change accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Cryptborn Horror cares about the total life lost, not necessarily what an opponent’s life total is compared to what it was at the beginning of the turn. For example, if an opponent loses 5 life and then gains 10 life on the turn Cryptborn Horror enters the battlefield, it will enter with five +1/+1 counters on it.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If no opponent has lost life on the turn Cryptborn Horror enters the battlefield, it will enter with no +1/+1 counters on it and be put into its owner’s graveyard (unless something else is raising its toughness).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'In multiplayer games, life lost the turn Cryptborn Horror enters the battlefield by opponents who left the game later that turn will count toward the value of X.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Remember, damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life (unless the source has infect).'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Dark Revenant’s ability isn’t optional. However, if Dark Revenant leaves the graveyard before its ability resolves, it won’t be put on top of its owner’s library.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Each Assassin token’s triggered ability will trigger whenever it deals combat damage to any player, including you.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of one of the Assassin creature tokens, the copy will also have the triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Each creature you don’t control that dies causes a delayed triggered ability to trigger at the beginning of the next end step. If there are multiple such abilities, you can put them on the stack in any order. The creatures will return to the battlefield one at a time as each ability resolves. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Grave Betrayal doesn’t overwrite any previous colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another creature type.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature you don’t control dies during the end step, that creature won’t return to the battlefield until the beginning of the next end step.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the creature card leaves the graveyard before the delayed triggered ability resolves, it won’t return to the battlefield. This is also true if the card leaves the graveyard and returns to the graveyard before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply be black. It won’t be both black and colorless.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if more than one player controls a Grave Betrayal and a creature controlled by none of those players dies, each Grave Betrayal will create a delayed triggered ability at the beginning of the next end step. The first such ability to resolve will return the creature. Usually, this will be one controlled by the player furthest from the active player in turn order.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The phrase “with an additional +1/+1 counter on it” means that the creature enters the battlefield with one more +1/+1 counter than it would normally enter the battlefield with. It doesn’t keep any counters it had on it when it died.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Each of your opponents will discard cards, even if some or all of the damage is prevented or redirected.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Skull Rend doesn’t require any targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Effects that state that the enchanted land doesn’t untap during your untap step won’t apply during another player’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The enchanted land untaps at the same time as the active player’s permanents. You can’t choose to not untap it at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Effects that would replace gaining life with another effect won’t apply because it’s impossible for players to gain life.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If an effect says to set a player’s life total to a certain number and that number is higher than the player’s current life total, that part of the effect won’t do anything. (If the number is lower than the player’s current life total, the effect will work as normal.)'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the last ability triggers for each player. Any life loss is applied to the team’s life total. For example, if the team has 30 life, the first ability will cause the player (and thus the team) to lose 15 life and then the second ability will cause the other player (and thus the team) to lose 8 life. The team will end up having 7 life.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that would cause a player to gain life still resolve, but the life-gain part has no effect.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The amount of life lost is calculated when the triggered ability resolves. For example, if a player has 20 life and there are two Havoc Festivals on the battlefield, the first ability will cause that player to lose 10 life and then the second ability will cause that player to lose 5 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Exiling a spell is not the same as countering it, although the spell won’t resolve in both cases. You may exile a spell that can’t be countered.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can exile a copy of an instant or sorcery spell to activate Nivmagus Elemental’s ability if you control the copy.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You exile an instant or sorcery spell you control from the stack, not an instant or sorcery card in any other zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Angel of Serenity leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability has resolved, its leaves-the-battlefield ability will trigger and do nothing. Then the enters-the-battlefield ability will resolve and exile the targeted creatures and/or creature cards indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature targeted by the enters-the-battlefield ability dies before that ability resolves, it will become an illegal target even though it may be a creature card in a graveyard when the ability resolves. It won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose the targets as part of putting the enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack. Because that ability includes “you may,” you choose whether to exile the targets when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose up to three total targets from among other creatures on the battlefield and creature cards in graveyards. You may choose zero targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Izzet Keyrune becomes a creature in a way other than its own activated ability, its last ability will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activating the ability that turns the Keyrune into a creature while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power and/or toughness to another number, but effects that modify power and/or toughness without directly setting them will still apply.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Until the ability that turns the Keyrune into a creature resolves, the Keyrune is colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Pack Rat leaves the battlefield before its activated ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Pack Rat, using Pack Rat’s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Pack Rat’s first ability counts any creature you control with the creature type Rat, not just Pack Rats.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The token will copy Pack Rat’s two abilities. Its power and toughness will be equal to the number of Rats you control (not the number of Rats you controlled when the token entered the battlefield). It will also be able to create copies of itself.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The token won’t copy counters on Pack Rat, nor will it copy other effects that have changed Pack Rat’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Pack Rat. But if any copy effects have affected that Pack Rat, they’re taken into account.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Voidwielder is the only creature on the battlefield, you’ll have to choose it as the target of its ability, although you may choose to not return it to its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If Volatile Rig is dealt damage by multiple sources at the same time (for example, multiple blocking creatures), its first triggered ability will trigger only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If a card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0. For example, a card with mana cost {X}{R} has a converted mana cost of 1, and so on.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You don’t have to find any instant cards in your library, even if they are there.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery card is discarded while Dryad Militant is on the battlefield, abilities that function when a card is discarded (such as madness) still work, even though that card never reaches a graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of a discarded card (such as Chandra Ablaze’s first ability) can find that card in exile.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell destroys Dryad Militant directly (like Murder does), that instant or sorcery card will be put into its owner’s graveyard. However, if an instant or sorcery card deals lethal damage to Dryad Militant, Dryad Militant will remain on the battlefield until the next time state-based actions are checked, which is after the instant or sorcery finishes resolving. The instant or sorcery will be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the controller of the target land has no land cards in their library, all cards from that library will be revealed and put into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the copied spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Sphinx’s Revelation does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the copied spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Nivix Guildmage’s second ability can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell you control, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'When the second ability resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional or alternative costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if you copy a spell that you cast by paying its overload cost, the copy will resolve as though its overload cost had been paid as well.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Assassin’s Strike tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Its controller won’t discard a card.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You must be able to target a creature to cast Assassin’s Strike.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Assassin’s Strike resolves but the creature isn’t destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller will discard a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the discarded card has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it’s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the discarded card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a creature token is 0, unless that token is a copy of another creature, in which case it copies that creature’s mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Dramatic Rescue tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You must be able to target a creature to cast Dramatic Rescue.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Launch Party tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No player will lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you sacrifice an attacking or blocking creature during the declare blockers step, it won’t deal combat damage. If you wait until the combat damage step, but that creature is dealt lethal damage, it’ll be destroyed before you get a chance to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the target land is an illegal target when Survey the Wreckage tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get the creature token.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the target spell is an illegal target when Fall of the Gavel tries to resolve (perhaps because it’s been countered by another spell), Fall of the Gavel won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain 5 life.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You must be able to target a spell to cast Fall of the Gavel.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast Chemister’s Trick with overload, only creatures you don’t control that are on the battlefield when Chemister’s Trick resolves are affected. Creatures that come under another player’s control later in the turn are not.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare attacker’s step, a creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The controller of a creature that attacks if able still chooses which player or planeswalker it attacks.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Casting a spell with overload doesn’t change that spell’s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to pay its overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Note that if the spell with overload is dealing damage, protection from that spell’s color will still prevent that damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Overload doesn’t change when you can cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast Psychic Spiral when there are no cards in your graveyard, you’ll still shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Psychic Spiral won’t be shuffled into your library, and it won’t be counted when determining how many cards the target player puts into their graveyard. It will be put into your graveyard after you follow its instructions.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose a creature token you control as the target, it will be exiled before you populate and you won’t be able to choose that creature to copy.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You must target a creature to cast Trostani’s Judgment. If that creature is an illegal target when Trostani’s Judgment tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t populate.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you control Sphere of Safety, your opponents can choose not to attack with a creature with an ability that says it attacks if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you discard Loxodon Smiter and put it onto the battlefield, you’ve still discarded a card. Abilities that trigger when you discard a card (such as the one from Liliana’s Caress) will still trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you don’t sacrifice Search the City, perhaps because it was destroyed in response to its ability triggering, you won’t take an extra turn.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'To “play a card” is to play that card as a land or cast that card as a spell, whichever is appropriate.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can put only one card into its owner’s hand for each card you play.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Izzet Staticaster’s activated ability has only one target. Other creatures with that name are not targeted. For example, a creature with hexproof will be dealt damage if it has the same name as the target creature.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The name of a creature token is the same as its creature types unless the token is a copy of another creature or the effect that created the token specifically gives it a different name. For example, a 3/3 Centaur creature token is named “Centaur.”'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Jarad’s first ability applies only when Jarad is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The life loss is based on the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'To activate Jarad’s last ability, you must sacrifice two lands. It doesn’t matter what other land types the two lands have, as long as one is a Swamp and one is a Forest. Even if one of the lands you sacrifice is both a Swamp and a Forest, you have to sacrifice another land that is a Swamp or a Forest.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any land with the land type Swamp or Forest, not just ones named Swamp or Forest. For example, you could sacrifice two Overgrown Tombs.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Mana Bloom’s last ability will trigger only if it has no charge counters on it at the beginning of your upkeep. If it has one charge counter on it as your turn begins, you won’t have priority to remove the counter until after this check.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Once you activate the ability of Centaur’s Herald, it’s too late for a player to respond by trying to destroy it or otherwise stop you from sacrificing it.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can only sacrifice Centaur’s Herald once, so it’s not possible to activate its ability more than once.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Only the controller of the enchanted creature can activate the ability that gives it flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Only the controller of the enchanted creature can activate the ability that gives it trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Returning another creature you control to its owner’s hand is optional. You may choose to sacrifice Faerie Impostor, even if you could return a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Shrieking Affliction’s ability will trigger only if an opponent begins their upkeep with one or fewer cards in hand. The ability will check the number of cards in that player’s hand again when it tries to resolve. If that player has two or more cards in hand at that time, that player won’t lose life.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Street Sweeper’s ability is mandatory, but you can choose a land with no Auras attached to it as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The damage dealt by the last ability is equal to Hellhole Flailer’s power when it was last on the battlefield. For example, if it had a +1/+1 counter on it, it will deal 4 damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A creature with unleash can’t block if it has any +1/+1 counter on it, not just one put on it by the unleash ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Putting a +1/+1 counter on a creature with unleash that’s already blocking won’t remove it from combat. It will continue to block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The unleash ability applies no matter where the creature is entering the battlefield from.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You make the choice to have the creature with unleash enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter or not as it’s entering the battlefield. At that point, it’s too late for a player to respond to the creature spell by trying to counter it, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The exchange occurs only if Conjured Currency and the target permanent are both on the battlefield and controlled by different players when the ability resolves. In addition, the target permanent must be one you neither own nor control. If any of these things aren’t true when the ability tries to resolve, the exchange won’t happen and neither permanent will change controllers.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The only legal target for Conjured Currency’s ability is a permanent both owned and controlled by another player, although it doesn’t have to be the same player. For example, a permanent owned by an opponent but controlled by your teammate (or another opponent) could be chosen as the target.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You don’t necessarily have to control Conjured Currency when its ability resolves in order for the exchange to happen. If another player has gained control of Conjured Currency while the ability is on the stack, and a third player controls the target (and you don’t own it), you may choose to have those two players exchange control of the relevant permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The hybrid spells in the Return to Ravnica set are multicolored, even if you cast them with one color of mana.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability will resolve and Pyroconvergence will deal damage before that spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The hybrid spells in the Return to Ravnica set are multicolored, even if you cast them with one color of mana.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You’ll untap Lobber Crew before that spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The nonland permanents will be detained before blockers are chosen. Notably, a creature detained this way can’t block before it is detained.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The two nonland permanents can be controlled by the same opponent or by different opponents.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form “[cost]: [effect].” No one can activate any activated abilities, including mana abilities, of a detained permanent.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature is already attacking or blocking when it’s detained, it won’t be removed from combat. It will continue to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent is detained and later turns into a creature, it won’t be able to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent’s activated ability is on the stack when that permanent is detained, the ability will be unaffected.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The static abilities of a detained permanent still apply. The triggered abilities of a detained permanent can still trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When a player leaves a multiplayer game, any continuous effects with durations that last until that player’s next turn or until a specific point in that turn will last until that turn would have begun. They neither expire immediately nor last indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The number of creatures with defender you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The number of creatures you control is counted only when Chorus of Might resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The second ability of Azor’s Elocutors removes one filibuster counter per source, no matter how much damage that source dealt. For example, if two attacking creatures deal damage to you at the same time, two filibuster counters will be removed.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You’ll only win the game if Azor’s Elocutors has five or more filibuster counters on it when the first ability resolves. For example, if Azor’s Elocutors has four filibuster counters on it and you somehow add another during your main phase, you won’t win the game immediately.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The target opponent will discard X cards even if some or all of the damage dealt by Rakdos’s Return is prevented or redirected.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The two creatures can be controlled by the same opponent or by different opponents.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form “[cost]: [effect].” No one can activate any activated abilities, including mana abilities, of a detained permanent.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature is already attacking or blocking when it’s detained, it won’t be removed from combat. It will continue to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent is detained and later turns into a creature, it won’t be able to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent’s activated ability is on the stack when that permanent is detained, the ability will be unaffected.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The static abilities of a detained permanent still apply. The triggered abilities of a detained permanent can still trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When a player leaves a multiplayer game, any continuous effects with durations that last until that player’s next turn or until a specific point in that turn will last until that turn would have begun. They neither expire immediately nor last indefinitely.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined when the triggered ability resolves. If Wild Beastmaster is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its last known power to determine the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If this creature\'s power is negative as its ability resolves, X is considered to be 0. (This is a change from previous rulings.)"}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'To activate Grove of the Guardian’s second ability you can tap any two untapped creatures you control, including ones you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can’t tap Grove of the Guardian to activate both abilities at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Trostani’s first ability checks the creature’s toughness as it resolves. If that creature has left the battlefield, use its toughness from when it was last on the battlefield. You can’t lose life this way if that creature’s toughness was less than 0.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Use the sacrificed creature’s toughness when it was last on the battlefield to determine the value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Vigilance only matters when Armory Guard is being declared as an attacking creature. If Armory Guard is already attacking, losing control of your only Gate won’t cause Armory Guard to become tapped or to leave combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Worldspine Wurm’s last ability is a triggered ability, not a replacement ability. Players can respond to this ability, for example, by trying to exile Worldspine Wurm from the graveyard before it’s shuffled into a library.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'X is the power of that creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can choose to find just one creature card. If you do, you’ll put that card into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You can leave any cards with that name in the zone they are in. You don’t have to exile them.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose the same creature for both targets. You may also choose two different creatures. This is because the word “target” is used twice.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You may pay {B} only once. The target player will discard a maximum of one card because of Drainpipe Vermin’s ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You must be able to target a creature with flying to cast Aerial Predation.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If the creature with flying is an illegal target when Aerial Predation tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t gain 2 life."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You must choose two different colors. Colorless is not a color.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You must target a land to cast Security Blockade. If that land is an illegal target when Security Blockade tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and won’t enter the battlefield. You won’t get the Knight token.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant. Activating Stonefare Crocodile’s ability more than once during a single turn won’t cause you to gain more life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Casting a spell with overload doesn\'t change that spell\'s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Note that if the spell with overload is dealing damage, protection from that spell\'s color will still prevent that damage."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Overload doesn\'t change when you can cast the spell."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A creature with unleash can’t block if it has any +1/+1 counter on it, not just one put on it by the unleash ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Putting a +1/+1 counter on a creature with unleash that’s already blocking won’t remove it from combat. It will continue to block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The unleash ability applies no matter where the creature is entering the battlefield from.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You make the choice to have the creature with unleash enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter or not as it’s entering the battlefield. At that point, it’s too late for a player to respond to the creature spell by trying to counter it, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form “[cost]: [effect].” No one can activate any activated abilities, including mana abilities, of a detained permanent.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature is already attacking or blocking when it’s detained, it won’t be removed from combat. It will continue to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent is detained and later turns into a creature, it won’t be able to attack or block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent’s activated ability is on the stack when that permanent is detained, the ability will be unaffected.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The static abilities of a detained permanent still apply. The triggered abilities of a detained permanent can still trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When a player leaves a multiplayer game, any continuous effects with durations that last until that player’s next turn or until a specific point in that turn will last until that turn would have begun. They neither expire immediately nor last indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Activating the ability that turns the Keyrune into a creature while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power and/or toughness to another number, but effects that modify power and/or toughness without directly setting them will still apply.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Until the ability that turns the Keyrune into a creature resolves, the Keyrune is colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'As long as Wayfaring Temple is on the battlefield, its first ability will count itself, so it’ll be at least 1/1.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The ability that defines Wayfaring Temple’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Combat damage dealt to creatures or planeswalkers you control won’t be prevented.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, combat damage dealt to your teammate won’t be prevented.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You can cast Druid’s Deliverance even if you don’t control any creature tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Rootborn Defenses affects only creatures you control after populating at the time it resolves. The creature token you create will gain indestructible, but creatures you begin to control later in the turn will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'You must target an artifact or enchantment to cast Sundering Growth. If that artifact or enchantment is an illegal target when Sundering Growth tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t populate.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the new token will work.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose to copy a creature token that’s a copy of another creature, the new creature token will copy the characteristics of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you control no creature tokens when you populate, nothing will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new creature token copies the characteristics of the original token as stated by the effect that put the original token onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The new token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any noncopy effects that have changed its power, toughness, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You can choose any creature token you control for populate. If a spell or ability puts a token onto the battlefield under your control and then instructs you to populate (as Coursers’ Accord does), you may choose to copy the token you just created, or you may choose to copy another creature token you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Casting a spell with overload doesn’t change that spell’s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to pay its overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Note that if the spell with overload is dealing damage, protection from that spell’s color will still prevent that damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Overload doesn’t change when you can cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'An overloaded Dynacharge affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Casting a spell with overload doesn’t change that spell’s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to pay its overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Note that if the spell with overload is dealing damage, protection from that spell’s color will still prevent that damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Overload doesn’t change when you can cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The set of creatures that gets +1/+0 from an overloaded Teleportal is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+0. However, because the second part of Teleportal’s effect doesn’t change the characteristics of any permanents, the set of creatures that can’t be blocked is constantly updated. Any creature you control at the moment blockers are chosen can’t be blocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Casting a spell with overload doesn’t change that spell’s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to pay its overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Note that if the spell with overload is dealing damage, protection from that spell’s color will still prevent that damage.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Overload doesn’t change when you can cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Exiling the creature card with scavenge is part of the cost of activating the scavenge ability. Once the ability is activated and the cost is paid, it’s too late to stop the ability from being activated by trying to remove the creature card from the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Gate is not a basic land type.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The subtype Gate has no special rules significance, but other spells and abilities may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Savage Surge can target an untapped creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you target yourself with this spell, you must reveal your entire hand to the other players just as any other player would.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'A monocolored creature has exactly one color.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Face-down creatures and most artifact creatures are not monocolored.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Because the first ability requires a target, it is not a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the target of any of Deathrite Shaman’s three abilities is an illegal target when that ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t add mana to your mana pool, no opponent will lose life, or you won’t gain life, as appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Defender only matters when Ogre Jailbreaker could be declared as an attacking creature. If Ogre Jailbreaker is already attacking, losing control of your only Gate won’t cause Ogre Jailbreaker to leave combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Each opponent in turn order may choose to sacrifice a creature, even if an opponent already chose to sacrifice a creature that combat. Desecration Demon will have a maximum of one +1/+1 counter put on it each combat, no matter how many creatures were sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Players won’t know which player or planeswalker Desecration Demon will attack, if any, when deciding whether to sacrifice a creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'Two Goblin Electromancers will make instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {2} less to cast, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Goblin Electromancer\'s effect reduces only generic mana in the spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate Tavern Swindler\'s ability if your life total is less than 3. You can activate it if your life total is exactly 3, but it\'s probably a bad idea. You\'ll lose the game before the ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hypersonic Dragon’s last ability applies to sorcery cards in any zone, provided something is allowing you to cast them. For example, you could cast a sorcery with flashback as though it had flash.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hypersonic Dragon’s last ability has no effect on abilities that you can activate “any time you could cast a sorcery.”'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with twice that many instead.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you control two Corpsejack Menaces, the number of +1/+1 counters put on a creature is four times the original number. Three Corpsejack Menaces multiplies the original number by eight, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If Rest in Peace is destroyed by a spell, Rest in Peace will be exiled and then the spell will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a card is discarded while Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that function when a card is discarded (such as madness) still work, even though that card never reaches a graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of a discarded card (such as Chandra Ablaze\'s first ability) can find that card in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "While Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that trigger whenever a creature dies won\'t trigger because cards and tokens are never put into a player\'s graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Knightly Valor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You need a creature for Knightly Valor to target as you cast it. There’s no way to have it enter the battlefield attached to the Knight token it’ll create.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts this land onto the battlefield tapped, you may pay 2 life, but it still enters tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Unlike most dual lands, this land has two basic land types. It\'s not basic, so cards such as District Guide can\'t find it, but it does have the appropriate land types for effects such as that of Drowned Catacomb (from the Ixalan set)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'As Slum Reaper’s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If any player controls no creatures, that player simply doesn’t sacrifice anything. Each other player still sacrifices a creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Slum Reaper may be the creature its controller sacrifices for its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of Cyclonic Rift, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If you choose the last mode, you draw two cards and discard two cards all while Izzet Charm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose the target of Codex Shredder\'s last ability before paying its costs, so you can\'t return Codex Shredder to your hand this way."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an opponent lost life and subsequently lost the game, Rakdos\'s first ability is satisfied, and its last ability counts that loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If there are additional costs to cast a creature spell, such as a kicker cost or the commander tax, apply those increases before applying cost reductions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Rakdos can be put onto the battlefield by another spell or ability even if no opponent has lost life that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Rakdos\'s last ability can\'t reduce the colored mana requirement of a creature spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Rakdos\'s last ability cares about the total life lost, not necessarily what an opponent\'s life total is compared to what it was at the beginning of the turn. For example, if an opponent loses 5 life and then gains 10 life in a turn, creature spells you cast will cost {5} less to cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Rakdos\'s last ability won\'t reduce the cost to cast Rakdos itself. It applies only to creature spells you cast once Rakdos is on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Abrupt Decay. When that spell or ability resolves, Abrupt Decay won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Ethereal Armor counts each enchantment you control, including itself and any Auras you control that are attached to an opponent or to permanents controlled by an opponent.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast a card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast it, it will be put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'When casting an instant or sorcery card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards one at a time, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Rakdos\' Rückkehr", \'text\': "Rakdos\' Rückkehr fügt einem Gegner deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu. Dieser Spieler wirft X Karten ab.", \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als Fürst Rakdos aus seinem Schlummer erwachte, begannen für alle anderen die Albträume.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53846279-5c79-44e2-8417-d5e597c36802\', \'multiverseId\': 355924}, \'multiverseid\': 355924}, {\'name\': \'Regreso de Rakdos\', \'text\': \'El Regreso de Rakdos hace X puntos de daño al oponente objetivo. Ese jugador descarta X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el Señor Rakdos despertó de su sueño, comenzó la pesadilla de todos los demás.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de47310b-6e43-4a5a-9713-c846dfc75b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 365646}, \'multiverseid\': 365646}, {\'name\': \'Retour de Rakdos\', \'text\': "Le Retour de Rakdos inflige X blessures à l\'adversaire ciblé. Ce joueur se défausse de X cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Quand le seigneur Rakdos sortit de son sommeil, le cauchemar de tous les autres commença.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356198&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c2d358b-978f-4e6e-bf17-6b8beb5b8203\', \'multiverseId\': 356198}, \'multiverseid\': 356198}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno di Rakdos\', \'text\': \'Il Ritorno di Rakdos infligge X danni a un avversario bersaglio. Quel giocatore scarta X carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Quando Rakdos si risvegliò dal suo sonno, iniziò l\'incubo per tutti gli altri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa068f9-2d41-413e-adfa-0ab556819641\', \'multiverseId\': 356472}, \'multiverseid\': 356472}, {\'name\': \'ラクドスの復活\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。ラクドスの復活はそのプレイヤーにＸ点のダメージを与える。そのプレイヤーはカードをＸ枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大いなるラクドスが眠りから覚めたときから、皆の悪夢が始まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d4d64b8-ece6-4670-a59e-5ef4ddb59269\', \'multiverseId\': 356746}, \'multiverseid\': 356746}, {\'name\': \'락도스의 귀환\', \'text\': \'상대 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 락도스의 귀환은 그 상대에게 피해 X점을 입힌다. 그 플레이어는 카드 X장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'락도스가 잠에서 깨어났을 때부터 다른 모든 이의 악몽이 시작됐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099f7238-bc80-48e6-a6f8-6730808f7fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 357568}, \'multiverseid\': 357568}, {\'name\': \'Retorno de Rakdos\', \'text\': \'Retorno de Rakdos causa X pontos de dano ao oponente alvo. Aquele jogador descarta X cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o Senhor Rakdos despertou de seu sono, o pesadelo de todos começou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf9d407-c171-456f-85f5-fd497577b936\', \'multiverseId\': 357020}, \'multiverseid\': 357020}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение Ракдоса\', \'text\': \'Возвращение Ракдоса наносит Х повреждений целевому оппоненту. Тот игрок сбрасывает Х карт.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда Владыка Ракдос очнулся ото сна, у всех остальных начались кошмары.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'121b63ee-894d-4713-a8ea-8d03f50da952\', \'multiverseId\': 355376}, \'multiverseid\': 355376}, {\'name\': \'拉铎司再现\', \'text\': \'拉铎司再现向目标对手造成X点伤害。该牌手弃X张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'当拉铎司领主从梦中醒来，就开始了所有人的梦魇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a92476-b8e4-4bc6-bef3-ef1fd3d08e66\', \'multiverseId\': 357294}, \'multiverseid\': 357294}, {\'name\': \'拉鐸司再現\', \'text\': \'拉鐸司再現向目標對手造成X點傷害。該玩家棄X張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'當拉鐸司領主從夢中醒來，就開始了所有人的夢魘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ba7691f-63ae-4dc2-a1d0-777bda8e1185\', \'multiverseId\': 355650}, \'multiverseid\': 355650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist verboten. Die Frage nach dem Warum ist irrelevant." —Sergiu, Opalsee-Magistrat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023607af-808d-4f25-919c-86222222a392\', \'multiverseId\': 355767}, \'multiverseid\': 355767}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Está prohibido. El por qué es irrelevante." —Sergiu, magistrado del Lago Ópalo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aee34f5-ac79-4ee8-b53f-8a536b21265a\', \'multiverseId\': 365489}, \'multiverseid\': 365489}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est interdit. Inutile de demander pourquoi. » —Sergiu, magistrat du Lac d\'opale", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356041&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ed60783-21f0-4362-9233-fd1a168745eb\', \'multiverseId\': 356041}, \'multiverseid\': 356041}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È proibito. Chiedere perché è irrilevante." —Sergiu, magistrato del Lago Opale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'260200db-8509-4f0f-bde6-bf31e6bf4c70\', \'multiverseId\': 356315}, \'multiverseid\': 356315}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「それは禁止だ。理由を訊いてどうする。」 ――オパール湖の行政官、サージョ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7383bb27-a962-48f5-8297-98de42072e59\', \'multiverseId\': 356589}, \'multiverseid\': 356589}, {\'name\': \'주문 취소\', \'text\': \'주문 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"금지 사항이다. 이유를 묻는 건 부질없는 짓이다." —오팔 호수의 치안 판사 세르지우\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'874734bb-9fef-4fde-afef-ea47fef5d222\', \'multiverseId\': 357411}, \'multiverseid\': 357411}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"É proibido. Perguntar o porquê é irrelevante." — Sergiu, magistrado do Lago de Opala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40a0424-0517-4a70-a713-7ad43e114df1\', \'multiverseId\': 356863}, \'multiverseid\': 356863}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Это запрещено. Нет смысла узнавать причины». — Сержиу, магистрат Опалового озера\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31320ff-8c7c-4e8e-94c1-edca3b1c9df1\', \'multiverseId\': 355219}, \'multiverseid\': 355219}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这不被允许。不需要问为什么。」 ～清辉湖执政官瑟久\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5543ef-9fd3-4b75-ac43-a8232b309a15\', \'multiverseId\': 357137}, \'multiverseid\': 357137}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這不被允許。不需要問為什麼。」 ～清輝湖執政官瑟久\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0938e154-f150-42bf-ae54-d964297878ab\', \'multiverseId\': 355493}, \'multiverseid\': 355493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abflussrohr-Ungeziefer\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Abflussrohr-Ungeziefer stirbt, kannst du {B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, wirft ein Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Zeiten hart sind, essen die Armen Ratten. Wenn die Zeiten noch härter werden, fressen die Ratten die Armen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355802&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c836ce-b809-42ca-a2e0-7f0506f72081\', \'multiverseId\': 355802}, \'multiverseid\': 355802}, {\'name\': \'Alimaña del drenaje\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Alimaña del drenaje muera, puedes pagar {B}. Si lo haces, el jugador objetivo descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando corren malos tiempos, los pobres se comen a las ratas. Cuando corren tiempos aún peores, las ratas se comen a los pobres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb3091bd-7b12-4ad1-883d-b820e8c42721\', \'multiverseId\': 365524}, \'multiverseid\': 365524}, {\'name\': \'Vermine des évacuations\', \'text\': "Quand la Vermine des évacuations meurt, vous pouvez payer {B}. Si vous faites ainsi, le joueur ciblé se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : rat\', \'flavor\': \'Quand les temps sont durs, les pauvres mangent du rat. Quand ils sont encore plus durs, les rats mangent du pauvre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'604041c9-cf69-4287-88a8-5de1d37a4e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 356076}, \'multiverseid\': 356076}, {\'name\': \'Parassita del Canale di Scolo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Parassita del Canale di Scolo muore, puoi pagare {B}. Se lo fai, un giocatore bersaglio scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'In tempi difficili, i poveri mangiano i ratti. In tempi ancora più difficili, i ratti mangiano i poveri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceb693ba-4b86-4ae1-adca-4626c4247825\', \'multiverseId\': 356350}, \'multiverseid\': 356350}, {\'name\': \'下水の害獣\', \'text\': \'下水の害獣が死亡したとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは{B}を支払ってもよい。そうした場合、そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'厳しい時代になると、貧民はネズミを食べる。さらに厳しい時代になると、ネズミが貧民を食べる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f152ed1c-00f6-4095-b70a-e3373e6e9c02\', \'multiverseId\': 356624}, \'multiverseid\': 356624}, {\'name\': \'배수관 쥐\', \'text\': \'배수관 쥐가 죽을 때, 당신은 {B}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 쥐\', \'flavor\': \'힘든 시절에는 가난한 이들이 쥐를 잡아먹는다. 더 힘든 시절에는 쥐가 가난한 이들을 잡아먹는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b23ef20-21b2-419e-9a7f-0158fa221ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 357446}, \'multiverseid\': 357446}, {\'name\': \'Ratazana de Esgoto\', \'text\': \'Quando Ratazana de Esgoto morre, você pode pagar {B}. Se fizer isso, o jogador alvo descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rato\', \'flavor\': \'Em épocas difíceis, os pobres comem os ratos. Nas épocas mais difíceis, os ratos comem os pobres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff18abf2-f86b-427d-b6f1-62f486686ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 356898}, \'multiverseid\': 356898}, {\'name\': \'Водосточный Вредитель\', \'text\': \'Когда Водосточный Вредитель умирает, вы можете заплатить {B}. Если вы это делаете, целевой игрок сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Крыса\', \'flavor\': \'В тяжелые времена бедняки едят крыс. Во времена же более тяжкие крысы едят бедняков.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c4f5f85-2859-4892-bec5-f03ac78eaf51\', \'multiverseId\': 355254}, \'multiverseid\': 355254}, {\'name\': \'排水管病媒\', \'text\': \'当排水管病媒死去时，你可以支付{B}。若你如此作，则目标牌手弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'时局艰难时，穷人吃老鼠。时局更加艰难时，老鼠吃穷人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'521ce330-29e1-42fb-b14a-02c08fd976f0\', \'multiverseId\': 357172}, \'multiverseid\': 357172}, {\'name\': \'排水管病媒\', \'text\': \'當排水管病媒死去時，你可以支付{B}。若你如此作，則目標玩家棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'時局艱難時，窮人吃老鼠。時局更加艱難時，老鼠吃窮人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f791da2-1891-4dbd-b048-c962e05d15e8\', \'multiverseId\': 355528}, \'multiverseid\': 355528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkommen der Renner\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen 3/3 grünen Zentauren-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel, und führe dann Bevölkern durch. (Bringe einen Spielstein ins Spiel, der eine Kopie eines Kreaturenspielsteins ist, den du kontrollierst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Düstere Gerüchte kamen Trostani zu Ohren. Sie verfügte, dass niemand allein reisen solle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dff3c55-30dc-4c5a-b67f-a9d500216f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 355890}, \'multiverseid\': 355890}, {\'name\': \'Acuerdo de cazadores\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Centauro verde 3/3, luego repuebla. (Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha que es una copia de una ficha de criatura que controlas.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Rumores sombríos llegaron a oídos de Trostani. Decretó que nadie debía viajar en solitario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03e08f9-b105-4c6c-a442-7f3a202d7011\', \'multiverseId\': 365612}, \'multiverseid\': 365612}, {\'name\': \'Accord des coursiers\', \'text\': "Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Centaure, puis peuplez. (Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton qui est une copie d\'un jeton de créature que vous contrôlez.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Des rumeurs inquiétantes atteignirent les oreilles de Trostani. Elle décréta que plus personne ne devait voyager seul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4870996-bebe-4622-9e43-352a846ce7a2\', \'multiverseId\': 356164}, \'multiverseid\': 356164}, {\'name\': \'Accordo dei Corsieri\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Centauro 3/3 verde, poi popola. (Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina che è una copia di una pedina creatura che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Dicerie inquietanti raggiunsero l\'orecchio di Trostani. Decretò che nessuno avrebbe dovuto viaggiare da solo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515d8adb-8844-4115-a067-5bfbf524944c\', \'multiverseId\': 356438}, \'multiverseid\': 356438}, {\'name\': \'狩猟者の協定\', \'text\': \'緑の３/３のケンタウルス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出し、その後居住を行う。（あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー・トークン１体のコピーであるトークンを１体戦場に出す。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'うすら寒い噂がトロスターニの耳に届いた。彼女は決してひとりで出歩かぬようにとの命令を発した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd365ff5-fa43-419e-a26c-31d8af1e050d\', \'multiverseId\': 356712}, \'multiverseid\': 356712}, {\'name\': \'군마들의 합의\', \'text\': \'3/3 녹색 켄타우로스 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓은 후, 소집한다. (당신이 조종하는 어느 생물 토큰의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'절망적인 소문을 듣게 된 트로스타니는 아무도 혼자 돌아다니지 말라는 지시를 내렸다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9ad3d9-5d61-4ac4-97b5-de7068fa0bda\', \'multiverseId\': 357534}, \'multiverseid\': 357534}, {\'name\': \'Acordo dos Caçadores\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Centauro e depois povoe. (Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha que seja uma cópia de uma ficha de criatura que você controla.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Rumores desoladores chegaram aos ouvidos de Trostani. Ela decretou que ninguém deveria viajar sozinho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a6e995-9ae4-437b-b704-4ffa918b70e6\', \'multiverseId\': 356986}, \'multiverseid\': 356986}, {\'name\': \'Договор Скакунов\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Кентавр, затем используйте Заселение. (Положите на поле битвы одну фишку, являющуюся копией фишки существа под вашим контролем.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Мрачные слухи дошли до Тростани. Она запретила кому бы то ни было путешествовать в одиночку.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3a7aac-0245-4d16-8dd8-f5f7217538ac\', \'multiverseId\': 355342}, \'multiverseid\': 355342}, {\'name\': \'骏马相随\', \'text\': \'将一个3/3绿色半人马衍生生物放进战场，然后殖民。（将一个衍生物放进战场，此衍生物为由你操控的某衍生生物之复制品。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'令人忧心的谣言已传入卓塔妮耳中。她下令任何人不得单独出行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8b4721e-9040-4536-a73f-dac2a1f497b9\', \'multiverseId\': 357260}, \'multiverseid\': 357260}, {\'name\': \'駿馬相隨\', \'text\': \'將一個3/3綠色半人馬衍生生物放進戰場，然後殖民。（將一個衍生物放進戰場，此衍生物為由你操控的某衍生生物之複製品。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'令人憂心的謠言已傳入卓塔妮耳中。她下令任何人不得單獨出行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'657d78fe-f297-4c1d-91e4-51a55d8e8035\', \'multiverseId\': 355616}, \'multiverseid\': 355616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abrupter Verfall\', \'text\': \'Der Abrupte Verfall kann nicht von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten neutralisiert werden.\\nZerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und deren umgewandelten Manakosten 3 oder weniger betragen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Izzet änderten rasch ihre Gepflogenheit, lebenslange Garantien zu gewähren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b423070-02ac-49a1-ad79-62c51ec56df1\', \'multiverseId\': 355877}, \'multiverseid\': 355877}, {\'name\': \'Deterioro brusco\', \'text\': \'Deterioro brusco no puede ser contrarrestado por hechizos o habilidades.\\nDestruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los ízzet no tardaron en suspender su política de garantías de por vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff5c5d3e-6ada-4130-9d46-98e10dc1dbb5\', \'multiverseId\': 365599}, \'multiverseid\': 365599}, {\'name\': \'Décomposition abrupte\', \'text\': \'La Décomposition abrupte ne peut pas être contrecarrée par des sorts ou des capacités.\\nDétruisez le permanent non-terrain ciblé ayant un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les Izzet réagirent en mettant un terme abrupt à leur système d\'assurances à vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356151&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6754c11-eb6e-46c1-82e9-075c6c8ae4ec\', \'multiverseId\': 356151}, \'multiverseid\': 356151}, {\'name\': \'Deterioramento Improvviso\', \'text\': \'Il Deterioramento Improvviso non può essere neutralizzato da magie o abilità.\\nDistruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Izzet abbandonarono prontamente la loro politica di fornire garanzie a vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa00826e-6c0e-45f0-8434-c52bbca4e96b\', \'multiverseId\': 356425}, \'multiverseid\': 356425}, {\'name\': \'突然の衰微\', \'text\': \'突然の衰微は呪文や能力によって打ち消されない。\\n点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下の土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'イゼット団は直ちに生涯保証のポリシーを撤回した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46a81e1-369d-4356-9916-1e4510c56f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 356699}, \'multiverseid\': 356699}, {\'name\': \'갑작스런 부패\', \'text\': \'갑작스런 부패는 주문이나 능력에 의해 무효화될 수 없다.\\n대지가 아닌 지속물 중 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 지속물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'이젯 길드는 즉시 평생 보장 제도를 철회했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aad8e5a-e5a9-4b27-811a-3f317570b279\', \'multiverseId\': 357521}, \'multiverseid\': 357521}, {\'name\': \'Degeneração Abrupta\', \'text\': \'Denegeração Abrupta não pode ser anulada por mágicas nem habilidades.\\nDestrua a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os Izzet suspenderam rapidamente a política de garantia vitalícia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67178820-6866-4187-9329-c4001c899f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 356973}, \'multiverseid\': 356973}, {\'name\': \'Внезапный Распад\', \'text\': \'Внезапный Распад не может быть отменен заклинаниями или способностями.\\nУничтожьте целевой перманент, не являющийся землей, с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Иззеты очень быстро прекратили выдавать пожизненную гарантию.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a57f068-115c-43f9-b3b8-d6307b6f18e1\', \'multiverseId\': 355329}, \'multiverseid\': 355329}, {\'name\': \'突发衰败\', \'text\': \'突发衰败不能被咒语或异能反击。\\n消灭目标非地永久物，且其总法术力费用等于或小于3。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'伊捷联盟很快停止了他们的终生保证政策。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28bed9d5-4841-4f27-a442-bad0b480806d\', \'multiverseId\': 357247}, \'multiverseid\': 357247}, {\'name\': \'突發衰敗\', \'text\': \'突發衰敗不能被咒語或異能反擊。\\n消滅目標非地永久物，且其總魔法力費用等於或小於3。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'伊捷聯盟很快停止了他們的終生保證政策。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f57a591-1957-4232-a0c8-510ea124ccd6\', \'multiverseId\': 355603}, \'multiverseid\': 355603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abschussfeier\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um die Abschussfeier zu wirken.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Leben ist zu kurz, um auf die Dinge zu verzichten, die du liebst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e841cb-be9d-4570-bd92-8143c9454a66\', \'multiverseId\': 355805}, \'multiverseid\': 355805}, {\'name\': \'Fiesta de lanzamiento\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar la Fiesta de lanzamiento sacrifica una criatura.\\nDestruye la criatura objetivo. Su controlador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La vida es demasiado corta como para no hacer lo que más te gusta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6083c5ab-01b3-49b6-9cb6-00ff49e3e06f\', \'multiverseId\': 365527}, \'multiverseid\': 365527}, {\'name\': \'Faire le lancement\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer Faire le lancement, sacrifiez une créature.\\nDétruisez la créature ciblée. Son contrôleur perd 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La vie est trop courte pour ne pas faire ce qu\'on aime.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbdd8ba7-31e7-45a2-9a85-bff6892eb34e\', \'multiverseId\': 356079}, \'multiverseid\': 356079}, {\'name\': \'Festa di Lancio\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare la Festa di Lancio, sacrifica una creatura.\\nDistruggi una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La vita è troppo breve per non dedicarti alle cose che ami.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba9b2ee2-b6a3-4861-9607-14d157ef78ba\', \'multiverseId\': 356353}, \'multiverseid\': 356353}, {\'name\': \'打ち上げ\', \'text\': \'打ち上げを唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'短い生涯、好きなことをやらずにいられるものか。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ff560c-10b8-462e-98b6-c2f508cd3197\', \'multiverseId\': 356627}, \'multiverseid\': 356627}, {\'name\': \'죽여주는 잔치\', \'text\': \'죽여주는 잔치를 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 그 생물의 조종자는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'좋아하는 일을 하지 않기에는 인생이 너무 짧다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3192f81-a9fe-4ea4-ba38-98f1d67690c0\', \'multiverseId\': 357449}, \'multiverseid\': 357449}, {\'name\': \'Festa de Lançamento\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Festa de Lançamento, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nDestrua a criatura alvo. Seu controlador perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A vida é curta demais para não fazer as coisas que você ama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249b81ea-288c-4127-bc01-f7609ce3c5d2\', \'multiverseId\': 356901}, \'multiverseid\': 356901}, {\'name\': \'Торжественный Запуск\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Торжественного Запуска пожертвуйте существо.\\nУничтожьте целевое существо. Контролирующий его игрок теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Жизнь слишком коротка для того, чтобы не делать вещи, которые любишь делать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57773b1d-51ca-4cc5-a32d-809cbeff2ea6\', \'multiverseId\': 355257}, \'multiverseid\': 355257}, {\'name\': \'召开派对\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放召开派对的额外费用。\\n消灭目标生物。其操控者失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'人生苦短，及时行乐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7d1518-b319-43e1-b79d-31d39118f6fd\', \'multiverseId\': 357175}, \'multiverseid\': 357175}, {\'name\': \'召開派對\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放召開派對的額外費用。\\n消滅目標生物。其操控者失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'人生苦短，及時行樂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc377a8-0314-43c9-8ba7-c82bde51d6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 355531}, \'multiverseid\': 355531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absichernde Sperre\', \'text\': \'Landverzauberung\\nWenn die Absichernde Sperre ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit ins Spiel.\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „{T}: Verhindere den nächsten 1 Schadenspunkt, der dir in diesem Zug zugefügt würde."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355756&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5502f95-cab5-4d88-878e-0cbfb5f437cc\', \'multiverseId\': 355756}, \'multiverseid\': 355756}, {\'name\': \'Bloqueo de seguridad\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nCuando el Bloqueo de seguridad entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "{T}: Prevén el siguiente 1 punto de daño que se te fuera a hacer este turno".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5043255-3662-41d3-afcf-04e0c747ef7c\', \'multiverseId\': 365478}, \'multiverseid\': 365478}, {\'name\': \'Blocus de sécurité\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nQuand le Blocus de sécurité arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\\nLe terrain enchanté a « {T} : Prévenez la prochaine 1 blessure qui devrait vous être infligée ce tour-ci. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec730ec6-fcc6-4cef-8e5b-ae1717896fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 356030}, \'multiverseid\': 356030}, {\'name\': \'Posto di Blocco\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nQuando il Posto di Blocco entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.\\nLa terra incantata ha "{T}: Previeni il prossimo 1 danno che ti verrebbe inflitto in questo turno".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c265d650-d7c8-4951-9077-b73b556aa16d\', \'multiverseId\': 356304}, \'multiverseid\': 356304}, {\'name\': \'封鎖作戦\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\n封鎖作戦が戦場に出たとき、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\nエンチャントされている土地は「{T}：このターン、次にあなたに与えられるダメージを１点軽減する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020cbc0f-ff9c-4215-b422-3fb6364557a8\', \'multiverseId\': 356578}, \'multiverseid\': 356578}, {\'name\': \'보안 봉쇄\', \'text\': \'대지에게 부여\\n보안 봉쇄가 전장에 들어올 때, 경계 능력을 가진 2/2 백색 기사 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\\n부여된 대지는 "{T}: 이 턴에 다음으로 당신이 입을 피해 1점을 방지한다."라는 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08dfd7d5-5a27-4c84-8aae-68594291d255\', \'multiverseId\': 357400}, \'multiverseid\': 357400}, {\'name\': \'Bloqueio de Segurança\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nQuando Bloqueio de Segurança entrar no campo de batalha, coloque uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Cavaleiro com vigilância no campo de batalha.\\nO terreno encantado tem "{T}: Previna o próximo 1 ponto de dano que seria causado a você neste turno."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c05c657-6378-4c3d-a339-16a016d7200e\', \'multiverseId\': 356852}, \'multiverseid\': 356852}, {\'name\': \'Блокада Безопасности\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nКогда Блокада Безопасности выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь с Бдительностью.\\nЗачарованная земля имеет способность «{T}: предотвратите следующее 1 повреждение, которое должно быть нанесено вам в этом ходу».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4818abb-8c95-4e73-b856-7c7e25590eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 355208}, \'multiverseid\': 355208}, {\'name\': \'维安封锁\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n当维安封锁进战场时，将一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物放进战场。\\n所结附的地具有「{T}：于本回合中，防止接下来将对你造成的1点伤害。」\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea118ff8-ab3c-4f2e-a020-0472639af67b\', \'multiverseId\': 357126}, \'multiverseid\': 357126}, {\'name\': \'維安封鎖\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n當維安封鎖進戰場時，將一個2/2白色，具警戒異能的騎士衍生生物放進戰場。\\n所結附的地具有「{T}：於本回合中，防止接下來將對你造成的1點傷害。」\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d2635e-8d52-488d-bfdb-083f8bc9a2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 355482}, \'multiverseid\': 355482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aggressiver Minotaurus\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Im Verhüttungsdistrikt haben viele eine Heimat gefunden, die mit den Gilden nichts am Hut haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a65f5d3-021a-4f24-be07-267ebdb467a8\', \'multiverseId\': 355836}, \'multiverseid\': 355836}, {\'name\': \'Agresor minotauro\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'El distrito de las fundiciones es hogar de muchos que al mirar a los diez gremios dicen "no es para mí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2f4a41-8ab4-4a60-a868-0c99b800abb9\', \'multiverseId\': 365558}, \'multiverseid\': 365558}, {\'name\': \'Agresseur minotaure\', \'text\': \'Initiative, célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Le quartier des fonderies abrite nombre de résidents qui ne sont pas intéressés par les guildes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ed2e05-5ac5-42f7-ab49-ef78c76d1a2f\', \'multiverseId\': 356110}, \'multiverseid\': 356110}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro Aggressivo\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Il distretto della fusione è la casa di quelli che guardando alle gilde pensano: "Non fanno per me."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e20dae6-8109-46b1-9a55-1298ac19f53d\', \'multiverseId\': 356384}, \'multiverseid\': 356384}, {\'name\': \'ミノタウルスの攻め手\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'精錬地区はギルドを見て合わないと感じた多くの者達の根城である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9419466-6eac-4b6a-9f97-e73fd9974ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 356658}, \'multiverseid\': 356658}, {\'name\': \'공격적인 미노타우로스\', \'text\': \'선제공격, 신속\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 광전사\', \'flavor\': \'제련 지구에는 길드 생활이 자신에게 맞지 않는다고 생각하는 자들이 많이 살고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f68d1127-91c0-43d9-a0f1-d355e5781f96\', \'multiverseId\': 357480}, \'multiverseid\': 357480}, {\'name\': \'Agressor Minotauro\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Amoque\', \'flavor\': \'O distrito das fundições é lar de muitos que olham para as dez guildas e dizem "isso não é para mim".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d9c6f6-58ab-46d8-b14d-21019072d02f\', \'multiverseId\': 356932}, \'multiverseid\': 356932}, {\'name\': \'Минотавр-Агрессор\', \'text\': \'Первый удар, Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Берсерк\', \'flavor\': \'В районе плавильщиков живут те, кто не хочет вступать ни в одну из гильдий.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78db166f-1e61-4c33-aab4-d8a98228338d\', \'multiverseId\': 355288}, \'multiverseid\': 355288}, {\'name\': \'侵略牛头怪\', \'text\': \'先攻，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'矿石提炼区是不愿加入公会者的居所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37582872-74a6-4fb2-8b49-fb02cb0754b6\', \'multiverseId\': 357206}, \'multiverseid\': 357206}, {\'name\': \'侵略牛頭怪\', \'text\': \'先攻，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': \'礦石提煉區是不願加入公會者的居所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4dec9e-5461-41b7-bb8b-c4d11461b961\', \'multiverseId\': 355562}, \'multiverseid\': 355562}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschwellende Wildheit\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe diese Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Gruul-Kriegern braucht man nicht vom Krieg vorzuschwärmen. Man muss ihnen nur zeigen, wo es zur Schlacht geht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa560e37-a459-4af6-971b-7b0a759d0692\', \'multiverseId\': 355869}, \'multiverseid\': 355869}, {\'name\': \'Oleada salvaje\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los guerreros gruul nunca deben ser incitados a combatir. Sólo necesitan que se les muestre dónde está la batalla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1276dfcf-1370-425c-aa17-c0357d7aaa1f\', \'multiverseId\': 365591}, \'multiverseid\': 365591}, {\'name\': \'Déferlement sauvage\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Inutile d\'argumenter avec des guerriers Gruul pour qu\'ils se battent. Il suffit de leur indiquer où a lieu le combat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a139bd-eab7-4754-811e-3fc9f9c4584a\', \'multiverseId\': 356143}, \'multiverseid\': 356143}, {\'name\': \'Slancio Selvaggio\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I guerrieri Gruul non hanno mai bisogno di essere incitati alla battaglia. Hanno solo bisogno che venga loro mostrato dov\'è la battaglia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a0da903-129f-482e-92c0-bfae986560ab\', \'multiverseId\': 356417}, \'multiverseid\': 356417}, {\'name\': \'蛮族の血気\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'グルールの戦士には戦闘の準備は必要ない。グルールの戦士に必要なのは、戦闘のありかだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55980312-656c-4936-a958-c46258033c23\', \'multiverseId\': 356691}, \'multiverseid\': 356691}, {\'name\': \'맹렬한 격동\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 그 생물을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'그룰 전사들은 나가 싸우라고 독려할 필요가 없다. 싸움터가 어느 쪽인지 보여주기만 하면 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51a4344b-d082-42d7-9ac9-da26a0141fde\', \'multiverseId\': 357513}, \'multiverseid\': 357513}, {\'name\': \'Surto Selvagem\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os guerreiros Gruul jamais precisam ser instigados para entrar numa batalha. Eles só precisam que lhes digam onde está a batalha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f653490-13c2-4f9c-828b-7f1c17ac71e6\', \'multiverseId\': 356965}, \'multiverseid\': 356965}, {\'name\': \'Дикий Всплеск\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода. Разверните то существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Груульских воинов не надо подталкивать в битву. Им надо только показать, где она происходит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e18e8f8e-e0ea-4bfe-82d7-d4b2776495b9\', \'multiverseId\': 355321}, \'multiverseid\': 355321}, {\'name\': \'凶蛮翻腾\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。重置该生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'古鲁战士从不需要激励作战士气。只要告诉他们上哪里打仗就行了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11435608-b54d-4442-ba2a-7ec325cf6080\', \'multiverseId\': 357239}, \'multiverseid\': 357239}, {\'name\': \'凶蠻翻騰\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。重置該生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'古魯戰士從不需要激勵作戰士氣。只要告訴他們上哪裡打仗就行了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a8ccd5-3892-449f-a48b-2825433ade64\', \'multiverseId\': 355595}, \'multiverseid\': 355595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aquagaul\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Im Wasser bewegt er sich elegant wie ein Delfin. Doch an Land ist sein Gang so ruckartig und unberechenbar, dass nur wenige Reiter sich lange auf ihm halten können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58b4942-39bd-48cb-90c0-fc84c6bdaa68\', \'multiverseId\': 355765}, \'multiverseid\': 355765}, {\'name\': \'Corcel aquus\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'En el agua, es tan grácil como un delfín. En tierra, da unos tirones y sacudidas tan impredecibles que pocos pueden montarlo durante mucho tiempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e5abb0-ca29-45e1-8344-b23ba76e77ad\', \'multiverseId\': 365487}, \'multiverseid\': 365487}, {\'name\': \'Destrier aquus\', \'text\': "{2}{U}, {T} : La créature ciblée gagne -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Dans l\'eau, il a la grâce d\'un dauphin. Sur la terre ferme, il piaffe et bondit de façon si imprévisible que peu tiennent longtemps en selle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356039&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a79dfacd-1c8b-4486-8b0e-b86028021dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 356039}, \'multiverseid\': 356039}, {\'name\': \'Destriero Aquino\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': "Nell\'acqua ha la grazia di un delfino. Sulla terra scatta e sobbalza in modo così imprevedibile che pochi riescono a cavalcarlo a lungo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31d5fde-4d4f-4754-888c-1b59269e598d\', \'multiverseId\': 356313}, \'multiverseid\': 356313}, {\'name\': \'水馬\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－２/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'水中にあってはイルカのごとく優雅である。しかし地上ではまったく予測不可能な方向へ飛び跳ねるため、長時間乗っていられる者は少ない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c675072-9beb-45c1-8c5a-ee4ce9519a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 356587}, \'multiverseid\': 356587}, {\'name\': \'아쿠스 준마\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'물속에서는 돌고래만큼 우아하지만, 육지에서는 제멋대로 날뛰어서 오래 탈 수 있는 자가 거의 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a977374b-d845-45fb-8433-436cfc3a727f\', \'multiverseId\': 357409}, \'multiverseid\': 357409}, {\'name\': \'Corcel Aquus\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: A criatura alvo recebe -2/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Na água, ele é gracioso como um golfinho. Na terra, ele dispara e se sacode de forma tão imprevisível que poucos conseguem montá-lo por muito tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68096cb-13f7-4e9b-8d08-72d10746731e\', \'multiverseId\': 356861}, \'multiverseid\': 356861}, {\'name\': \'Жеребец Аквус\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}, {T}: целевое существо получает -2/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'В воде он проворен как дельфин. На суше его движения настолько быстры и непредсказуемы, что мало кто сможет усидеть на его спине.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c91fe3-aec1-41c1-ad33-3828ca33500a\', \'multiverseId\': 355217}, \'multiverseid\': 355217}, {\'name\': \'水驹\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}，{T}：目标生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'在水里，他如同海豚一般优雅。在陆地，他的脾性古怪，少有人能驾驭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff883b90-9973-4e72-a411-46bf17b5cca0\', \'multiverseId\': 357135}, \'multiverseid\': 357135}, {\'name\': \'水駒\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}，{T}：目標生物得-2/-0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'在水裡，牠如同海豚一般優雅。在陸地，牠的脾性古怪，少有人能駕馭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71079c8-4912-4b12-8f7d-1e8590d098ab\', \'multiverseId\': 355491}, \'multiverseid\': 355491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon des Triumvirats\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Archon des Triumvirats angreift, inhaftiere bis zu zwei bleibende Karten deiner Wahl, die kein Land sind und die deine Gegner kontrollieren. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug können diese bleibenden Karten nicht angreifen oder blocken und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdde52d4-3aa0-4ebc-bbc1-9905ddccb7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 355878}, \'multiverseid\': 355878}, {\'name\': \'Arconte del triunvirato\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Arconte del triunvirato ataque, detén hasta dos permanentes objetivo que no sean tierra que controlen tus oponentes. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esos permanentes no pueden atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2262e20-b155-4fd5-91b9-e2a05f68e7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 365600}, \'multiverseid\': 365600}, {\'name\': \'Archonte du Triumvirat\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Archonte du Triumvirat attaque, détenez jusqu\'à deux permanents non-terrain ciblés que vos adversaires contrôlent. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces permanents ne peuvent ni attaquer ni bloquer et leurs capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.)", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1ead22-e170-4b77-961b-41d57a1a1b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 356152}, \'multiverseid\': 356152}, {\'name\': \'Arconte del Triumvirato\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Arconte del Triumvirato attacca, trattieni fino a due permanenti non terra bersaglio controllati dai tuoi avversari. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quei permanenti non possono attaccare o bloccare e le loro abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fea393-4233-49bb-a6c0-cec447728f40\', \'multiverseId\': 356426}, \'multiverseid\': 356426}, {\'name\': \'三巨頭の執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n三巨頭の執政官が攻撃するたび、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールする土地でないパーマネントを最大２つまで対象とし、それらを留置する。（あなたの次のターンまで、それらのパーマネントでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それらの起動型能力は起動できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a68b4944-6d0a-4f86-9035-56a4eea64e61\', \'multiverseId\': 356700}, \'multiverseid\': 356700}, {\'name\': \'삼두정치의 집정관\', \'text\': \'비행\\n삼두정치의 집정관이 공격할 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 지속물 중 대지가 아닌 지속물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물들을 억류한다. (당신의 다음 턴이 될 때까지 그 지속물들은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없으며, 그 지속물들의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 집정관\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbef953-2002-433c-933f-bd98f150b6ae\', \'multiverseId\': 357522}, \'multiverseid\': 357522}, {\'name\': \'Arconte do Triunvirato\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Arconte do Triunvirato atacar, detenha até duas permanentes alvo que não sejam terrenos que seus oponentes controlam. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas permanentes não podem atacar nem bloquear, e as habilidades ativadas delas não podem ser ativadas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec4da2a-1115-40e5-a8dd-df98c43c4117\', \'multiverseId\': 356974}, \'multiverseid\': 356974}, {\'name\': \'Архонт Триумвирата\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Архонт Триумвирата атакует, задержите не более двух целевых не являющихся землями перманентов под контролем ваших оппонентов. (До вашего следующего хода те перманенты не могут атаковать или блокировать, и их активируемые способности не могут быть активированы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf13174-6f86-4a04-9d1e-82597e06c7be\', \'multiverseId\': 355330}, \'multiverseid\': 355330}, {\'name\': \'三盟统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当三盟统领攻击时，拘留至多两个目标由对手操控的非地永久物。（直到你的下一个回合，这些永久物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物～统领\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a71e289e-05d3-40eb-8aea-2d192748ec9b\', \'multiverseId\': 357248}, \'multiverseid\': 357248}, {\'name\': \'三盟統領\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當三盟統領攻擊時，拘留至多兩個目標由對手操控的非地永久物。（直到你的下一個回合，這些永久物不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。）\', \'type\': \'生物～統領\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9bb0d9e-bfb4-4b7a-a4f7-1d51a1ca8629\', \'multiverseId\': 355604}, \'multiverseid\': 355604}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armadawurm\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Armadawurm ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 5/5 grünen Wurm-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Niemand im Konklave handelt auf eigene Faust.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f86421-1c37-4eba-b233-8ded9837b25c\', \'multiverseId\': 355879}, \'multiverseid\': 355879}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de la armada\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando la Sierpe de la armada entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Sierpe verde 5/5 con la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Nadie del Cónclave actúa en solitario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebc2ad0-dd6a-4d70-bdfd-eb8febb90065\', \'multiverseId\': 365601}, \'multiverseid\': 365601}, {\'name\': "Guivre d\'armada", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand la Guivre d\'armada arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 5/5 verte Guivre avec le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "Nul n\'agit seul au sein du Conclave.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95908e26-5a76-4181-83e9-cba884c7e48f\', \'multiverseId\': 356153}, \'multiverseid\': 356153}, {\'name\': "Wurm dell\'Armata", \'text\': "Travolgere\\nQuando il Wurm dell\'Armata entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Wurm 5/5 verde con travolgere.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Nel Conclave, nessuno agisce da solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f42c45e6-6204-4274-9fc2-0589f6315acc\', \'multiverseId\': 356427}, \'multiverseid\': 356427}, {\'name\': \'大軍のワーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n大軍のワームが戦場に出たとき、トランプルを持つ緑の５/５のワーム・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'議事会では誰も単独行動をとらない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be04621-f5d0-40f4-87d5-482d795680fd\', \'multiverseId\': 356701}, \'multiverseid\': 356701}, {\'name\': \'군단 웜\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n군단 웜이 전장에 들어올 때, 돌진 능력을 가진 5/5 녹색 웜 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': \'교단의 일원은 절대 단독으로 행동하지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'045fdf98-4f26-4aa1-b565-fd9ea5600f20\', \'multiverseId\': 357523}, \'multiverseid\': 357523}, {\'name\': \'Vorme da Armada\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Vorme da Armada entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 5/5 do tipo Vorme com atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'Ninguém no Conclave age sozinho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901be73f-0ff5-4e3f-91c4-9041c938e168\', \'multiverseId\': 356975}, \'multiverseid\': 356975}, {\'name\': \'Вурм-Армада\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Вурм-Армада выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 5/5 зеленый Вурм с Пробивным ударом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': \'В Конклаве никто не действует в одиночку.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d400cbc8-7297-43d6-af1a-a82531a8b9c4\', \'multiverseId\': 355331}, \'multiverseid\': 355331}, {\'name\': \'巨舰亚龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当巨舰亚龙进战场时，将一个5/5绿色，具践踏异能的亚龙衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'在盟会中，没有人是单独行动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69145784-8f81-4a11-89eb-449d70a42a99\', \'multiverseId\': 357249}, \'multiverseid\': 357249}, {\'name\': \'巨艦亞龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當巨艦亞龍進戰場時，將一個5/5綠色，具踐踏異能的亞龍衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': \'在盟會中，沒有人是單獨行動。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d15be49-ce4b-464e-a484-464f96062140\', \'multiverseId\': 355605}, \'multiverseid\': 355605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arrestkugel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Arrestkugel ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und nicht Arrestkugel heißt, sowie alle anderen bleibenden Karten mit dem gleichen Namen wie diese bleibende Karte ins Exil schicken.\\nWenn die Arrestkugel das Spiel verlässt, bringe die ins Exil geschickten Karten unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b662aa-16b6-4d6d-b71f-01e27bf2a48c\', \'multiverseId\': 355891}, \'multiverseid\': 355891}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de detención\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Esfera de detención entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que no se llame Esfera de detención y todos los otros permanentes con el mismo nombre que ese permanente.\\nCuando la Esfera de detención deje el campo de batalla, regresa las cartas exiliadas al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e368c434-e8f5-469f-a4a4-a4a34a45a1be\', \'multiverseId\': 365613}, \'multiverseid\': 365613}, {\'name\': \'Sphère de détention\', \'text\': "Quand la Sphère de détention arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler un permanent non-terrain ciblé qui n\'est pas nommé Sphère de détention et tous les autres permanents ayant le même nom que ce permanent.\\nQuand la Sphère de détention quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez, sous le contrôle de leur propriétaire, les cartes exilées sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f74e892-dfd5-44e3-83c6-c4afbdce56f8\', \'multiverseId\': 356165}, \'multiverseid\': 356165}, {\'name\': \'Sfera di Detenzione\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sfera di Detenzione entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare un permanente non terra bersaglio che non si chiama Sfera di Detenzione e tutti gli altri permanenti con lo stesso nome di quel permanente.\\nQuando la Sfera di Detenzione lascia il campo di battaglia, rimetti le carte esiliate sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del loro proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b707f27-c44f-48dd-ba7e-eed7bb50c275\', \'multiverseId\': 356439}, \'multiverseid\': 356439}, {\'name\': \'拘留の宝球\', \'text\': \'拘留の宝球が戦場に出たとき、拘留の宝球という名前でなく土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそのパーマネントと、そのパーマネントと同じ名前を持つ他のすべてのパーマネントを追放してもよい。\\n拘留の宝球が戦場を離れたとき、その追放されたカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fef1fce-c99e-4c92-9d4f-c601c5706417\', \'multiverseId\': 356713}, \'multiverseid\': 356713}, {\'name\': \'억류의 구체\', \'text\': \'억류의 구체가 전장에 들어올 때, 대지가 아니고 이름이 억류의 구체가 아닌 지속물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 지속물 및 그 지속물과 이름이 같은 모든 지속물을 추방할 수 있다.\\n억류의 구체가 전장을 떠날 때, 추방된 카드들을 소유자의 조종 하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5354cae5-1ad1-4b94-8570-ec6163a5a8b6\', \'multiverseId\': 357535}, \'multiverseid\': 357535}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de Detenção\', \'text\': \'Quando Esfera de Detenção entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno e não tenha o nome Esfera de Detenção e todas as permanentes com o mesmo nome daquela permanente.\\nQuando Esfera de Detenção deixar o campo de batalha, devolva os cards exilados ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cef40f40-fcc4-41d0-9d07-cf8a4afd3136\', \'multiverseId\': 356987}, \'multiverseid\': 356987}, {\'name\': \'Сфера Задержания\', \'text\': \'Когда Сфера Задержания выходит на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать целевой не являющийся землей перманент, имя которого не Сфера Задержания, и все другие перманенты с тем же именем, что и у того перманента.\\nКогда Сфера Задержания покидает поле битвы, верните те изгнанные карты на поле битвы под контролем их владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'192e5203-3479-4e5d-9548-84919860695b\', \'multiverseId\': 355343}, \'multiverseid\': 355343}, {\'name\': \'扣留法球\', \'text\': \'当扣留法球进战场时，你可以放逐目标非地、且名称不是扣留法球的永久物，以及与该永久物同名的所有其他永久物。\\n当扣留法球离开战场时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d03884fd-2334-4a36-82cd-ecea8c6cbb6b\', \'multiverseId\': 357261}, \'multiverseid\': 357261}, {\'name\': \'扣留法球\', \'text\': \'當扣留法球進戰場時，你可以放逐目標非地、且名稱不是扣留法球的永久物，以及與該永久物同名的所有其他永久物。\\n當扣留法球離開戰場時，將所放逐的牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e6af76-64ee-4f88-b96a-f34591ce398d\', \'multiverseId\': 355617}, \'multiverseid\': 355617}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgestandene Zuflucht\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn einer der großen Wächter sich erhebt, wischt er Feinde wie Spreu beiseite, achtet aber darauf, nicht ein einziges Insekt zu zertreten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa7eb3d0-d15b-4833-9f0e-890de4b2287a\', \'multiverseId\': 355926}, \'multiverseid\': 355926}, {\'name\': \'Santuario emergente\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se alza uno de los grandes guardianes, barre a los enemigos a un lado como si fueran paja pero tiene cuidado de no pisar ni un solo insecto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12fc3436-2142-4539-b92d-716de47a49e5\', \'multiverseId\': 365648}, \'multiverseid\': 365648}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire éveillé\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'un des grands gardiens s\'éveille, il balaie les ennemis comme des fétus de paille en prenant soin de ne pas piétiner le moindre insecte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e991095-ef2b-4fb6-b017-c945685f6f8a\', \'multiverseId\': 356200}, \'multiverseid\': 356200}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Elevato\', \'text\': \'Cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Quando uno dei grandi guardiani si alza, spazza via i nemici come paglia, ma si preoccupa di non schiacciare nemmeno un insetto sotto i suoi piedi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7247f78-565a-431e-8fb2-6a93d0194b77\', \'multiverseId\': 356474}, \'multiverseid\': 356474}, {\'name\': \'目覚めし聖域\', \'text\': \'警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'偉大なる守護者の一体が目覚めると、それは籾殻のように敵を薙ぎ払う。しかしそれは一匹の虫さえ踏みつぶさないのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67d3d153-5ce8-442a-9082-1c76eb594c8e\', \'multiverseId\': 356748}, \'multiverseid\': 356748}, {\'name\': \'일어선 성소\', \'text\': \'경계\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'위대한 수호자들은 일어나면서 주위의 적을 지푸라기처럼 쓸어버리면서도 발밑의 곤충은 한 마리도 밟지 않으려 주의한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8471e88-26f1-436d-980e-e5690eeef7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 357570}, \'multiverseid\': 357570}, {\'name\': \'Santuário Elevado\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Quando um dos grandes guardiões se ergue, ele varre os inimigos como se fossem de palha, mas ainda assim toma cuidado para não pisotear um inseto sequer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27be8211-7dec-485c-a683-377de98c1f93\', \'multiverseId\': 357022}, \'multiverseid\': 357022}, {\'name\': \'Оживленное Святилище\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Когда один из великих стражей пробуждается ото сна, он сносит врагов как пушинки, но старается при этом не раздавить ни единой букашки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a67abc-ec25-4ee7-8aab-2137120001d1\', \'multiverseId\': 355378}, \'multiverseid\': 355378}, {\'name\': \'醒转圣域\', \'text\': \'警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'其间任一位伟大的守护者现身时，它将轻松扫荡敌人，并且还能留心不伤到任一只脚下的虫子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d05c391-d920-409d-9338-0462c99936df\', \'multiverseId\': 357296}, \'multiverseid\': 357296}, {\'name\': \'醒轉聖域\', \'text\': \'警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'其間任一位偉大的守護者現身時，他將輕鬆掃蕩敵人，並且還能留心不傷到任一隻腳下的蟲子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14ddb229-5360-4425-bed7-355ac1a35cce\', \'multiverseId\': 355652}, \'multiverseid\': 355652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufkeimende Stadt\', \'text\': \'Landverzauberung\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „Enttappe dieses Land während des Enttappsegments jedes anderen Spielers."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ruinen des Alten Pravh verwandelten sich in eine Wildnis, obwohl die noch vorhandene Azorius-Magie alles Vogelgezwitscher verstummen ließ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9cf839-0d0d-4e18-8a9f-1dc4d22078b0\', \'multiverseId\': 355874}, \'multiverseid\': 355874}, {\'name\': \'Germinación urbana\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "Endereza esta tierra durante el paso de enderezar de cada uno de los demás jugadores".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Las ruinas de Vieja Prahv se convirtieron en un lugar salvaje, pese a que el canto de los pájaros era silenciado por la persistente magia azoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b472ad2-fbd5-475b-91b9-0b15f7aeee48\', \'multiverseId\': 365596}, \'multiverseid\': 365596}, {\'name\': \'Bourgeonnement urbain\', \'text\': "Enchanter : terrain\\nLe terrain enchanté a « Dégagez ce terrain pendant l\'étape de dégagement de chaque autre joueur. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Les ruines de l\'Ancien Prahv retournèrent à l\'état sauvage, bien que magie résiduelle d\'Azorius fit taire tous les chants d\'oiseau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07a18fec-072b-4810-9e4d-c5c505507154\', \'multiverseId\': 356148}, \'multiverseid\': 356148}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Urbana\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nLa terra incantata ha "STAPpa questa terra durante lo STAP di ogni altro giocatore".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Le rovine del Vecchio Prahv divennero un luogo selvaggio; anche se i residui della magia Azorius imponevano il silenzio agli uccelli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6fc653e-07e2-49ec-8bee-ab4e14b3bbaf\', \'multiverseId\': 356422}, \'multiverseid\': 356422}, {\'name\': \'都の芽吹き\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地は「他の各プレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップにこの土地をアンタップする。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'旧プラーフの遺跡は自然に還っていた。アゾリウスの魔法の名残があらゆる鳥の囀りをかき消してはいるが。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8dec459-d9a0-4b0d-b7bb-9109259b4c79\', \'multiverseId\': 356696}, \'multiverseid\': 356696}, {\'name\': \'급속한 녹지화\', \'text\': \'대지에게 부여\\n부여된 대지는 "다른 플레이어의 언탭단마다 이 대지를 언탭한다."라는 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'잔존하는 아조리우스 길드의 마법으로 인해 새들이 지저귀는 소리는 들리지 않지만, 올드 프라브의 유적지는 야생의 공간이 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'572ea319-1b98-4a08-99d1-93a65e0f3634\', \'multiverseId\': 357518}, \'multiverseid\': 357518}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Urbano\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nO terreno encantado tem "Desvire este terreno durante a etapa de desvirar de cada outro jogador."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'As ruínas da Velha Prahv transformaram-se numa área selvagem, mesmo que todo canto de pássaro tenha sido silenciado pela magia Azorius remanescente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52563a06-4d35-4ff3-a4c8-c0bbfa388fc9\', \'multiverseId\': 356970}, \'multiverseid\': 356970}, {\'name\': \'Городское Цветение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nЗачарованная земля имеет способность «Разверните эту землю во время шага разворота каждого другого игрока».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Руины Старого Права были поглощены дикой природой — хотя все певчие птицы были заглушены магией Азориусов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc81a0e-fe99-4bbf-b891-cb77851a7192\', \'multiverseId\': 355326}, \'multiverseid\': 355326}, {\'name\': \'城市萌芽\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n所结附的地具有「于每位其他牌手的重置步骤中重置此地。」\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'旧布拉夫遗迹成为了一片野生空间，尽管所有的雀鸟都因俄佐立法术而无声无息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b6b6a0f-16c9-426e-b414-1423df41c636\', \'multiverseId\': 357244}, \'multiverseid\': 357244}, {\'name\': \'城市萌芽\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n所結附的地具有「於每位其他玩家的重置步驟中重置此地。」\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'舊布拉夫遺跡成為了一片野生空間，儘管所有的雀鳥都因俄佐立魔法而無聲無息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212760e9-5346-4d7b-b890-723d2aa8eabb\', \'multiverseId\': 355600}, \'multiverseid\': 355600}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufragendes Indrik\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Es jagt unbarmherzig seine fliegende Beute, ohne darauf zu achten, was es unter seinen Hufen zermalmt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe5ee43-8477-445b-aab3-58878f5bcdf2\', \'multiverseId\': 355873}, \'multiverseid\': 355873}, {\'name\': \'Indrik imponente\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Persigue a su víctima aérea de forma implacable, ajeno a todo cuanto pueda pulverizar bajo sus pezuñas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c12c2f97-2447-4921-966c-97b884535216\', \'multiverseId\': 365595}, \'multiverseid\': 365595}, {\'name\': \'Indrik imposant\', \'text\': \'Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Il traque inlassablement ses proies ailées, sans égard pour ce qu\'il pulvérise sous ses sabots.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356147&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412c48f3-4e66-4cd7-933b-3f6a3c302a24\', \'multiverseId\': 356147}, \'multiverseid\': 356147}, {\'name\': \'Indrik Torreggiante\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Insegue implacabile la sua preda volante, ignaro di ciò che polverizza con gli zoccoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cfc9bdc-0b86-41b9-9dd5-fe7453860d98\', \'multiverseId\': 356421}, \'multiverseid\': 356421}, {\'name\': \'そびえ立つインドリク\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーでは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'それは自らの蹄が何を粉砕するかなどお構いなしに、空飛ぶ獲物をしつこく追い回す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2dfc9b-3318-4574-b0cc-a946b676fb4d\', \'multiverseId\': 356695}, \'multiverseid\': 356695}, {\'name\': \'우뚝 솟은 인드릭\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행 능력을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 자신의 발굽 아래 무엇이 부서지든 아랑곳하지 않고 공중에 있는 먹잇감을 끈질기게 추적한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bad8c25-b421-4492-ae48-7aaa78d64982\', \'multiverseId\': 357517}, \'multiverseid\': 357517}, {\'name\': \'Indrik Altaneiro\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Ele persegue suas presas voadoras incansavelmente, sem ligar para o que pulveriza com seus cascos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ff6a9b-006c-470d-a791-f5a8f32824cc\', \'multiverseId\': 356969}, \'multiverseid\': 356969}, {\'name\': \'Возвышающийся Индрик\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Он упорно преследует свою летающую добычу, не обращая внимания на то, что именно крошит своими копытами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81addfff-bd31-4654-bab8-00e259be5471\', \'multiverseId\': 355325}, \'multiverseid\': 355325}, {\'name\': \'雄立巨犀兽\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'他会一直追捕飞空猎物，完全不顾其蹄下所粉碎的亡魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360ef8ff-67bd-4aa6-a011-dda677187187\', \'multiverseId\': 357243}, \'multiverseid\': 357243}, {\'name\': \'雄立巨犀獸\', \'text\': \'延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'牠會一直追捕飛空獵物，完全不顧其蹄下所粉碎的亡魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3669f5-a636-49da-9866-d053fb10198a\', \'multiverseId\': 355599}, \'multiverseid\': 355599}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augen im Himmel\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel und führe dann Bevölkern durch. (Bringe einen Spielstein ins Spiel, der eine Kopie eines Kreaturenspielsteins ist, den du kontrollierst.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere geflügelten Freunde werden sich um alles kümmern, wo Wurzel und Zweig nicht hinreichen." —Zunak, Selesnija-Stratege\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355746&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e19961c7-e3e8-42ef-b29c-7979ed1a4439\', \'multiverseId\': 355746}, \'multiverseid\': 355746}, {\'name\': \'Ojos en el cielo\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar, luego repuebla. (Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha que es una copia de una ficha de criatura que controlas.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"De aquello que no alcancen raíces ni ramas se encargarán nuestros amigos alados." —Zúnak, estratega selesnya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b70b7c9-1f08-4f10-bd7c-642795669375\', \'multiverseId\': 365468}, \'multiverseid\': 365468}, {\'name\': \'Yeux des cieux\', \'text\': "Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol, puis peuplez. (Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton qui est une copie d\'un jeton de créature que vous contrôlez.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nos amis ailés s\'occuperont de ce qui est hors d\'atteinte des racines et des branches. » —Zunak, stratège de Selesnya", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356020&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d698f25-814b-4b7c-b943-b3f0c17f6a40\', \'multiverseId\': 356020}, \'multiverseid\': 356020}, {\'name\': \'Occhi nel Cielo\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare, poi popola. (Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina che è una copia di una pedina creatura che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri amici alati si occuperanno di ciò che radici e rami non possono raggiungere." —Zunak, stratega di Selesnya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9376e4d-7fab-48e4-86fc-2c64aecb2eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 356294}, \'multiverseid\': 356294}, {\'name\': \'天空の目\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出し、その後居住を行う。（あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー・トークン１体のコピーであるトークンを１体戦場に出す。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「根と枝が届かない奴は、翼をもった我々の友が相手をしてくれるだろう。」 ――セレズニアの軍師、ズーナーク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8102dfd-4ec0-4906-b930-a1c708f727eb\', \'multiverseId\': 356568}, \'multiverseid\': 356568}, {\'name\': \'하늘에서 지켜보는 눈\', \'text\': \'비행 능력을 가진 1/1 백색 조류 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓은 후, 소집한다. (당신이 조종하는 어느 생물 토큰의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"뿌리와 가지가 닿지 않는 것은 우리의 날개 달린 친구들이 처리할 것이다." —셀레스냐 전략가 주나크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90cd7971-0024-4071-b803-ef0b83ca26c5\', \'multiverseId\': 357390}, \'multiverseid\': 357390}, {\'name\': \'Olhos nos Céus\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Ave com voar e depois povoe. (Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha que seja uma cópia de uma ficha de criatura que você controla.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossos amigos alados se encarregarão do que as raízes e galhos não puderem atingir." — Zunak, estrategista Selesnya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb31d2dd-ed43-4563-aeb8-6a054ffda975\', \'multiverseId\': 356842}, \'multiverseid\': 356842}, {\'name\': \'Глаза в Небе\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белая Птица с Полетом, затем используйте Заселение. (Положите на поле битвы одну фишку, являющуюся копией фишки существа под вашим контролем.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Туда, куда не смогут добраться корни и ветви, доберутся наши крылатые друзья». — Зунак, селезнийский стратег\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'190406ef-eac4-4f50-89f4-b282cd797d88\', \'multiverseId\': 355198}, \'multiverseid\': 355198}, {\'name\': \'苍穹之眼\', \'text\': \'将一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物放进战场，然后殖民。（将一个衍生物放进战场，此衍生物为由你操控的某衍生生物之复制品。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「树根与树枝到不了之处，都有我们长翅膀的朋友照顾。」 ～瑟雷尼亚策士祖奈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410e79b8-6da4-4ba1-b40a-db9618230643\', \'multiverseId\': 357116}, \'multiverseid\': 357116}, {\'name\': \'蒼穹之眼\', \'text\': \'將一個1/1白色，具飛行異能的鳥衍生生物放進戰場，然後殖民。（將一個衍生物放進戰場，此衍生物為由你操控的某衍生生物之複製品。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「樹根與樹枝到不了之處，都有我們長翅膀的朋友照顧。」 ～瑟雷尼亞策士祖奈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a08efd0-f5ca-4192-8d51-ef472a1646c0\', \'multiverseId\': 355472}, \'multiverseid\': 355472}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbrechender Oger\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nDer Ausbrechende Oger kann angreifen, als ob er die Verteidigerfähigkeit nicht hätte, solange du ein Tor kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Er benötigte drei Jahre, um darauf zu kommen, dass er die Kette als Waffe nutzen könnte, doch die verlorene Zeit machte er dann schnell wieder wett.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355808&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a031b0-01a6-47c2-b4fb-22514c451e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 355808}, \'multiverseid\': 355808}, {\'name\': \'Ogro rompeceldas\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nMientras controles un Portal, el Ogro rompeceldas puede atacar como si no tuviera la habilidad de defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ogro\', \'flavor\': \'Hicieron falta tres años para que se le ocurriera usar la cadena como arma, pero una vez lo hizo recuperó el tiempo perdido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3094563-6afc-47a1-883f-b76447152d25\', \'multiverseId\': 365530}, \'multiverseid\': 365530}, {\'name\': \'Ogre évadé\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nL\'Ogre évadé peut attaquer comme s\'il n\'avait pas le défenseur tant que vous contrôlez une porte.", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Il lui fallut trois ans pour comprendre qu\'il pouvait se servir de la chaîne comme d\'une arme, mais dès cet instant, il rattrapa le temps perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356082&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14121f3b-1d68-45ef-8e00-bc97f1486e78\', \'multiverseId\': 356082}, \'multiverseid\': 356082}, {\'name\': \'Ogre Evaso\', \'text\': "Difensore\\nL\'Ogre Evaso può attaccare come se non avesse difensore fintanto che controlli un Cancello.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Ogre\', \'flavor\': "Gli ci sono voluti tre anni per avere l\'idea di usare la catena come arma. Ma ha subito recuperato il tempo perduto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e4c6c3-5da3-4cf6-978b-8e08bd0c9ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 356356}, \'multiverseid\': 356356}, {\'name\': \'オーガの脱獄者\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nオーガの脱獄者は、あなたが門をコントロールしているかぎりこれが防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'鎖を武器として使うという発想に至るまでに三年を要した。だがこれに気付いた彼は、無駄にした年月分を取り返した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6249de59-4a2c-43d1-978d-302cf4e31a95\', \'multiverseId\': 356630}, \'multiverseid\': 356630}, {\'name\': \'오우거 탈옥수\', \'text\': \'수비태세\\n당신이 관문을 조종하는 한, 오우거 탈옥수는 수비태세 능력을 가지지 않은 것처럼 공격할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오우거 도적\', \'flavor\': \'그가 사슬을 무기로 사용할 수 있다는 것을 깨닫는 데는 3년이 걸렸지만, 그때부터 그는 그만큼 더 날뛰기 시작했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f3cc9e-3fe0-46c6-b965-cb9bcdc6c67c\', \'multiverseId\': 357452}, \'multiverseid\': 357452}, {\'name\': \'Ogre Fugitivo\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nOgre Fugitivo poderá atacar como se não tivesse defensor enquanto você controlar um terreno do tipo Portão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ogre Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Levou três anos até que ele pensasse em usar a corrente como arma, mas, quando o fez, logo recuperou o tempo perdido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd289883-02e2-4991-b391-b8e9580d619b\', \'multiverseId\': 356904}, \'multiverseid\': 356904}, {\'name\': \'Беглый Огр\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\nПока вы контролируете Врата, Беглый Огр может атаковать, как если бы у него не было способности Защитника.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Огр Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Ему потребовалось три года, чтобы понять, что цепи можно использовать в качестве оружия. Но когда он это понял, то с лихвой наверстал упущенное время.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0b6ab5-8926-421b-b5c8-9bdeb3cfe622\', \'multiverseId\': 355260}, \'multiverseid\': 355260}, {\'name\': \'逃狱食人魔\', \'text\': \'守军\\n只要你操控门，逃狱食人魔便能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'他花了三年的时间才让链子成为武器，而最终来说这一切是值得的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771c1b5e-75ba-4349-a3bb-e85715794f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 357178}, \'multiverseid\': 357178}, {\'name\': \'逃獄食人魔\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n只要你操控門，逃獄食人魔便能視同不具守軍異能地進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'他花了三年的時間才讓鍊子成為武器，而最終來說這一切是值得的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f944a864-1789-4622-80b3-590c7865c02b\', \'multiverseId\': 355534}, \'multiverseid\': 355534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausflussskorpion\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die er einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\\nAusplündern {1}{B}{G} ({1}{B}{G}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken, wie die Stärke dieser Karte beträgt, auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Spiele Ausplündern wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Skorpion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e848beb0-c7b9-4ca4-9b67-684e9c6dd959\', \'multiverseId\': 355934}, \'multiverseid\': 355934}, {\'name\': \'Escorpión del conducto\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\\nCarroñar {1}{B}{G}. ({1}{B}{G}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Pon sobre la criatura objetivo una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 igual a la fuerza de esta carta. Activa la habilidad de carroñar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Escorpión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15291b8e-5508-4aa7-9850-30c766980319\', \'multiverseId\': 365656}, \'multiverseid\': 365656}, {\'name\': \'Scorpion des écluses\', \'text\': "Contact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)\\nRécupération {1}{B}{G} ({1}{B}{G}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Mettez un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la force de cette carte sur une créature ciblée. Ne récupérez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : scorpion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b83eda-d756-4c41-9b7c-bb1a5234fc47\', \'multiverseId\': 356208}, \'multiverseid\': 356208}, {\'name\': \'Scorpione del Canale\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\\nMangiacarogne {1}{B}{G} ({1}{B}{G}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Metti un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari alla forza di questa carta su una creatura bersaglio. Attiva mangiacarogne solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scorpione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7657e3-5f13-4091-a9c8-86f03d527e37\', \'multiverseId\': 356482}, \'multiverseid\': 356482}, {\'name\': \'水路の蠍\', \'text\': \'接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えた場合、それだけで破壊される。）\\n活用 {1}{B}{G} （{1}{B}{G}, このカードをあなたの墓地から追放する：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上にこのカードのパワーに等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。活用はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蠍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45702907-24c9-49ae-986c-42ad1da48183\', \'multiverseId\': 356756}, \'multiverseid\': 356756}, {\'name\': \'수문 전갈\', \'text\': \'치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\\n섭취 {1}{B}{G} ({1}{B}{G}, 당신의 무덤에서 이 카드를 추방한다: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 이 카드의 공격력만큼의 +1/+1 카운터를 그 생물에 올려놓는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 섭취 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 전갈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d2ece8-1368-4991-b690-04829fd4973a\', \'multiverseId\': 357578}, \'multiverseid\': 357578}, {\'name\': \'Escorpião do Canal\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\\nNecrofagia {1}{B}{G} ({1}{B}{G}, Exile este card de seu cemitério: Coloque uma quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao poder deste card na criatura alvo. Use necrofagia somente quando puder conjurar um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Escorpião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7737f878-9a08-491f-9ce2-1373fe18ca0b\', \'multiverseId\': 357030}, \'multiverseid\': 357030}, {\'name\': \'Скорпион Шлюзовых Каналов\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\\nУтилизация {1}{B}{G} ({1}{B}{G}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: положите на целевое существо жетоны +1/+1, количество которых равно силе этой карты. Утилизируйте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Скорпион\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f3eb985-6f56-4105-b1e1-d26c1f0badd6\', \'multiverseId\': 355386}, \'multiverseid\': 355386}, {\'name\': \'闸沟蝎子\', \'text\': \'死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\\n食腐{1}{B}{G}（{1}{B}{G}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：在目标生物上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于此牌的力量。食腐的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蝎子\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e53d1a14-bebc-480f-a316-15ac1edfe21f\', \'multiverseId\': 357304}, \'multiverseid\': 357304}, {\'name\': \'閘溝蠍子\', \'text\': \'死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\\n食腐{1}{B}{G}（{1}{B}{G}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：在目標生物上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於此牌的力量。食腐的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蠍子\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1564c0f8-343e-4c2a-bb44-068e5fd95839\', \'multiverseId\': 355660}, \'multiverseid\': 355660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges; oder ziehe eine Karte; oder lege eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Regeln der Logik und Ordnung haben die Wahl bereits für dich getroffen." —Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82e80ee-6c5f-4c37-845a-88710483c8d7\', \'multiverseId\': 355881}, \'multiverseid\': 355881}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto azorio\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno; o roba una carta; o pon la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las reglas de la lógica y el orden ya han tomado la decisión por ti." —Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea7b994-b47e-4e98-9e35-9212795d2c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 365603}, \'multiverseid\': 365603}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'Azorius", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un — Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour ; ou piochez une carte ; ou mettez une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les lois qui régissent l\'ordre et la logique ont déjà choisi à votre place. » —Isperia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f379c4f-3830-4900-a25c-3da356049ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 356155}, \'multiverseid\': 356155}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Azorius\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno — Le creature che controlli hanno legame vitale fino alla fine del turno; oppure pesca una carta; oppure metti una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le regole della logica e dell\\\'ordine hanno già scelto per te." —Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fc16c3c-fd98-4f10-aecf-800a4c27ea54\', \'multiverseId\': 356429}, \'multiverseid\': 356429}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下の３つから１つを選ぶ。「あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーはターン終了時まで絆魂を得る。」「カードを１枚引く。」「攻撃クリーチャー１体かブロック・クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。」\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「論理と秩序に従って、あなたの選択はすでになされました。」 ――イスペリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2474fa-6081-4852-bdf2-07951eaf7e92\', \'multiverseId\': 356703}, \'multiverseid\': 356703}, {\'name\': \'아조리우스 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 — 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 생명연결 능력을 얻는다; 또는 카드 한 장을 뽑는다; 또는 공격생물 한 개나 방어생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 서고 맨 위에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"당신의 선택은 이미 논리와 질서의 규칙에 의해 정해져 있다." —이스페리아\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc2991a-eb06-42c8-99c8-cd929cc2178b\', \'multiverseId\': 357525}, \'multiverseid\': 357525}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Azorius\', \'text\': \'Escolha um — As criaturas que você controla ganham vínculo com a vida até o final do turno; ou compre um card; ou coloque a criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora no topo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"As regras da lógica e da ordem já escolheram por você." — Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b4af3a-e6ad-4d51-8976-af7aa7cfa7da\', \'multiverseId\': 356977}, \'multiverseid\': 356977}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Азориусов\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно — существа под вашим контролем получают Цепь жизни до конца хода; или возьмите карту; или положите целевое атакующее или блокирующее существо на верх библиотеки его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Законы логики и порядка уже давно все решили за тебя». — Исперия\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af3402f-e5c4-458f-b1ff-a1eb3189b83e\', \'multiverseId\': 355333}, \'multiverseid\': 355333}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～由你操控的生物获得系命异能直到回合结束；或抓一张牌；或将目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「逻辑与秩序的规则已替你做出了决定。」 ～伊佩利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b46f88-a3e4-4385-a116-59283215d1c8\', \'multiverseId\': 357251}, \'multiverseid\': 357251}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～由你操控的生物獲得繫命異能直到回合結束；或抽一張牌；或將目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物置於其擁有者的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「邏輯與秩序的規則已替你做出了決定。」 ～伊佩利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee9bae54-25a6-43dd-919d-891dab78c912\', \'multiverseId\': 355607}, \'multiverseid\': 355607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Eintreiberin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Azorius-Eintreiberin ins Spiel kommt, inhaftiere eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann diese Kreatur nicht angreifen oder blocken und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast das Recht zu schweigen. Vor allem, weil ich deiner Ausflüchte müde werde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355741&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f470a49d-b88d-4a9b-a7cb-48267c53eeaa\', \'multiverseId\': 355741}, \'multiverseid\': 355741}, {\'name\': \'Encarceladora azoria\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Encarceladora azoria entre al campo de batalla, detén la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura no puede atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tienes derecho a guardar silencio. Más que nada porque me cansan tus excusas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3403f47a-05a4-4c31-a375-12e2390e88a5\', \'multiverseId\': 365463}, \'multiverseid\': 365463}, {\'name\': "Courtière d\'Azorius", \'text\': "Quand la Courtière d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, détenez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Vous avez le droit de garder le silence. Essentiellement parce que je suis lasse d\'entendre vos excuses. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e5991b-1db6-420f-9a06-0c541da6a97e\', \'multiverseId\': 356015}, \'multiverseid\': 356015}, {\'name\': \'Polizia Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando la Polizia Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, trattieni una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quella creatura non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai il diritto di rimanere in silenzio. Principalmente perché le chiacchiere mi annoiano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71318904-b6e6-4b65-9853-081ad941b2fc\', \'multiverseId\': 356289}, \'multiverseid\': 356289}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの拘引者\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの拘引者が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを留置する。（あなたの次のターンまで、そのクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたには黙秘権があります。言い訳をうだうだ聞かされたくないので。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c51540b-4a57-4bf4-bdbd-eb93a32912f5\', \'multiverseId\': 356563}, \'multiverseid\': 356563}, {\'name\': \'아조리우스 체포원\', \'text\': \'아조리우스 체포원이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 억류한다. (당신의 다음 턴이 될 때까지 그 생물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없으며, 그 생물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"당신은 묵비권을 행사할 수 있으며, 행사하는 걸 권장한다. 변명을 듣는 것도 지겨우니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d39abd6b-63db-4093-9ce6-12dc995d312f\', \'multiverseId\': 357385}, \'multiverseid\': 357385}, {\'name\': \'Encarceradora Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando Encarceradora Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, detenha a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. (Até o seu próximo turno, aquela criatura não pode atacar nem bloquear e as habilidades ativadas dela não podem ser ativadas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Você tem o direito de permanecer em silêncio. Principalmente porque cansei de suas desculpas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71d834a-428e-4f60-b8bb-9535ec313e06\', \'multiverseId\': 356837}, \'multiverseid\': 356837}, {\'name\': \'Задержатель Азориусов\', \'text\': \'Когда Задержатель Азориусов выходит на поле битвы, задержите целевое существо под контролем оппонента. (До вашего следующего хода то существо не может атаковать или блокировать, и его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«У вас есть право хранить молчание. В основном потому, что я устала слушать оправдания».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d79d08-3cd5-4215-b558-fd3b2fff82ec\', \'multiverseId\': 355193}, \'multiverseid\': 355193}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立逮捕人\', \'text\': \'当俄佐立逮捕人进战场时，拘留目标由对手操控的生物。（直到你的下个回合，该生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「你有权保持缄默。主要是因为我懒得听你找藉口。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752579ea-f83a-4e38-bd17-002962470946\', \'multiverseId\': 357111}, \'multiverseid\': 357111}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立逮捕人\', \'text\': \'當俄佐立逮捕人進戰場時，拘留目標由對手操控的生物。（直到你的下個回合，該生物不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「你有權保持緘默。主要是因為我懶得聽你找藉口。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df3441f-6008-4710-89b7-a61ad508ace3\', \'multiverseId\': 355467}, \'multiverseid\': 355467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Gildeneingang\', \'text\': \'Der Azorius-Gildeneingang kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land — Tor\', \'flavor\': \'Betritt den Senat, die Welt der Justiz, wo einst Ravnicas Grundstein gelegt wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58450907-e4ed-4584-8a17-6c23308cf376\', \'multiverseId\': 355973}, \'multiverseid\': 355973}, {\'name\': \'Portal del Gremio Azorio\', \'text\': \'El Portal del Gremio Azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Portal\', \'flavor\': \'Únete al Senado, la sede de la justicia y base de la sociedad de Rávnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abf4851-d9ed-40f3-80cb-01209393aeae\', \'multiverseId\': 365695}, \'multiverseid\': 365695}, {\'name\': "Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Porte de la guilde d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain : porte\', \'flavor\': \'Entrez au Sénat, siège de la justice et fondation de la société ravnicane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356247&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50818c42-9b18-406d-97c4-7bd148916763\', \'multiverseId\': 356247}, \'multiverseid\': 356247}, {\'name\': \'Cancello della Gilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Il Cancello della Gilda Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Cancello\', \'flavor\': \'Entrate nel Senato, la sede della giustizia e il fondamento della società di Ravnica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b28a30-b89b-40de-b2ab-d06ceeb756bb\', \'multiverseId\': 356521}, \'multiverseid\': 356521}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスのギルド門はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 門\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカ社会の礎、正義の_や_どると_こ_ろ、評議会は_こ_の中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f273a86-4dda-47c3-8cf9-6d16abcc2887\', \'multiverseId\': 356795}, \'multiverseid\': 356795}, {\'name\': \'아조리우스 길드관문\', \'text\': \'아조리우스 길드관문은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {W} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 관문\', \'flavor\': \'라브니카 사회의 기초이자 열 길드 간 정의의 근원인 아조리우스 상원을 찾은 것을 환영한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a346d1f3-a3ab-4c29-b8fc-079200acd7f4\', \'multiverseId\': 357617}, \'multiverseid\': 357617}, {\'name\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius\', \'text\': \'Portão da Guilda Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Portão\', \'flavor\': \'Entrem no SenAdo, sede da justiça e aLicerce da sociEdade ravnIcana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd54dcf-9761-4088-8c8e-3f7466aab4ff\', \'multiverseId\': 357069}, \'multiverseid\': 357069}, {\'name\': \'Врата Гильдии Азориусов\', \'text\': \'Врата Гильдии Азориусов выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {W} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Врата\', \'flavor\': \'Здесь _г_лавенствует Сенат — оплот правосудия и фундамент, на котором з_и_ждется общество Рав_н_ики.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f01c576b-a352-4d6d-b3a7-814cb8bed184\', \'multiverseId\': 355425}, \'multiverseid\': 355425}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立公会门\', \'text\': \'俄佐立公会门须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地～门\', \'flavor\': \'此门通往参议院，拉尼卡天空下的正义础石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fdd1f94-da2f-4ffc-8e2a-76078a53e88f\', \'multiverseId\': 357343}, \'multiverseid\': 357343}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立公會門\', \'text\': \'俄佐立公會門須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地～門\', \'flavor\': \'此門通往參議院，拉尼卡天空下的正義礎石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd0fbe8-31f9-4116-abf2-2beb020b83bb\', \'multiverseId\': 355699}, \'multiverseid\': 355699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Justiziarin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Azorius-Justiziarin ins Spiel kommt, inhaftiere bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die deine Gegner kontrollieren. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug können diese Kreaturen nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Potential zum Begehen einer Straftat bedarf weiterer Nachforschungen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa2be24-78fe-4f81-bc46-8d0b449360b1\', \'multiverseId\': 355742}, \'multiverseid\': 355742}, {\'name\': \'Justiciar azorio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Justiciar azorio entre al campo de batalla, detén hasta dos criaturas objetivo que controlan tus oponentes. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas no pueden atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu potencial para cometer un crimen justifica una investigación más a fondo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c63c476-b2c9-4739-89c7-a5ca0e888dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 365464}, \'multiverseid\': 365464}, {\'name\': "Justicière d\'Azorius", \'text\': "Quand la Justicière d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, détenez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées que vos adversaires contrôlent. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures ne peuvent ni attaquer ni bloquer et leurs capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'éventualité que vous commettiez un crime mérite une enquête plus approfondie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356016&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d8d096-dd9d-42ba-87a1-28764e0220fb\', \'multiverseId\': 356016}, \'multiverseid\': 356016}, {\'name\': \'Magistrato Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando il Magistrato Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, trattieni fino a due creature bersaglio controllate dai tuoi avversari. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature non possono attaccare o bloccare e le loro abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La possibilità che tu commetta un crimine ci autorizza a compiere ulteriori indagini."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b46b64f-7e3f-4798-8a84-b515b56e01b4\', \'multiverseId\': 356290}, \'multiverseid\': 356290}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大司法官\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大司法官が戦場に出たとき、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーを最大２体まで対象とし、それらを留置する。（あなたの次のターンまで、それらのクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それらの起動型能力は起動できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたが犯罪をおかす可能性を考えると、更なる取り調べが必要のようです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba61b3fa-abc9-4ac2-bb69-e501a82e3649\', \'multiverseId\': 356564}, \'multiverseid\': 356564}, {\'name\': \'아조리우스 재판관\', \'text\': \'아조리우스 재판관이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 억류한다. (당신의 다음 턴이 될 때까지 그 생물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없으며, 그 생물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"당신은 범죄 가능성이 높기 때문에 추가 수사가 필요하다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b65811e-8305-4f4d-97b2-5a2db390cb5a\', \'multiverseId\': 357386}, \'multiverseid\': 357386}, {\'name\': \'Justiciar Azorius\', \'text\': \'Quando Justiciar Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, detenha até duas criaturas alvo que seus oponentes controlem. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas criaturas não podem atacar nem bloquear e as habilidades ativadas delas não podem ser ativadas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Seu potencial para cometer crimes legitima maiores investigações."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248c4830-f09b-4b33-aac3-e26635b08d06\', \'multiverseId\': 356838}, \'multiverseid\': 356838}, {\'name\': \'Юстициар Азориусов\', \'text\': \'Когда Юстициар Азориусов выходит на поле битвы, задержите не более двух целевых существ под контролем ваших оппонентов. (До вашего следующего хода те существа не могут атаковать или блокировать, и их активируемые способности не могут быть активированы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Ваша способность совершить преступление дает право на проведение доследования».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3237027c-a683-4291-a7fd-9702b82ec716\', \'multiverseId\': 355194}, \'multiverseid\': 355194}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立大司法\', \'text\': \'当俄佐立大司法进战场时，拘留至多两个目标由对手操控的生物。（直到你的下一个回合，这些生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你有犯罪的可能性，因此有必要进一步调查。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93229f2c-f9ee-4076-ad6c-c3d6ac7adf8f\', \'multiverseId\': 357112}, \'multiverseid\': 357112}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立大司法\', \'text\': \'當俄佐立大司法進戰場時，拘留至多兩個目標由對手操控的生物。（直到你的下一個回合，這些生物不能進行攻擊或阻擋，其起動式異能也不能起動。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「你有犯罪的可能性，因此有必要進一步調查。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f42c3e23-f44b-43e9-9e60-eac47bac5ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 355468}, \'multiverseid\': 355468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Runenschlüssel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W} oder {U}.\\n{W}{U}: Der Azorius-Runenschlüssel wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/2 weißen und blauen fliegenden Vogel-Artefaktkreatur.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Je höher der Verstand sich erhebt, desto tiefgründiger ist das Verständnis für das Rechtswesen." —Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36cd8775-f1b3-4bff-8f89-dbb8da65cf7a\', \'multiverseId\': 355961}, \'multiverseid\': 355961}, {\'name\': \'Llave rúnica azoria\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {W} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{W}{U}: La Llave rúnica azoria se convierte en una criatura artefacto Ave blanca y azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuanto más alto vuela la mente, mayor es la comprensión de la ley." —Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6290c2ba-6256-4482-99a8-257294ec6738\', \'multiverseId\': 365683}, \'multiverseid\': 365683}, {\'name\': "Runeclé d\'Azorius", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U} à votre réserve.\\n{W}{U} : La Runeclé d\'Azorius devient une créature-artefact 2/2 blanche et bleue Oiseau avec le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Plus l\'esprit s\'élève, mieux il comprend la loi. » —Isperia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a46a0939-8ebd-45a5-8a34-ade2596dd8ea\', \'multiverseId\': 356235}, \'multiverseid\': 356235}, {\'name\': \'Runachiave Azorius\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{W}{U}: La Runachiave Azorius diventa una creatura artefatto Uccello 2/2 bianca e blu con volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Più in alto si eleva la mente, maggiore è la sua comprensione della legge." —Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc6f698-65db-4314-acc1-f5b37b998fa5\', \'multiverseId\': 356509}, \'multiverseid\': 356509}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの魔鍵\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{U}を加える。\\n{W}{U}：アゾリウスの魔鍵はターン終了時まで、飛行を持つ白であり青である２/２の鳥・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「精神がさらなる高みへと昇れば、それだけ法の理解も深まります。」 ――イスペリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215d4fca-350f-4fad-917b-94e56fbed009\', \'multiverseId\': 356783}, \'multiverseid\': 356783}, {\'name\': \'아조리우스 열쇠룬\', \'text\': \'{T}: {W} 또는 {U}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{W}{U}: 턴종료까지, 아조리우스 열쇠룬은 비행 능력을 가진 2/2 백색 및 청색 조류 마법물체 생물이 된다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"생각의 지평이 넓어지면 법에 대한 이해도 높아지는 법이지." —이스페리아\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a61c390-6fbf-4e11-b055-0dc7bf36bfe1\', \'multiverseId\': 357605}, \'multiverseid\': 357605}, {\'name\': \'Chave Rúnica Azorius\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{W}{U}: Chave Rúnica Azorius torna-se uma criatura artefato branca e azul 2/2 do tipo Ave com voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanto mais elevada a mente, maior é a sua compreensão da lei." — Isperia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4bbac3-7d07-4a2b-b75b-1a27544b9811\', \'multiverseId\': 357057}, \'multiverseid\': 357057}, {\'name\': \'Рунный Ключ Азориусов\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {W} или {U} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{W}{U}: Рунный Ключ Азориусов становится артефактным существом 2/2 белая и синяя Птица с Полетом до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Чем выше поднимается разум, тем лучше он постигает закон». — Исперия\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d33c27b4-f6a4-467e-bf1e-fc9c69cd0201\', \'multiverseId\': 355413}, \'multiverseid\': 355413}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立符镇兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的法术力池中。\\n{W}{U}：俄佐立符镇兵成为2/2白蓝双色，具飞行异能的鸟神器生物直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「心智提升得越高，就越能理解律法。」 ～伊佩利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac81c2d-d38e-4845-a650-0c17ea56c2ac\', \'multiverseId\': 357331}, \'multiverseid\': 357331}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立符鎮兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{W}或{U}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{W}{U}：俄佐立符鎮兵成為2/2白藍雙色，具飛行異能的鳥神器生物直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「心智提昇得越高，就越能理解律法。」 ～伊佩利\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce52690-c397-4edd-a14b-9a7095d0a0aa\', \'multiverseId\': 355687}, \'multiverseid\': 355687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azors Verleser\', \'text\': \'Lege zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Filibustereimarke auf Azors Verleser. Falls dann fünf oder mehr Filibustereimarken auf Azors Verlesern liegen, gewinnst du das Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine Quelle dir Schaden zufügt, entferne eine Filibustereimarke von Azors Verlesern.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91007eb7-177f-463b-8cb0-45e062e599f3\', \'multiverseId\': 355946}, \'multiverseid\': 355946}, {\'name\': \'Oradores de Azor\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador de obstrucción sobre los Oradores de Azor. Luego, si los Oradores de Azor tienen cinco o más contadores de obstrucción sobre ellos, ganas el juego.\\nSiempre que una fuente te haga daño, remueve un contador de obstrucción de los Oradores de Azor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce1fefb-d161-4cec-8ce2-dced3dcec1de\', \'multiverseId\': 365668}, \'multiverseid\': 365668}, {\'name\': "Rhéteurs d\'Azor", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur « obstruction » sur les Rhéteurs d\'Azor. Ensuite, si les Rhéteurs d\'Azor ont au moins cinq marqueurs « obstruction » sur eux, vous gagnez la partie.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une source vous inflige des blessures, retirez un marqueur « obstruction » des Rhéteurs d\'Azor.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ed1a98-82dc-4181-b5af-6c468100e93f\', \'multiverseId\': 356220}, \'multiverseid\': 356220}, {\'name\': \'Oratori di Azor\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino ostruzionismo sugli Oratori di Azor. Poi, se gli Oratori di Azor hanno cinque o più segnalini ostruzionismo, vinci la partita.\\nOgniqualvolta una fonte ti infligge danno, rimuovi un segnalino ostruzionismo dagli Oratori di Azor.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42c277d-2ebf-401e-b1a8-329e5e862fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 356494}, \'multiverseid\': 356494}, {\'name\': \'アゾールの雄弁家\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、アゾールの雄弁家の上に牛歩カウンターを１個置く。その後、アゾールの雄弁家の上に牛歩カウンターが５個以上置かれている場合、あなたはこのゲームに勝利する。\\n発生源１つがあなたにダメージを与えるたび、アゾールの雄弁家の上から牛歩カウンターを１個取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4435750-5804-46e5-b0dc-8b0397fea894\', \'multiverseId\': 356768}, \'multiverseid\': 356768}, {\'name\': \'아조르의 웅변가들\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 아조르의 웅변가들에 발언 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그러고 나서 아조르의 웅변가들이 발언 카운터를 다섯 개 이상 가지고 있다면 당신이 게임에서 승리한다.\\n어느 원천이 당신에게 피해를 입힐 때마다, 아조르의 웅변가들로부터 발언 카운터 한 개를 제거한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 참모\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de9e47de-1c73-43be-a90d-10d1f47040e7\', \'multiverseId\': 357590}, \'multiverseid\': 357590}, {\'name\': \'Locutores de Azor\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador de obstrução em Locutores de Azor. Depois, se Locutores de Azor tiver cinco ou mais marcadores de obstrução, você vence o jogo.\\nToda vez que uma fonte causar dano a você, remova um marcador de obstrução de Locutores de Azor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea6c0e5-656f-4bd2-bf8e-926e86b4e1df\', \'multiverseId\': 357042}, \'multiverseid\': 357042}, {\'name\': \'Краснословы Азора\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки положите один жетон обструкции на Краснословов Азора. Затем, если на Краснословах Азора есть не менее пяти жетонов обструкции, вы выигрываете партию.\\nКаждый раз, когда источник наносит вам повреждения, удалите один жетон обструкции с Краснословов Азора.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Советник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9949f2bb-0434-42f8-8598-f14eb403cda0\', \'multiverseId\': 355398}, \'multiverseid\': 355398}, {\'name\': \'俄佐朗诵人\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，在俄佐朗诵人上放置一个阻挠指示物。然后如果俄佐朗诵人上面有五个阻挠指示物，你便赢得这盘游戏。\\n每当任一来源对你造成伤害时，从俄佐朗诵人上移去一个阻挠指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c06d6e0-a59f-4b42-b5b6-280dc46bb842\', \'multiverseId\': 357316}, \'multiverseid\': 357316}, {\'name\': \'俄佐朗誦人\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，在俄佐朗誦人上放置一個阻撓指示物。然後如果俄佐朗誦人上面有五個阻撓指示物，你便贏得這盤遊戲。\\n每當任一來源對你造成傷害時，從俄佐朗誦人上移去一個阻撓指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／參謀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0597cf1-313a-4fe2-b1f7-ad465845b612\', \'multiverseId\': 355672}, \'multiverseid\': 355672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balgwaran\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Der Balgwaran erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Preise für Holz und Kohlen stiegen, fanden die Schmiede kreative Lösungen, um ihr Schmiedefeuer in Gang zu halten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355824&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a937212-d3f2-4381-b4ce-a69ae516bb48\', \'multiverseId\': 355824}, \'multiverseid\': 355824}, {\'name\': \'Lagarto rugiente\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: El Lagarto rugiente obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme subía el precio de la madera y el carbón, los herreros encontraron formas creativas de mantener sus forjas ardiendo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'796a4ac5-bca4-47a8-b46c-6b5eeb3c5583\', \'multiverseId\': 365546}, \'multiverseid\': 365546}, {\'name\': \'Lézard à soufflets\', \'text\': "{1}{R} : Le Lézard à soufflets gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': "Quand le prix du bois et du charbon s\'est mis à flamber, les forgerons ont trouvé des combustibles créatifs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c229bf8-6a0b-4f64-b27b-9cf97b6e5409\', \'multiverseId\': 356098}, \'multiverseid\': 356098}, {\'name\': \'Lucertola a Soffietto\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: La Lucertola a Soffietto prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'Con il crescere dei prezzi del legno e del carbone, i fabbri trovarono modi alternativi per mantenere accese le forge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efb8ce9-5671-4f04-a2f6-36d946c9e8db\', \'multiverseId\': 356372}, \'multiverseid\': 356372}, {\'name\': \'ふいごトカゲ\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：ふいごトカゲはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'木や石炭の価格が上昇したことで、鍛冶屋は創造的な手段を用いて工房の火を燃やし続けるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ef7d96-ac13-4056-93dd-1b59c9c70aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 356646}, \'multiverseid\': 356646}, {\'name\': \'풀무 도마뱀\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: 풀무 도마뱀은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'땔감과 석탄의 가격이 오르자, 대장장이들은 용광로에 불을 계속 지필 수 있는 창의적인 방법을 찾아냈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc1ccac1-29d8-4a03-9961-c93510334d90\', \'multiverseId\': 357468}, \'multiverseid\': 357468}, {\'name\': \'Lagarto de Fole\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Lagarto de Fole recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme os preços da madeira e do carvão subiam, os ferreiros encontravam formas criativas de manter suas forjas ardendo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234c52e8-0c51-4740-9145-4d2875959a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 356920}, \'multiverseid\': 356920}, {\'name\': \'Ящер Кузнечных Мехов\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Ящер Кузнечных Мехов получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'С ростом цен на древесину и уголь кузнецы стали находить другие способы поддерживать огонь в своих топках.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c2aff7c-4a00-4e3d-a098-7ce7f0fdbd6c\', \'multiverseId\': 355276}, \'multiverseid\': 355276}, {\'name\': \'嚎吼蜥蜴\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：嚎吼蜥蜴得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'由于木材和煤炭涨价，工匠找到了维持熔炉运作的创新方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c19523d7-d759-4806-8b78-9cfb4b5491e9\', \'multiverseId\': 357194}, \'multiverseid\': 357194}, {\'name\': \'嚎吼蜥蜴\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：嚎吼蜥蜴得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'由於木材和煤炭漲價，工匠找到了維持熔爐運作的創新方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ccc1fb3-da67-4f8c-b2d4-e9bddf3a9b51\', \'multiverseId\': 355550}, \'multiverseid\': 355550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannzauber\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zivilisation wird uns eingliedern, falls wir sie nicht überwältigen." —Sprecherin Zegana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355772&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d30ad4f-6bfb-4ace-a577-7bfb0b983fbe\', \'multiverseId\': 355772}, \'multiverseid\': 355772}, {\'name\': \'Esfumar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo instantáneo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La civilización nos subsumirá a menos que nosotros la aplastemos primero." —Portavoz Zegana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45dafdec-6169-4ba1-839b-94be0891b51b\', \'multiverseId\': 365494}, \'multiverseid\': 365494}, {\'name\': \'Dispersement\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort d\'éphémère ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Si nous ne la submergeons pas les premiers, la civilisation nous absorbera. » —Oratrice Zegana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244afa40-6ba9-4b51-bb7e-bb2a83bb5abc\', \'multiverseId\': 356046}, \'multiverseid\': 356046}, {\'name\': \'Sfatare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia istantaneo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La civiltà ci ingloberà a meno che non siamo noi a sopraffarla." —Oratrice Zegana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd3416fb-24cd-4657-8b8c-54515774e997\', \'multiverseId\': 356320}, \'multiverseid\': 356320}, {\'name\': \'払拭\', \'text\': \'インスタント呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「もし我々が文明を圧倒しなければ、文明が我々を取り込んでしまうだろう。」 ――話し手ゼガーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c6784b-ba82-4a73-80d0-e1bef783b53a\', \'multiverseId\': 356594}, \'multiverseid\': 356594}, {\'name\': \'주문해제\', \'text\': \'순간마법 주문 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리가 문명을 압도해버리지 않으면 문명이 우리를 집어삼킬 것이오." —연설자 제가나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65449a80-fe22-4cc6-aeff-f154f2d247b0\', \'multiverseId\': 357416}, \'multiverseid\': 357416}, {\'name\': \'Delir\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica instantânea alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se não oprimirmos a civilização, ela irá nos assimilar." — Oradora Zegana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eeb00e7-ba69-420a-b4c1-58967d07e309\', \'multiverseId\': 356868}, \'multiverseid\': 356868}, {\'name\': \'Рассеять\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое мгновенное заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Цивилизация подчинит нас, если мы первыми не сокрушим ее». — спикер Зегана\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd2428b-f7d9-4580-9bd1-be1aa896a317\', \'multiverseId\': 355224}, \'multiverseid\': 355224}, {\'name\': \'云散\', \'text\': \'反击目标瞬间咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我们不征服文明，必将被它纳入。」 ～演说家洁加娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9065b01a-8761-4c3b-a6f3-019f0f8b3722\', \'multiverseId\': 357142}, \'multiverseid\': 357142}, {\'name\': \'雲散\', \'text\': \'反擊目標瞬間咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我們不征服文明，必將被它納入。」 ～演說家潔加娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2554d15-2ec2-41b3-920e-22b72a744f88\', \'multiverseId\': 355498}, \'multiverseid\': 355498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basar-Krovod\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Basar-Krovod angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl +0/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe diese Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Die Frächtergemeinschaft hat großen Einfluss im Kaufmannsstand von Ravnica. Ohne sie läuft in der Stadt nicht viel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355743&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'480c301b-7e8f-4076-9ffc-30eace42d322\', \'multiverseId\': 355743}, \'multiverseid\': 355743}, {\'name\': \'Krovod del bazar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Krovod del bazar ataque, otra criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +0/+2 hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'La Cooperativa transportista tiene una gran influencia sobre la clase comerciante de Rávnica. Sin ella, poco se mueve en la ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4b645e-5a58-403e-a1de-44a8db84c193\', \'multiverseId\': 365465}, \'multiverseid\': 365465}, {\'name\': \'Krovod du bazar\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Krovod du bazar attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée gagne +0/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'La Coopérative des transporteurs influe considérablement sur la classe marchande de Ravnica. Sans elle, rien ou presque ne bouge dans la cité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356017&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'907bf6ef-317a-4a1e-8623-e9f12092d361\', \'multiverseId\': 356017}, \'multiverseid\': 356017}, {\'name\': \'Krovod del Bazaar\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Krovod del Bazaar attacca, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +0/+2 fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Il Trasporto Collettivo esercita grande influenza sulla classe mercantile di Ravnica. Senza di esso, nulla si muove in città.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ed1eb61-d5c9-46ef-a86e-9f446c8c4a62\', \'multiverseId\': 356291}, \'multiverseid\': 356291}, {\'name\': \'市場のクロヴァド\', \'text\': \'市場のクロヴァドが攻撃するたび、他の攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋０/＋２の修整を受ける。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'運び屋組合はラヴニカの商人階級に対して大きな影響力を持っている。これがなければ市内の物流が滞るのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e851f1a-08b5-4158-bb72-8a3646489dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 356565}, \'multiverseid\': 356565}, {\'name\': \'상점가 크로보드\', \'text\': \'상점가 크로보드가 공격할 때마다, 다른 공격생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +0/+2를 받는다. 그 생물을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'운수업자 조합은 라브니카 상인들 사이에서 막대한 영향력을 행사한다. 그들이 없다면 도시 내의 운수가 사실상 마비된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b685ed-7009-4bce-aa63-f75af179aaee\', \'multiverseId\': 357387}, \'multiverseid\': 357387}, {\'name\': \'Krovod do Bazar\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Krovod do Bazar ataca, outra criatura atacante alvo recebe +0/+2 até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'A Cooperativa de Coleta tem grande influência sobre a classe dos mercadores de Ravnica. Sem ela, a cidade para.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5c5a77-a2d5-4cfb-b3fb-45bd17841830\', \'multiverseId\': 356839}, \'multiverseid\': 356839}, {\'name\': \'Базарный Кровод\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Базарный Кровод атакует, другое целевое атакующее существо получает +0/+2 до конца хода. Разверните то существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Артель носильщиков обладает большим влиянием среди торговцев Равники. Без них в городе практически все стоит на месте.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c0f892-6195-4cd5-a77f-b2d2500823cf\', \'multiverseId\': 355195}, \'multiverseid\': 355195}, {\'name\': \'市集克瓦兽\', \'text\': \'每当市集克瓦兽攻击时，另一个目标进行攻击的生物得+0/+2直到回合结束。重置该生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'载运公合对拉尼卡商贩阶级握有极大的影响力。少了它，整座城市什么事都做不成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c90f4b-d1e3-487f-ac48-ed1bb48406d0\', \'multiverseId\': 357113}, \'multiverseid\': 357113}, {\'name\': \'市集克瓦獸\', \'text\': \'每當市集克瓦獸攻擊時，另一個目標進行攻擊的生物得+0/+2直到回合結束。重置該生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'載運公合對拉尼卡商販階級握有極大的影響力。少了它，整座城市什麼事都做不成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d6e17a-71cb-44c3-8bb3-4a0bb080806b\', \'multiverseId\': 355469}, \'multiverseid\': 355469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bedrohlicher Leichenflößer\', \'text\': \'Falls eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur gelegt würde, die du kontrollierst, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele +1/+1-Marken darauf gelegt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Schwäche liegt nicht in der Natur des Schwarms.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f1a821-1089-4045-b14d-907502e6c3ba\', \'multiverseId\': 355888}, \'multiverseid\': 355888}, {\'name\': \'Guíacuerpos amenazante\', \'text\': \'Si fueran a colocarse uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas, en vez de eso, se coloca el doble de esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': \'La debilidad no forma parte de la naturaleza del Enjambre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff288f5a-7877-40c0-a367-63602ce7430d\', \'multiverseId\': 365610}, \'multiverseid\': 365610}, {\'name\': \'Menace guidecorps\', \'text\': \'Si au moins un marqueur +1/+1 devait être placé sur une créature que vous contrôlez, placez deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': "La faiblesse n\'est pas dans la nature de l\'Essaim.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a62d8e48-ebc2-44d7-8ac0-0ab02c67cbef\', \'multiverseId\': 356162}, \'multiverseid\': 356162}, {\'name\': \'Minaccia della Guida dei Cadaveri\', \'text\': \'Se uno o più segnalini +1/+1 stanno per essere messi su una creatura che controlli, metti invece su quella creatura il doppio di quei segnalini.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': \'La debolezza non è nella natura dello Sciame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c06e2707-4305-49c9-b1a8-0cd47078af76\', \'multiverseId\': 356436}, \'multiverseid\': 356436}, {\'name\': \'屍体屋の脅威\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個以上置かれる場合、代わりにその２倍の数の＋１/＋１カウンターをそれの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': \'そもそも大群は弱点という概念とは無縁だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47bff735-2a12-4ab0-89ca-8d86d5d8234e\', \'multiverseId\': 356710}, \'multiverseid\': 356710}, {\'name\': \'위협적인 시체인도자\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 +1/+1 카운터를 한 개 이상 얻으려고 한다면, 그 생물은 대신에 그 두 배만큼의 +1/+1 카운터를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 진균\', \'flavor\': \'골가리 무리에게 약점이란 존재하지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e406c8-35f6-49dc-ae26-97533db2e436\', \'multiverseId\': 357532}, \'multiverseid\': 357532}, {\'name\': \'Ameaça Guia de Cadáver\', \'text\': \'Se um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 seriam colocados em uma criatura que você controla, em vez disso, é colocado nela o dobro de marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': \'A fraqueza não é da natureza do Enxame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ba56bbd-ba61-405b-899a-317ef9062f24\', \'multiverseId\': 356984}, \'multiverseid\': 356984}, {\'name\': \'Гроза Сплавщиков Трупов\', \'text\': \'Если на существо под вашим контролем должны быть помещены один или более жетонов +1/+1, вместо этого на то существо помещается в два раза больше жетонов +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень\', \'flavor\': \'Слабости нет места в Рое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d69c224-3456-4c23-9a23-83b49116ef1a\', \'multiverseId\': 355340}, \'multiverseid\': 355340}, {\'name\': \'占尸威逼\', \'text\': \'如果将会在由你操控的生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物，则改为在其上放置该数量两倍的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'软弱非群落的天性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95218e70-593c-4e59-bffb-2ab7180f6fab\', \'multiverseId\': 357258}, \'multiverseid\': 357258}, {\'name\': \'占屍威逼\', \'text\': \'如果將會在由你操控的生物上放置一個或數個+1/+1指示物，則改為在其上放置該數量兩倍的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'軟弱非群落的天性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c472d8d-0bd3-4022-901d-7915441d0abd\', \'multiverseId\': 355614}, \'multiverseid\': 355614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beherrscher der Leere\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Beherrscher der Leere ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Er macht sich seine eigenen Gesetze, und das ist gefährlich für alle, die Frieden und Wohlstand lieben. Bei Sichtung auf der Stelle töten." —Mirela, Azorius-Husarin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12321403-6bec-441e-b8b3-57e26bdc13ec\', \'multiverseId\': 355792}, \'multiverseid\': 355792}, {\'name\': \'Esgrimevacío\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Esgrimevacío entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se inventa sus propias leyes, y eso es peligroso para todo amante de la paz y la prosperidad. Mátenlo en cuanto lo vean." —Mirela, húsar azoria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27047023-6ca3-4d0a-b53f-4a73b97586a0\', \'multiverseId\': 365514}, \'multiverseid\': 365514}, {\'name\': \'Manipulateur de néant\', \'text\': \'Quand le Manipulateur de néant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Il invente ses propres lois, et c\'est dangereux pour tous ceux qui aiment la paix et la prospérité. Tuez-le à vue. » —Mirela, hussarde d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'804b74d5-b680-46fd-87a0-fe55ae99b995\', \'multiverseId\': 356066}, \'multiverseid\': 356066}, {\'name\': \'Manipolavuoto\', \'text\': \'Quando il Manipolavuoto entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi far tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Stabilisce da sé le proprie leggi e questo è un pericolo per tutti quelli che amano la pace e la prosperità. Uccidetelo a vista." —Mirela, ussara Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b767559c-d8c5-4a29-8a7f-0d5079dcf0ff\', \'multiverseId\': 356340}, \'multiverseid\': 356340}, {\'name\': \'虚無使い\', \'text\': \'虚無使いが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「あの男は自分で勝手に法を作ってしまう。平和と繁栄を愛する者にとっては危険なことよ。見つけ次第殺しなさい。」 ――アゾリウスの騎兵、ミレーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c4d0dd-ff68-4419-9be0-7fcc6945b9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 356614}, \'multiverseid\': 356614}, {\'name\': \'공허술사\', \'text\': \'공허술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"그는 자신만의 법을 만들었다. 그것은 평화와 번영을 사랑하는 모든 이에게 위험한 일이다. 발견 즉시 그를 사살하라." —아조리우스 경기병 미렐라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b9e298-a4ab-4e2c-afb2-53a7a27c330a\', \'multiverseId\': 357436}, \'multiverseid\': 357436}, {\'name\': \'Manipulador do Vácuo\', \'text\': \'Quando Manipulador do Vácuo entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele faz as próprias leis, e isso é perigoso para todos que amam a paz e a prosperidade. Se o virem, matem-no." — Mirela, hussarda azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14dab49e-7dc6-421c-9840-8d1df2ef3906\', \'multiverseId\': 356888}, \'multiverseid\': 356888}, {\'name\': \'Отправитель в Небытие\', \'text\': \'Когда Отправитель в Небытие выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевое существо в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Он сам создает законы — это опасно для всех, кто ценит мир и процветание. Убейте его при первой возможности». — Мирела, гусар Азориусов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13bede83-36ec-4c7b-9e02-f897dbf4f30c\', \'multiverseId\': 355244}, \'multiverseid\': 355244}, {\'name\': \'归虚法师\', \'text\': \'当归虚法师进战场时，你可以将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「他编造自己的法规，这会替喜爱和平与财富的人带来危害。格杀勿论。」 ～俄佐立轻骑兵米瑞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb537086-f06d-4632-92bd-d6a8e666d860\', \'multiverseId\': 357162}, \'multiverseid\': 357162}, {\'name\': \'歸虛法師\', \'text\': \'當歸虛法師進戰場時，你可以將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「他編造自己的法規，這會替喜愛和平與財富的人帶來危害。格殺勿論。」 ～俄佐立輕騎兵米瑞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eac3870-161d-4a06-b8ca-e4d95c861882\', \'multiverseId\': 355518}, \'multiverseid\': 355518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beweise vernichten\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Sein Beherrscher deckt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Land-Karte aufdeckt, dann legt er diese Karten auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder wusste, dass die Dimir den Schaden angerichtet hatten. Jeder hatte die Izzet im Verdacht, sie angeheuert zu haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72cabd7d-399b-40c2-803b-c8d276056622\', \'multiverseId\': 355800}, \'multiverseid\': 355800}, {\'name\': \'Destruir la evidencia\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo. Su controlador muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de tierra, luego pone esas cartas en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todos sabían que los dimir habían causado los daños. Todos sospechaban que los ízzet los habían contratado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3678c6e3-063d-413a-ba4f-2436a335bc74\', \'multiverseId\': 365522}, \'multiverseid\': 365522}, {\'name\': \'Détruisez les preuves !\', \'text\': "Détruisez le terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à révéler une carte de terrain, puis il met ces cartes dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Tout le monde savait que les Dimir étaient responsables des dégâts. Tout le monde soupçonnait les Izzet de les avoir engagés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356074&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d62d1f4-44ab-4359-8f6f-b7ccf61a028d\', \'multiverseId\': 356074}, \'multiverseid\': 356074}, {\'name\': \'Distruggere le Prove\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore rivela carte dalla cima del suo grimorio fino a rivelare una carta terra, poi mette quelle carte nel suo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Tutti sapevano che il danno era stato fatto dai Dimir. Tutti sospettavano che gli Izzet li avessero assoldati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57e6b3e-2f18-4b3f-a9ed-74899b139364\', \'multiverseId\': 356348}, \'multiverseid\': 356348}, {\'name\': \'証拠隠滅\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から、土地カードが公開されるまでカードを公開し続ける。その後それらのカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアが損害を与えたことは誰もが知っている。そして彼らを雇ったのはイゼットではないかと、誰もが疑っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'064c1c96-0a6a-4257-999c-367f547f90c0\', \'multiverseId\': 356622}, \'multiverseid\': 356622}, {\'name\': \'증거 인멸\', \'text\': \'대지 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 파괴한다. 그 대지의 조종자는 대지 카드가 나올 때까지 자신의 서고 맨 위에서부터 카드를 공개한 후, 공개된 카드들을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'범인이 디미르 길드라는 것은 공공연한 사실이었고, 모두가 그들 뒤에는 이젯 길드가 있을 것이라고 의심했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a99eb50f-135a-43ea-aef2-681106289054\', \'multiverseId\': 357444}, \'multiverseid\': 357444}, {\'name\': \'Destruir a Prova\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo. Seu controlador revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card de terreno. Depois, ele coloca aqueles cards no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todos sabiam que os Dimir haviam causado o estrago. Todos suspeitavam de que os Izzet os haviam contratado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73438160-a37b-4d69-9d70-0a80ed041716\', \'multiverseId\': 356896}, \'multiverseid\': 356896}, {\'name\': \'Уничтожение Улик\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю. Контролирующий ее игрок показывает карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажет карту земли, затем кладет те карты на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Все знали, что разрушения были делом рук Димиров. Все подозревали, что наняли их Иззеты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d22261-1883-4f09-8ecd-f3a53806640c\', \'multiverseId\': 355252}, \'multiverseid\': 355252}, {\'name\': \'毁灭证据\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。其操控者自其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止，然后将这些牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'人人都知道下手的是底密尔。人人都怀疑买凶的是伊捷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f37124-65fa-422e-a501-3d6c20012788\', \'multiverseId\': 357170}, \'multiverseid\': 357170}, {\'name\': \'毀滅證據\', \'text\': \'消滅目標地。其操控者自其牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張地牌為止，然後將這些牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'人人都知道下手的是底密爾。人人都懷疑買兇的是伊捷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8ba158-f15f-4dab-95e8-75ff0db06144\', \'multiverseId\': 355526}, \'multiverseid\': 355526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasenspulen-Seltsamkeit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erhält die Blasenspulen-Seltsamkeit +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Seltsamkeit\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gesetzesmagier der Azorius würden die Erschaffung von Seltsamkeiten gerne ächten, aber dazu müssten sie zunächst ihre langjährigen Streitigkeiten beilegen, wie diese zu klassifizieren sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8688ba10-fb28-4a7c-96bf-e491665dda6f\', \'multiverseId\': 355947}, \'multiverseid\': 355947}, {\'name\': \'Extraño de Bobinas Candentes\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Extraño de Bobinas Candentes obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno. Enderézalo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Extraño\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos de la ley azorios preferirían prohibir la creación de extraños, pero antes tendrían que cerrar su largo debate acerca de cómo clasificarlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6daa126-8bf0-41c3-be57-91ed143eb8d4\', \'multiverseId\': 365669}, \'multiverseid\': 365669}, {\'name\': \'Anomalie des Cylindres à turbines\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, l\'Anomalie des Cylindres à turbines gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : anomalie\', \'flavor\': "Les magelois d\'Azorius aimeraient interdire la création des anomalies, mais il leur faut d\'abord trancher un débat qui s\'éternise : dans quelle catégorie les classer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af00554-1cf7-4fc6-b7c9-866a8ea86542\', \'multiverseId\': 356221}, \'multiverseid\': 356221}, {\'name\': \'Bizzarria di Vescicospira\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, la Bizzarria di Vescicospira prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno. STAPpala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bizzarria\', \'flavor\': \'I maghi della legge Azorius vorrebbero proibire la creazione di bizzarrie, ma prima devono riuscire ad accordarsi su come classificarle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36d14f9-c931-4896-af81-78b24dc5209d\', \'multiverseId\': 356495}, \'multiverseid\': 356495}, {\'name\': \'膨れコイルの奇魔\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文を１つ唱えるたび、膨れコイルの奇魔はターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。これをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 奇魔\', \'flavor\': \'アゾリウスの法魔道士は奇魔の創造を禁止したがっているが、その前に何をもって奇魔とするかという、永きにわたる議論に決着をつけねばならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'585685c0-fd36-4196-a77b-eb09778b32cd\', \'multiverseId\': 356769}, \'multiverseid\': 356769}, {\'name\': \'불꽃고리 위어드\', \'text\': \'당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 블리스터코일 위어드는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 얻는다. 그것을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 위어드\', \'flavor\': \'아조리우스 법치술사들은 위어드 창조를 법으로 금지하기 전에 위어드의 정의에 대한 오랜 논쟁의 결론부터 내야 할 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9532d7f2-3b85-4be5-a512-c0d97741d554\', \'multiverseId\': 357591}, \'multiverseid\': 357591}, {\'name\': \'Bizarro da Helicosfera\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou feitiço, Bizarro da Helicosfera recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno. Desvire-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bizarro\', \'flavor\': \'Os magos legisladores dos Azorius gostariam de tornar a criação de bizarros ilegal, mas antes precisariam concluir seu antigo debate sobre como classificá-los.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae92a7ff-53d8-4b46-9565-3546cd8c6998\', \'multiverseId\': 357043}, \'multiverseid\': 357043}, {\'name\': \'Диковина Блистеркойла\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, Диковина Блистеркойла получает +1/+1 до конца хода. Разверните ее.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Диковина\', \'flavor\': \'Маги-законники Азориусов и рады бы объявить все диковины вне закона, но для того нужно еще разобраться, как их классифицировать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7d3ff6-9268-4d23-874c-063c3e95e490\', \'multiverseId\': 355399}, \'multiverseid\': 355399}, {\'name\': \'焦盘怪奇\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，焦盘怪奇得+1/+1直到回合结束。将之重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～怪奇\', \'flavor\': \'俄佐立律法师想要立法禁止制造怪奇，但他们必须先解决「如何定义怪奇」这项长久争议。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'954db071-c043-417e-814f-f30b4221adb7\', \'multiverseId\': 357317}, \'multiverseid\': 357317}, {\'name\': \'焦盤怪奇\', \'text\': \'每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，焦盤怪奇得+1/+1直到回合結束。將之重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～怪奇\', \'flavor\': \'俄佐立律法師想要立法禁止製造怪奇，但他們必須先解決「如何定義怪奇」這項長久爭議。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce5af50-ee96-4dd5-bd69-396b0cd774bc\', \'multiverseId\': 355673}, \'multiverseid\': 355673}]', "[{'name': 'Blutkrypta', 'text': '({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {R}.)\\nSowie die Blutkrypta ins Spiel kommt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Blutkrypta getappt ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': 'Wo die Toten als Zerstreuung, Dekor und Dessert dienen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355974&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecfa29f8-7109-4223-a7ab-0ef1e9cf8ee3', 'multiverseId': 355974}, 'multiverseid': 355974}, {'name': 'Cripta sangrienta', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.)\\nEn cuanto la Cripta sangrienta entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, la Cripta sangrienta entra al campo de batalla girada.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': 'Donde los muertos sirven como diversión, decoración y postre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365696&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd50aca54-ad68-4dcf-a446-8217dc5d7385', 'multiverseId': 365696}, 'multiverseid': 365696}, {'name': 'Crypte de sang', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.)\\nAu moment où la Crypte de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, la Crypte de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne', 'flavor': 'Ici, les morts servent de divertissement, de décor et de dessert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356248&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '527d1e39-6ccd-4bb7-87bb-58179a8764a4', 'multiverseId': 356248}, 'multiverseid': 356248}, {'name': 'Cripta di Sangue', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.)\\nMentre la Cripta di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, la Cripta di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.', 'type': 'Terra — Montagna Palude', 'flavor': 'Dove i morti servono da diversione, decorazione e dessert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356522&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02dad957-d9fb-421a-a08a-9b1cbebf1e24', 'multiverseId': 356522}, 'multiverseid': 356522}, {'name': '血の墓所', 'text': '（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。）\\n血の墓所が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはライフを２点支払ってもよい。そうしない場合、血の墓所はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': '死者が気晴らしであり、飾りであり、菓子である場所。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356796&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4a787fb-e4d5-4c02-a62c-88f52d22e298', 'multiverseId': 356796}, 'multiverseid': 356796}, {'name': '피바다 지하묘지', 'text': '({T}: {B} 또는 {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)\\n피바다 지하묘지가 전장에 들어오면서, 당신은 생명 2점을 지불할 수 있다. 그러지 않으면, 피바다 지하묘지는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '대지 — 늪 산', 'flavor': '죽은 자들이 놀잇감, 장식, 혹은 후식이 되어 봉사하는 곳이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357618&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39ff2460-edc7-4104-8a06-404ec489b576', 'multiverseId': 357618}, 'multiverseid': 357618}, {'name': 'Cripta de Sangue', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.)Conforme Cripta de Sangue entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, Cripta de Sangue entrará no campo de batalha virado.', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': 'Onde os mortos servem como distração, decoração e sobremesa.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357070&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1a27514-eb87-4c38-8cdc-13d0f5086c6f', 'multiverseId': 357070}, 'multiverseid': 357070}, {'name': 'Кровавый Склеп', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {B} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.)\\nПри выходе Кровавого Склепа на поле битвы вы можете заплатить 2 жизни. Если вы этого не делаете, Кровавый Склеп выходит на поле битвы повернутым.', 'type': 'Земля — Болото Гора', 'flavor': 'Здесь мертвецы служат в качестве развлечения, антуража и пищи.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355426&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '377aa8b6-3c3c-44d6-b63a-7c41775e9478', 'multiverseId': 355426}, 'multiverseid': 355426}, {'name': '血腥墓穴', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。）\\n于血腥墓穴进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，血腥墓穴须横置进战场。', 'type': '地～沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': '亡者成为娱乐、装饰品以及点心之处。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357344&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de2a27a6-ee12-4c84-81db-c74c3e5cb455', 'multiverseId': 357344}, 'multiverseid': 357344}, {'name': '血腥墓穴', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。）\\n於血腥墓穴進戰場時，你可以支付2點生命。如果你未如此作，血腥墓穴須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地～沼澤／山脈', 'flavor': '亡者成為娛樂、裝飾品以及點心之處。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355700&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6c0cac9-476e-4783-bc37-6d293b434572', 'multiverseId': 355700}, 'multiverseid': 355700}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutpfad-Riese\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nEntfesselt (Du kannst diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommen lassen. Sie kann nicht blocken, solange eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr liegt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn der Star von Juris Revue auftritt, quellen Blut und Zuschauer bis auf die Straße hinaus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c9d4ac8-80cb-4122-82bc-ef126b687b09\', \'multiverseId\': 355825}, \'multiverseid\': 355825}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Sangrelucha\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nDesatar. (Puedes hacer que esta criatura entre al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. No puede bloquear mientras tenga un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Es el artista estrella del elenco de Juri, sus espectáculos tienen admiradores y sangre derramada en las calles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea6bb12-d2f3-47ed-9857-f6a0ad547c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 365547}, \'multiverseid\': 365547}, {\'name\': \'Géant rixesang\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nEmportement (Vous pouvez faire arriver cette créature sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle ne peut pas bloquer tant qu\'elle a un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Clou de la Revue de Juri, il attire les foules et fait couler le sang jusque dans la rue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356099&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'092bbe48-3654-48a3-8ae2-decf866c8319\', \'multiverseId\': 356099}, \'multiverseid\': 356099}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Rissa Sanguinaria\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nScatenare (Puoi far entrare questa creatura nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1. Non può bloccare fintanto che ha un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'La stella della Rivista di Juri. I suoi spettacoli fanno riversare fan e sangue nelle strade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6250a466-a6b9-446c-b99e-12db73e52cb0\', \'multiverseId\': 356373}, \'multiverseid\': 356373}, {\'name\': \'血暴れの巨人\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'ジョーリ組のスターである彼のステージでは表通りまで観客と鮮血が溢れかえる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31a9b40-1a72-4384-b940-341d06338a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 356647}, \'multiverseid\': 356647}, {\'name\': \'유혈소동 거인\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n속박해제 (당신은 이 생물로 하여금 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어오도록 할 수 있다. 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 있는 한 방어할 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'그는 "주리의 풍자단" 소속 유명 연기자로, 그가 공연할 때마다 길거리는 그의 팬들과 피로 뒤덮인다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70155771-4009-40d4-8cc4-d1381c389fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 357469}, \'multiverseid\': 357469}, {\'name\': \'Gigante da Cólera Sanguinária\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nLiberar (Você pode fazer com que esta criatura entre no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1. Ela não poderá bloquear enquanto tiver um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Ele é a estrela da Trupe de Juri, e em seus shows fãs e sangue jorram pela rua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d216c0-111e-444d-8f69-7e51d7c90151\', \'multiverseId\': 356921}, \'multiverseid\': 356921}, {\'name\': \'Гигант Кровавой Стычки\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nБезудержность (Вы можете заставить это существо выйти на поле битвы с жетоном +1/+1 на нем. Оно не может блокировать, пока на нем есть жетон +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Он — главный номер труппы «Ревю Джури»; его представления всегда оставляют на улицах реки крови.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d9d39bd-057e-4373-b001-0e26264686fb\', \'multiverseId\': 355277}, \'multiverseid\': 355277}, {\'name\': \'血斗巨人\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'他是裘里剧团的明星演员，让街上满是剧迷与鲜血。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8055ca-5b55-48d6-855e-e5f85f823604\', \'multiverseId\': 357195}, \'multiverseid\': 357195}, {\'name\': \'血鬥巨人\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n脫韁（你可以讓此生物進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能進行阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'他是裘里劇團的明星演員，讓街上滿是劇迷與鮮血。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f24404-91d1-46ce-aa6a-8b6114e52b61\', \'multiverseId\': 355551}, \'multiverseid\': 355551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutspritzender Bandit\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nEntfesselt (Du kannst diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommen lassen. Sie kann nicht blocken, solange eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr liegt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Maske soll nicht seine Identität verbergen. Sie soll verhindern, dass er Eingeweide in die Augen bekommt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3fc92ac-1d7b-4fed-b2f9-29ea7d2bb43d\', \'multiverseId\': 355841}, \'multiverseid\': 355841}, {\'name\': \'Malhechor salpicador\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nDesatar. (Puedes hacer que esta criatura entre al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. No puede bloquear mientras tenga un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'La máscara no es para ocultar su identidad. Es para que las vísceras no le salpiquen a los ojos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b06461d-1f80-4d22-82b1-5a977ba973a5\', \'multiverseId\': 365563}, \'multiverseid\': 365563}, {\'name\': \'Étrangleur tacheté\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nEmportement (Vous pouvez faire arriver cette créature sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle ne peut pas bloquer tant qu\'elle a un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Le masque n\'a pas pour fonction de cacher son identité. Il protège ses yeux contre les éclaboussures de viscères.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356115&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f33e89-72b9-4067-a84d-45c59a912e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 356115}, \'multiverseid\': 356115}, {\'name\': \'Thug Schizzato\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nScatenare (Puoi far entrare questa creatura nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1. Non può bloccare fintanto che ha un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La maschera non serve a nascondere la sua identità. Serve a proteggerlo dagli schizzi di sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd9dd7c-65bd-4154-9a3a-3796908cec60\', \'multiverseId\': 356389}, \'multiverseid\': 356389}, {\'name\': \'跳ね散らす凶漢\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'仮面は彼の正体を隠すためのものではない。臓物が目に入らないようにするためのものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cb5956d-e54c-4d6c-84b5-86eef9d04149\', \'multiverseId\': 356663}, \'multiverseid\': 356663}, {\'name\': \'피튀기는 깡패\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n속박해제 (당신은 이 생물로 하여금 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어오도록 할 수 있다. 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 있는 한 방어할 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'가면은 그의 정체를 숨기기 위한 것이 아니라, 피묻은 내장이 눈에 들어가지 않도록 막아주는 도구다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d55cd4-4675-4601-b19b-86b2d5d75d50\', \'multiverseId\': 357485}, \'multiverseid\': 357485}, {\'name\': \'Rufião Esguichador\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nLiberar (Você pode fazer com que esta criatura entre no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1. Ela não poderá bloquear enquanto tiver um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'A máscara não é para ocultar sua identidade. É para impedir que as vísceras atinjam seus olhos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a346a317-d2ef-4688-bb0d-8b5b5b38a6d1\', \'multiverseId\': 356937}, \'multiverseid\': 356937}, {\'name\': \'Безудержный Головорез\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nБезудержность (Вы можете заставить это существо выйти на поле битвы с жетоном +1/+1 на нем. Оно не может блокировать, пока на нем есть жетон +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Он носит маску не для того, чтобы прятать лицо, а для того, чтобы на него не брызгали внутренности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2222c45-cdb1-4d3d-a2d2-71eb4d47ec55\', \'multiverseId\': 355293}, \'multiverseid\': 355293}, {\'name\': \'溅血刺客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'面具不是用来隐藏他的身分。这是用来不让内脏喷到他眼睛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b470bfd-62c5-46a3-a7b7-9b53fe2f1d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 357211}, \'multiverseid\': 357211}, {\'name\': \'濺血刺客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n脫韁（你可以讓此生物進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能進行阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'面具不是用來隱藏他的身分。這是用來不讓內臟噴到他眼睛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f34567-4d94-462c-82d1-90e17610bb1f\', \'multiverseId\': 355567}, \'multiverseid\': 355567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bockbrückentroll\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nReichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\n{1}{B}{G}: Regeneriere den Bockbrückentroll.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Troll\', \'flavor\': \'In den Golgari-Kolonien unerwünscht, fand er seinen eigenen dunklen Ort, um von dort aus den Schwarm zu repräsentieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd13d1c-5eb9-4a0b-8b9e-2d128c66b5a2\', \'multiverseId\': 355941}, \'multiverseid\': 355941}, {\'name\': \'Trol del viaducto\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nAlcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\n{1}{B}{G}: Regenera el Trol del viaducto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trol\', \'flavor\': \'Al no ser bienvenido en las colonias golgari, encontró su propio lugar tenebroso desde el cual representar al Enjambre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e697ec-77b6-4e75-94e3-bb18bad74cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 365663}, \'multiverseid\': 365663}, {\'name\': \'Troll des tréteaux\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\\nPortée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\n{1}{B}{G} : Régénérez le Troll des tréteaux.\', \'type\': \'Créature : troll\', \'flavor\': "Évincé des colonies Golgari, il s\'est trouvé un coin sombre où il représente l\'Essaim à sa manière.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1053147e-7f28-4056-8f7d-3f3a25810af1\', \'multiverseId\': 356215}, \'multiverseid\': 356215}, {\'name\': \'Troll del Traliccio\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nRaggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\n{1}{B}{G}: Rigenera il Troll del Traliccio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Troll\', \'flavor\': \'Non era il benvenuto nelle colonie Golgari, perciò si è trovato un luogo oscuro tutto suo da cui rappresentare lo Sciame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a2563d2-4e6b-4362-adb3-582cfeb67fc3\', \'multiverseId\': 356489}, \'multiverseid\': 356489}, {\'name\': \'構脚のトロール\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n到達（このクリーチャーでは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\n{1}{B}{G}：構脚のトロールを再生する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トロール\', \'flavor\': \'ゴルガリの集落でも受け入れられなかった彼は、暗がりに居場所を見つけ、そこから街路衆を代表するようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3456e482-dcb1-4838-8466-80d4eb3100df\', \'multiverseId\': 356763}, \'multiverseid\': 356763}, {\'name\': \'가대 트롤\', \'text\': \'수비태세\\n대공 (이 생물은 비행 능력을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\\n{1}{B}{G}: 가대 트롤을 재생한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 트롤\', \'flavor\': \'골가리 군락에서 환영받지 못한 이 트롤은 무리의 일원으로서 일할 수 있는 자신만의 어두운 장소를 찾아냈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f289e337-814d-4cd6-a5ff-2cfb856dbf40\', \'multiverseId\': 357585}, \'multiverseid\': 357585}, {\'name\': \'Trol de Viaduto\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nAlcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\\n{1}{B}{G}: Regenere Trol de Viaduto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trol\', \'flavor\': \'Indesejado nas colônias dos Golgari, ele achou seu próprio lugar tenebroso para representar o Enxame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b74dc17-0fa9-4e97-8a37-bc067cf2b061\', \'multiverseId\': 357037}, \'multiverseid\': 357037}, {\'name\': \'Эстакадный Тролль\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\nЗахват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\n{1}{B}{G}: регенерируйте Эстакадного Тролля.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тролль\', \'flavor\': \'Изгнанный из колонии Голгари, он нашел новое темное местечко, где можно было воплощать идеалы Роя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'586508f6-d2ab-4829-a6ff-ab2bd604f651\', \'multiverseId\': 355393}, \'multiverseid\': 355393}, {\'name\': \'栈桥巨魔\', \'text\': \'守军\\n延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n{1}{B}{G}：重生栈桥巨魔。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨魔\', \'flavor\': \'他在葛加理地盘不受欢迎，却找到了能让自己象征群落的黑暗位置。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe42429-5e65-41e2-8780-6d5a4e85550c\', \'multiverseId\': 357311}, \'multiverseid\': 357311}, {\'name\': \'棧橋巨魔\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\\n{1}{B}{G}：重生棧橋巨魔。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨魔\', \'flavor\': \'他在葛加理地盤不受歡迎，卻找到了能讓自己象徵群落的黑暗位置。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bed07a1-cd0b-4760-b8c9-166cf08c7e57\', \'multiverseId\': 355667}, \'multiverseid\': 355667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bohrrausch\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Endlich eine Waffe, die die Boros nicht konfiszieren können!" —Juri, Inhaber von Juris Revue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ca077a-c136-4104-84f7-0b406a7d601d\', \'multiverseId\': 355880}, \'multiverseid\': 355880}, {\'name\': \'Reguero de taladros\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +4/-4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por fin, un arma que los boros no pueden confiscar!" —Juri, propietario del elenco de Juri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41007644-18dc-436f-b993-07c64e021b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 365602}, \'multiverseid\': 365602}, {\'name\': \'Foret incontrôlé\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Enfin une arme que les Boros ne pourront pas confisquer ! » —Juri, propriétaire de la Revue de Juri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0435af3a-21ca-4bf3-8a31-60b87cb86cf8\', \'multiverseId\': 356154}, \'multiverseid\': 356154}, {\'name\': \'Follia di Trivelle\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +4/-4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Finalmente! Un\\\'arma che i Boros non possono confiscare!" —Juri, proprietario della Rivista di Juri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d7c31df-498a-4ab2-9fb5-d5946c37a31d\', \'multiverseId\': 356428}, \'multiverseid\': 356428}, {\'name\': \'穴開け三昧\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋４/－４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ついにボロスが没収できない武器ができた！」 ――ジョーリ組の経営者、ジョーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d853d7-3cfb-42e0-aafd-c8f21cf8722c\', \'multiverseId\': 356702}, \'multiverseid\': 356702}, {\'name\': \'무자비한 꿰뚫기\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +4/-4를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"드디어 보로스 놈들이 압수할 수 없는 무기가 생겼군!" —주리, "주리의 풍자단" 소유주\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad92e49-6f81-48e0-b695-799e14e26597\', \'multiverseId\': 357524}, \'multiverseid\': 357524}, {\'name\': \'Farra da Broca\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +4/-4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Finalmente uma arma que os Boros não podem confiscar!" — Juri, proprietário da Trupe de Juri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef2bc77-6bc9-4fa9-b15e-50495d2a57cd\', \'multiverseId\': 356976}, \'multiverseid\': 356976}, {\'name\': \'Войти в Раж\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +4/-4 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Наконец-то есть оружие, которое не смогут конфисковать Боросы!» — Джури, владелец «Ревю Джури»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab2f213-0149-442b-94ac-bc341d273626\', \'multiverseId\': 355332}, \'multiverseid\': 355332}, {\'name\': \'钻法无歇\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+4/-4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「终于有柄波洛斯无法没收的武器！」 ～裘里剧团业主裘里\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04fdd23c-35fb-4c51-b271-e26a79e99625\', \'multiverseId\': 357250}, \'multiverseid\': 357250}, {\'name\': \'鑽法無歇\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+4/-4直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「終於有柄波洛斯無法沒收的武器！」 ～裘里劇團業主裘里\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06349cff-b12e-427b-95b8-aad5b15e4daa\', \'multiverseId\': 355606}, \'multiverseid\': 355606}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brausende Böe\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\\nÜberlast {3}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauber für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, verändere seinen Text, indem du im Text alle Vorkommen von „deiner Wahl" durch „jeder" ersetzt.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Beim Wetter weiß man eher als bei den Izzet, woran man ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355766&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8c1816-6d94-4dcc-a7ac-a9be2561b5ff\', \'multiverseId\': 355766}, \'multiverseid\': 355766}, {\'name\': \'Bramarráfaga\', \'text\': \'Gira la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\nSobrecarga {3}{U}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia su texto reemplazando "la criatura objetivo" por "cada criatura".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El clima es más predecible que los ízzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b15211a5-83f4-4d0b-8f59-db16b97563be\', \'multiverseId\': 365488}, \'multiverseid\': 365488}, {\'name\': \'Forte bourrasque\', \'text\': \'Engagez une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\nSurcharge {3}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, modifiez son texte en remplaçant toutes les occurrences de « ciblé(e) » par « chaque ».)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les intempéries sont plus prévisibles que les Izzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356040&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca47c21-edd2-4ee8-8354-8e0bdf73d635\', \'multiverseId\': 356040}, \'multiverseid\': 356040}, {\'name\': \'Turbinante\', \'text\': \'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\nSovraccarico {3}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "una creatura bersaglio" con "ogni creatura".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'È più facile predire il tempo che non gli Izzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5af77b-1bed-4676-99d3-ca954b36a136\', \'multiverseId\': 356314}, \'multiverseid\': 356314}, {\'name\': \'暴突風\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\\n超過 {3}{U} （あなたはこの呪文をその超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうした場合、あなたがコントロールしていない各クリーチャーをそれぞれタップする。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットよりは天気の方が読みやすい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25eabc5c-cc39-4bae-aaa9-67820c990a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 356588}, \'multiverseid\': 356588}, {\'name\': \'강력돌풍\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하지 않는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\\n과부하 {3}{U} (당신은 과부하 비용을 지불하여 이 주문을 발동할 수 있다. 그럴 경우, 이 주문은 "당신이 조종하지 않는 각 생물을 탭한다"로 내용이 변한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'이젯 길드의 행동을 예측하는 건 날씨를 예측하는 것보다도 어렵다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81d35db-bdfa-45fc-8730-11e8be6b087e\', \'multiverseId\': 357410}, \'multiverseid\': 357410}, {\'name\': \'Rajada Tempestuosa\', \'text\': \'Vire a criatura alvo que você não controla.\\nSobrecarga {3}{U} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de sobrecarga. Se fizer isso, altere seu texto substituindo todas as ocorrências de "a criatura alvo" por "cada criatura".)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O clima é mais previsível do que os Izzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f79ef72-3f77-48c2-946a-82dc27904fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 356862}, \'multiverseid\': 356862}, {\'name\': \'Шквальный Удар\', \'text\': \'Поверните целевое существо не под вашим контролем.\\nПерегрузка {3}{U} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Перегрузки. Если вы это делаете, измените в его тексте все слова «целевой» на «каждый».)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Проще предсказывать погоду, чем поступки Иззетов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77240de9-95fc-4632-8009-82bf46f5eaea\', \'multiverseId\': 355218}, \'multiverseid\': 355218}, {\'name\': \'压制风\', \'text\': \'横置目标不由你操控的生物。\\n超载{3}{U}（你可以支付此咒语的超载费用来施放它。如果你如此作，将其中的「目标」字样全部更改为「每个」。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'预测气候比预测伊捷容易。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb510c71-99b9-42d2-baf9-6b1b5592a8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 357136}, \'multiverseid\': 357136}, {\'name\': \'壓制風\', \'text\': \'橫置目標不由你操控的生物。\\n超載{3}{U}（你可以支付此咒語的超載費用來施放它。如果你如此作，將其中的「目標」字樣全部更改為「每個」。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'預測氣候比預測伊捷容易。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336db0b4-335b-4b9d-8470-cf80f5784b68\', \'multiverseId\': 355492}, \'multiverseid\': 355492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brut von Rix Maadi\', \'text\': \'Entfesselt (Du kannst diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommen lassen. Sie kann nicht blocken, solange eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr liegt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Geradewegs aus der blutgetränkten Fantasie unseres erlauchten Parun!" —Nyoser, Bluthaus-Rädelsführer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98c62cfc-b0a2-496f-8162-e7b2066f76e3\', \'multiverseId\': 355935}, \'multiverseid\': 355935}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Rix Maadi\', \'text\': \'Desatar. (Puedes hacer que esta criatura entre al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. No puede bloquear mientras tenga un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Sacado directamente de la imaginación sangrienta de nuestro ilustre parun!" —Nyoser, cabecilla de Casa Sangrienta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b08043-ff04-44d4-904b-d24f88ce71a8\', \'multiverseId\': 365657}, \'multiverseid\': 365657}, {\'name\': \'Engeance de Rix Maadi\', \'text\': "Emportement (Vous pouvez faire arriver cette créature sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle ne peut pas bloquer tant qu\'elle a un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Issue tout droit de l\'imagination sanguinolente de notre illustrissime parun ! » —Nyoser, meneur de la Halle aux viscères", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9b1093-30b2-45e8-85e0-75d60c114c65\', \'multiverseId\': 356209}, \'multiverseid\': 356209}, {\'name\': \'Progenie di Rix Maadi\', \'text\': \'Scatenare (Puoi far entrare questa creatura nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1. Non può bloccare fintanto che ha un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore\', \'flavor\': \'"Direttamente dalla truculenta immaginazione del nostro illustre parun!" —Nyoser, capobanda della Casa del Sangue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec8e02e-3f7a-4bad-97d9-30085e8f4eef\', \'multiverseId\': 356483}, \'multiverseid\': 356483}, {\'name\': \'リックス・マーディの落とし子\', \'text\': \'解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「輝かしき我らがパルンの血にまみれた空想そのままに！」 ――流血の家の首謀者、ニョーゼル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daee384d-2d03-4b53-a528-9837fe212d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 356757}, \'multiverseid\': 356757}, {\'name\': \'릭스 마디의 자식\', \'text\': \'속박해제 (당신은 이 생물로 하여금 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어오도록 할 수 있다. 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 있는 한 방어할 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 괴수\', \'flavor\': \'"우리의 위대한 주인님의 피투성이 상상이 현실이 되었다!" —핏덩이 회관의 주모자 뇨세르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e473e4-14b6-486e-bea4-2e5a0bb068bc\', \'multiverseId\': 357579}, \'multiverseid\': 357579}, {\'name\': \'Prole de Rix Maadi\', \'text\': \'Liberar (Você pode fazer com que esta criatura entre no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1. Ela não poderá bloquear enquanto tiver um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Direto da imaginação sangrenta de nosso ilustre parun!" — Nyoser, líder do Clube da Sangria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64614f20-5e36-42ae-9768-b5f3cf9e8385\', \'multiverseId\': 357031}, \'multiverseid\': 357031}, {\'name\': \'Порождение Рикс-Маади\', \'text\': \'Безудержность (Вы можете заставить это существо выйти на поле битвы с жетоном +1/+1 на нем. Оно не может блокировать, пока на нем есть жетон +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': \'«Прямиком из наполненных кровью кошмаров нашего прославленного Отца!» — Ниозер, главарь Дома Крови\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4063640-30a3-4e09-bde3-b3c8b99bce5d\', \'multiverseId\': 355387}, \'multiverseid\': 355387}, {\'name\': \'锐兹玛第后裔\', \'text\': \'脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'「直接来自于我们杰出元祖那血腥无比的想像力！」 ～嗜血屋魁首纽瑟\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a75b90-ba4c-4047-8532-fc447d1d4236\', \'multiverseId\': 357305}, \'multiverseid\': 357305}, {\'name\': \'銳茲瑪第後裔\', \'text\': \'脫韁（你可以讓此生物進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能進行阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': \'「直接來自於我們傑出元祖那血腥無比的想像力！」 ～嗜血屋魁首紐瑟\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979a5b9b-ae04-42db-b903-db568c391257\', \'multiverseId\': 355661}, \'multiverseid\': 355661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosbolde\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEntfesselt (Du kannst diese Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel kommen lassen. Sie kann nicht blocken, solange eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr liegt.)\\nDie Chaosbolde verursachen Trampelschaden, solange mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihnen liegt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bold\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b7288f1-5124-48b1-8ecb-f692882e7923\', \'multiverseId\': 355826}, \'multiverseid\': 355826}, {\'name\': \'Diablillos del caos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDesatar. (Puedes hacer que esta criatura entre al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. No puede bloquear mientras tenga un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nLos Diablillos del caos tienen la habilidad de arrollar mientras tengan un contador +1/+1 sobre ellos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b949715-1f87-4cc0-b59e-27f19082ea20\', \'multiverseId\': 365548}, \'multiverseid\': 365548}, {\'name\': \'Diablotins du chaos\', \'text\': "Vol\\nEmportement (Vous pouvez faire arriver cette créature sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Elle ne peut pas bloquer tant qu\'elle a un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nLes Diablotins du chaos ont le piétinement tant qu\'ils ont au moins un marqueur +1/+1 sur eux.", \'type\': \'Créature : diablotin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'522c11f8-7dc6-4c11-8653-df73316523b7\', \'multiverseId\': 356100}, \'multiverseid\': 356100}, {\'name\': \'Imp Caotici\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nScatenare (Puoi far entrare questa creatura nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1. Non può bloccare fintanto che ha un segnalino +1/+1.)\\nGli Imp Caotici hanno travolgere fintanto che hanno un segnalino +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Imp\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4cabf1b-3c78-46d2-ac19-18a274e0e257\', \'multiverseId\': 356374}, \'multiverseid\': 356374}, {\'name\': \'混沌のインプ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）\\n混沌のインプは、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎりトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インプ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a19a799-b681-4666-a168-59883626c69c\', \'multiverseId\': 356648}, \'multiverseid\': 356648}, {\'name\': \'혼돈의 임프들\', \'text\': \'비행\\n속박해제 (당신은 이 생물로 하여금 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어오도록 할 수 있다. 이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 있는 한 방어할 수 없다.)\\n혼돈의 임프들은 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 있는 한 돌진 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 임프\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b94f6cb-11f4-49cb-a223-0c1e56ce67ed\', \'multiverseId\': 357470}, \'multiverseid\': 357470}, {\'name\': \'Diabretes do Caos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nLiberar (Você pode fazer com que esta criatura entre no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1. Ela não poderá bloquear enquanto tiver um marcador +1/+1.)\\nDiabretes do Caos terá atropelar enquanto tiver um marcador +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabrete\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87636573-b7d5-44d5-a380-a5c6e21d5eb4\', \'multiverseId\': 356922}, \'multiverseid\': 356922}, {\'name\': \'Бесы Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nБезудержность (Вы можете заставить это существо выйти на поле битвы с жетоном +1/+1 на нем. Оно не может блокировать, пока на нем есть жетон +1/+1.)\\nБесы Хаоса имеют Пробивной удар, пока на них есть жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Бес\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab3fe80f-ace4-43f2-b2ec-917807b788a3\', \'multiverseId\': 355278}, \'multiverseid\': 355278}, {\'name\': \'混沌小恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）\\n只要混沌小恶魔上有+1/+1指示物，它便具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～小恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9b6514-f4b3-496a-8515-8495b5eda94a\', \'multiverseId\': 357196}, \'multiverseid\': 357196}, {\'name\': \'混沌小惡魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n脫韁（你可以讓此生物進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能進行阻擋。）\\n只要混沌小惡魔上有+1/+1指示物，它便具有踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～小惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52804678-931f-47bc-a0e5-bbe510a0b350\', \'multiverseId\': 355552}, \'multiverseid\': 355552}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chor der Macht\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Trampelschaden und erhält +1/+1 für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder einzelne von uns verfügt über die Stärke von uns allen." —Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355855&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d170a4-d3af-4555-be2a-9fef8c32026b\', \'multiverseId\': 355855}, \'multiverseid\': 355855}, {\'name\': \'Coro del poder\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 por cada criatura que controlas y gana la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En el interior de cada uno está la fuerza de todos nosotros." —Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'355415c6-c706-4a23-bde7-0472df9d0669\', \'multiverseId\': 365577}, \'multiverseid\': 365577}, {\'name\': \'Chœur de la puissance\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez et elle acquiert le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Notre force à tous est en chacun de nous. » —Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356129&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b45d62f-5432-4816-af23-c40b0301ddd8\', \'multiverseId\': 356129}, \'multiverseid\': 356129}, {\'name\': \'Coro della Potenza\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 per ogni creatura che controlli e ha travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"In ognuno di noi c\\\'è la forza di tutti noi." —Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a3f135-8c96-4b84-b19f-c973aa232638\', \'multiverseId\': 356403}, \'multiverseid\': 356403}, {\'name\': \'力の合唱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まであなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我ら一人ひとりの中に、我ら全員の力があるのです。」 ――トロスターニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3574c8f7-48b5-4453-bf08-32d21f6635a1\', \'multiverseId\': 356677}, \'multiverseid\': 356677}, {\'name\': \'힘의 합창\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개당 +1/+1을 받고 돌진 능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리 각자에게는 우리 모두의 힘이 있다." —트로스타니\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0718863a-960f-4126-b331-f79277443c56\', \'multiverseId\': 357499}, \'multiverseid\': 357499}, {\'name\': \'Coro do Poder\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 para cada criatura que você controla e ganha atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A força de todos nós está em cada um de nós." — Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecb00b74-0819-4c93-b429-65f155a11d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 356951}, \'multiverseid\': 356951}, {\'name\': \'Хор Могущества\', \'text\': \'До конца хода целевое существо получает +1/+1 за каждое существо под вашим контролем и Пробивной удар.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«В каждом из нас живет сила всех нас». — Тростани\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2311ff30-d165-4b95-a28d-5512fabb1af0\', \'multiverseId\': 355307}, \'multiverseid\': 355307}, {\'name\': \'瀚力韵集\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，你每操控一个生物，目标生物便得+1/+1并获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个人的心中都有着我们全体的力量。」 ～卓塔妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663ddb3c-9c02-45e0-a332-49e6ad10b16b\', \'multiverseId\': 357225}, \'multiverseid\': 357225}, {\'name\': \'瀚力韻集\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，你每操控一個生物，目標生物便得+1/+1並獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每個人的心中都有著我們全體的力量。」 ～卓塔妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'926b62d3-40fb-4a4f-af25-8d3e8ff84f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 355581}, \'multiverseid\': 355581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontollierst, haben „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dimir-Magier setzen die Lampen geschickt ein — aus dem ungewohnten Mana erschaffen sie Gestaltwandler und Schläfer-Agenten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b179b831-beb5-4ad6-8fb7-cc50ed171d8a\', \'multiverseId\': 355962}, \'multiverseid\': 355962}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos dimir hicieron buen uso de las linternas, creando metamorfos y agentes durmientes a partir de un maná que les era extraño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec797e8-2faf-43f4-806e-204da4bb3420\', \'multiverseId\': 365684}, \'multiverseid\': 365684}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les mages dimirs tirent parti des lanternes, dont ils font des changeformes et des agents en sommeil à partir de mana dont ils ignorent tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356236&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7776f292-edfa-4786-81a3-fd5534e2a644\', \'multiverseId\': 356236}, \'multiverseid\': 356236}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I maghi Dimir fanno buon uso delle lanterne, creando mutaforma e agenti infiltrati partendo da mana a loro estraneo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f84ff4-85f4-48a8-904b-1e5e1604f3a4\', \'multiverseId\': 356510}, \'multiverseid\': 356510}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする土地は「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの魔道士は灯籠をうまく使い、異質のマナから多相の戦士や潜伏工作員を生み出している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d149e0-2534-4b93-a27c-b6371f394b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 356784}, \'multiverseid\': 356784}, {\'name\': \'다색 등불\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 모든 대지는 "{T}: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다."라는 능력을 가진다.\\n{T}: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'디미르 마도사들은 등불을 통해 익숙하지 않은 마나로도 변이괴물과 잠입 요원들을 만들어냈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e61473-8652-4ca0-9a15-439c71421177\', \'multiverseId\': 357606}, \'multiverseid\': 357606}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana."\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os magos Dimir fazem bom uso das lanternas, criando metamorfos e agentes adormecidos com tipos de mana diferentes dos deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5205a919-1fa0-4836-968e-66e4ab4a1bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 357058}, \'multiverseid\': 357058}, {\'name\': \'Цветной Фонарь\', \'text\': \'Земли под вашим контролем имеют способность «{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны».\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Маги Димиров используют фонари для создания имитаторов и скрытых агентов из маны чужих цветов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345503dc-9664-421b-a1c7-15fee92e9927\', \'multiverseId\': 355414}, \'multiverseid\': 355414}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'底密尔法师充分利用宫灯，从他们不熟悉的法术力当中制造出变形兽和潜藏密探。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2129d80-61a5-41c6-9dd7-f1b7ec0d126b\', \'multiverseId\': 357332}, \'multiverseid\': 357332}, {\'name\': \'五彩宮燈\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。」\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'底密爾法師充分利用宮燈，從他們不熟悉的魔法力當中製造出變形獸和潛藏密探。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41725a5b-1dda-4f74-bd84-00a8c69a89b5\', \'multiverseId\': 355688}, \'multiverseid\': 355688}]', "[{'name': 'Chronische Überflutung', 'text': 'Landverzauberung\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land getappt wird, legt sein Beherrscher die obersten drei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Während die Izzet anderweitig beschäftigt waren, verfielen viele ihrer öffentlichen Baustellen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355768&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cd2735d-ed20-46ba-8a00-a7f74fe20744', 'multiverseId': 355768}, 'multiverseid': 355768}, {'name': 'Inundación crónica', 'text': 'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que la tierra encantada sea girada, su controlador pone las tres primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Con los ízzet ocupados en otros lugares, muchas de sus obras públicas se deterioraron.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365490&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8639a7b9-467e-4f15-b8ff-2e037843a329', 'multiverseId': 365490}, 'multiverseid': 365490}, {'name': 'Inondations chroniques', 'text': 'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté devient engagé, son contrôleur met les trois cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'Les Izzet étant occupés ailleurs, bon nombre de leurs ouvrages publics commençaient à tomber en ruines.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356042&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6acc9e9d-0b46-410a-b27f-c211f77a4a40', 'multiverseId': 356042}, 'multiverseid': 356042}, {'name': 'Inondazione Cronica', 'text': 'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata, il suo controllore mette le prime tre carte del suo grimorio nel suo cimitero.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': 'Con gli Izzet occupati altrove, molte delle loro opere pubbliche caddero in rovina.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356316&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ebc4bfc-0982-4ed4-a6f1-ed92690014c7', 'multiverseId': 356316}, 'multiverseid': 356316}, {'name': '慢性的な水害', 'text': 'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がタップ状態になるたび、それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'イゼット団が別件にかまっている間に、彼らの公共施設の多くが荒廃してしまった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356590&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73bd1a2a-28ca-4360-8705-3dc4efe51844', 'multiverseId': 356590}, 'multiverseid': 356590}, {'name': '계속되는 홍수', 'text': '대지에게 부여\\n부여된 대지가 탭될 때마다, 그 대지의 조종자는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': '이젯 길드가 다른 일에 집중하는 사이, 그들의 공공 사업 중 상당수가 방치되었다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357412&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84571d5f-fe31-4e65-9094-46a799614da8', 'multiverseId': 357412}, 'multiverseid': 357412}, {'name': 'Alagamento Crônico', 'text': 'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado, seu controlador coloca os três cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Com os Izzet ocupados em outro lugar, muitas de suas obras públicas ficaram sem manutenção.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356864&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '508787e5-ab1a-4020-bcfc-879678a4b157', 'multiverseId': 356864}, 'multiverseid': 356864}, {'name': 'Длительное Затопление', 'text': 'Зачаровать землю\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованная земля становится повернутой, контролирующий ее игрок кладет три верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': 'Пока Иззеты были заняты другими делами, многие возведенные ими общественные сооружения приходили в упадок.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355220&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a587c5f7-2fc5-451a-af71-ee07681962e5', 'multiverseId': 355220}, 'multiverseid': 355220}, {'name': '长期水患', 'text': '结附于地\\n每当所结附的地成为横置时，其操控者将其牌库顶的三张牌置入其坟墓场。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '由于伊捷正忙于其他事务，许多公共建设面临失修。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357138&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d193b8f-6405-436e-99e4-53a0679a5511', 'multiverseId': 357138}, 'multiverseid': 357138}, {'name': '長期水患', 'text': '結附於地\\n每當所結附的地成為橫置時，其操控者將其牌庫頂的三張牌置入其墳墓場。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': '由於伊捷正忙於其他事務，許多公共建設面臨失修。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355494&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '517d94ce-3f6a-41ab-b412-45c64e637c92', 'multiverseId': 355494}, 'multiverseid': 355494}]", "[{'name': 'Codexzerreißer', 'text': '{T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\\n{5}, {T}, opfere den Codexzerreißer: Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355964&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '513047b4-0826-4a80-9119-266f9e6a6fa6', 'multiverseId': 355964}, 'multiverseid': 355964}, {'name': 'Trituracódices', 'text': '{T}: El jugador objetivo pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrificar el Trituracódices: Regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365686&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9afc3ce6-3f84-4528-ad46-b8e73293d00c', 'multiverseId': 365686}, 'multiverseid': 365686}, {'name': 'Destructeur de codex', 'text': '{T} : Le joueur ciblé met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrifiez le Destructeur de codex : Renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356238&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc4ec333-85b6-4ad4-9c64-2da148e02ba5', 'multiverseId': 356238}, 'multiverseid': 356238}, {'name': 'Tritacodici', 'text': '{T}: Un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero la prima carta del suo grimorio.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifica il Tritacodici: Riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356512&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfef65bc-beca-4e8d-9cb6-7b72d64602f6', 'multiverseId': 356512}, 'multiverseid': 356512}, {'name': '写本裁断機', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\\n{5}, {T}, 写本裁断機を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356786&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3753a691-43ea-476a-ab42-e7b0b1b2ed29', 'multiverseId': 356786}, 'multiverseid': 356786}, {'name': '고문서 파쇄기', 'text': '{T}: 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n{5}, {T}, 고문서 파쇄기를 희생한다: 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '마법물체', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357608&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e91b1835-35b3-4221-9cd1-8695742f9c7d', 'multiverseId': 357608}, 'multiverseid': 357608}, {'name': 'Triturador de Códices', 'text': '{T}: O jogador alvo coloca o card do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifique Triturador de Códices: Devolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357060&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e48d8c8-943c-4d0d-8882-b0c5bac00025', 'multiverseId': 357060}, 'multiverseid': 357060}, {'name': 'Измельчитель Свитков', 'text': '{T}: целевой игрок кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\\n{5}, {T}, пожертвуйте Измельчитель Свитков: верните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355416&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a475ec73-fafd-4a54-8d89-db60e263cf5f', 'multiverseId': 355416}, 'multiverseid': 355416}, {'name': '纸本搅碎器', 'text': '{T}：目标牌手将其牌库顶牌置入其坟墓场。\\n{5}，{T}，牺牲纸本搅碎器：将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357334&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f331c779-7ee2-45b7-8d93-b68f0338e122', 'multiverseId': 357334}, 'multiverseid': 357334}, {'name': '紙本攪碎器', 'text': '{T}：目標玩家將其牌庫頂牌置入其墳墓場。\\n{5}，{T}，犧牲紙本攪碎器：將目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355690&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c750e098-5f8b-488f-b3bf-d55107a8d207', 'multiverseId': 355690}, 'multiverseid': 355690}]", '[{\'name\': \'Concordia-Pegasus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Tritt von seinen Hufen fühlt sich an, als würde man vom Blitz getroffen. Ich muss es wissen. Ich habe beides schon am eigenen Leib erlebt." —Rencz, Izzet-Chemistergehilfe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3ad1a8-5da6-469e-b531-1d9baeae36ac\', \'multiverseId\': 355744}, \'multiverseid\': 355744}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso de Concordia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'"Su coz es como el golpe de un relámpago. Lo sé muy bien. He recibido ambos." —Rencz, ayudante de quimista Ízzet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8193291b-2457-4377-bff8-c580e9323bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 365466}, \'multiverseid\': 365466}, {\'name\': \'Pégase de Concordia\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': "« Un coup de sabot de cette bestiole, ça rappelle la foudre. J\'en sais quelque chose. J\'ai été frappé par les deux. » —Rencz, laborantin Izzet", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356018&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a055a835-e6b0-40f2-a8be-a7812608b9b6\', \'multiverseId\': 356018}, \'multiverseid\': 356018}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso di Concordia\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'"Un calcio di quegli zoccoli è come la scarica di un fulmine. E io lo so bene. Sono stata colpita da entrambi." —Rencz, assistente chimimaga Izzet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8227dd97-8b6a-461a-9edd-7fc7f18c98dd\', \'multiverseId\': 356292}, \'multiverseid\': 356292}, {\'name\': \'協約のペガサス\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': \'「そいつの蹄に蹴られたら稲妻に撃たれたみたいになるよ。私には分かるんだ。どっちもやられたことあるから。」 ――イゼットの薬術師の助手、レーンス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c593d0-89d8-4559-a0e8-47483bfeb2a5\', \'multiverseId\': 356566}, \'multiverseid\': 356566}, {\'name\': \'콘코르디아 페가수스\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페가수스\', \'flavor\': \'"녀석의 발굽차기는 번개와도 같아. 어떻게 아냐고? 양쪽에 다 맞아 봤거든." —이젯 화학술사의 조수 렌츠\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd9fab6-3b81-4047-866a-591cd7d75072\', \'multiverseId\': 357388}, \'multiverseid\': 357388}, {\'name\': \'Pégaso de Concordia\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': \'"Levar um coice daqueles cascos é como ser atingido por um raio. Vai por mim. Já fui atingida por ambos." — Rencz, assistente de quimiomante Izzet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a092a4a3-affe-4174-bd63-ae29ee2d0d72\', \'multiverseId\': 356840}, \'multiverseid\': 356840}, {\'name\': \'Пегас из Конкордии\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пегас\', \'flavor\': \'«Удар его копыта подобен молнии. Кому, как не мне, это знать. В меня попадало и то и другое». — Ренш, иззетский помощник химика\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b339a9b0-7d96-487b-a97c-045cf407d7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 355196}, \'multiverseid\': 355196}, {\'name\': \'齐心飞马\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～飞马\', \'flavor\': \'「被它的蹄子踢中有如遭雷劈。我知道的。因为我两个都挨过。」 ～伊捷化学师助手连兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f1e59f-de3a-43dd-96d5-bb856fa8e911\', \'multiverseId\': 357114}, \'multiverseid\': 357114}, {\'name\': \'齊心飛馬\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～飛馬\', \'flavor\': \'「被牠的蹄子踢中有如遭雷劈。我知道的。因為我兩個都挨過。」 ～伊捷化學師助手連茲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e51bc5d5-e06b-46a9-b380-88d1a467a691\', \'multiverseId\': 355470}, \'multiverseid\': 355470}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dampfschlote\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U} oder {R}.)\\nSowie die Dampfschlote ins Spiel kommen, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommen die Dampfschlote getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Land — Insel, Gebirge\', \'flavor\': \'Gefertigt mit genialem Einfallsreichtum, angetrieben durch puren Wahnsinn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f49dcf-7fbf-45ba-99c7-d72f6fa41917\', \'multiverseId\': 355983}, \'multiverseid\': 355983}, {\'name\': \'Respiraderos de vapor\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {U} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.)\\nEn cuanto los Respiraderos de vapor entren al campo de batalla, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si no lo haces, los Respiraderos de vapor entran al campo de batalla girados.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Isla montaña\', \'flavor\': \'Creado con ingenio, vigorizado con demencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6eb829-77db-46bb-bff8-191ace8c2a07\', \'multiverseId\': 365705}, \'multiverseid\': 365705}, {\'name\': \'Conduits de vapeur\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R} à votre réserve.)\\nAu moment où les Conduits de vapeur arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous ne le faites pas, les Conduits de vapeur arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : île et montagne\', \'flavor\': \'Conçus par un génie, alimentés par la démence.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356257&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85620e48-4c21-4757-a989-a084c06d212a\', \'multiverseId\': 356257}, \'multiverseid\': 356257}, {\'name\': \'Fumarie di Vapore\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.)\\nMentre le Fumarie di Vapore entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se non lo fai, le Fumarie di Vapore entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Isola Montagna\', \'flavor\': "Costruite dall\'ingegno, alimentate dalla pazzia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b45dad-e143-4892-9792-d82ab017b370\', \'multiverseId\': 356531}, \'multiverseid\': 356531}, {\'name\': \'蒸気孔\', \'text\': \'（{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{R}を加える。）\\n蒸気孔が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはライフを２点支払ってもよい。そうしない場合、蒸気孔はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 島・山\', \'flavor\': \'才能により形作られ、狂気により活性化したもの。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'256baf67-e6a9-4e95-aab1-c941219fc76e\', \'multiverseId\': 356805}, \'multiverseid\': 356805}, {\'name\': \'증기 환기구\', \'text\': \'({T}: {U} 또는 {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.)\\n증기 환기구가 전장에 들어오면서, 당신은 생명 2점을 지불할 수 있다. 그러지 않으면, 증기 환기구는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'대지 — 섬 산\', \'flavor\': \'천재성으로 창조되어 광기로 유지된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541132e2-14f2-4a65-a155-87313ab5f41d\', \'multiverseId\': 357627}, \'multiverseid\': 357627}, {\'name\': \'Bueiros de Vapor\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {U} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.)\\nConforme Bueiros de Vapor entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se não fizer isso, Bueiros de Vapor entrará no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Ilha Montanha\', \'flavor\': \'Feito com genialidade, energizado com loucura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94dc9b0f-dc40-4aaf-bb24-691191a12649\', \'multiverseId\': 357079}, \'multiverseid\': 357079}, {\'name\': \'Паровые Отдушины\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {U} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.)\\nПри выходе Паровых Отдушин на поле битвы, вы можете заплатить 2 жизни. Если вы этого не делаете, Паровые Отдушины выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Остров Гора\', \'flavor\': \'Созданные гением, питаемые безумием.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51fbb8fc-ed13-4bb4-857e-f0c88c22cadc\', \'multiverseId\': 355435}, \'multiverseid\': 355435}, {\'name\': \'蒸气喷发口\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{U}或{R}到你的法术力池中。）\\n于蒸气喷发口进战场时，你可以支付2点生命。如果你未如此作，蒸气喷发口须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地～海岛／山脉\', \'flavor\': \'天才为其工匠，疯狂为其能源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77782223-0605-4b50-ac0f-e207c227e1d9\', \'multiverseId\': 357353}, \'multiverseid\': 357353}, {\'name\': \'蒸氣噴發口\', \'text\': \'({T}：加{U}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。）\\n於蒸氣噴發口進戰場時，你可以支付2點生命。如果你未如此作，蒸氣噴發口須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'地～海島／山脈\', \'flavor\': \'天才為其工匠，瘋狂為其能源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ac96de6-5dcc-440b-9f03-91427a6950d9\', \'multiverseId\': 355709}, \'multiverseid\': 355709}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Fallen des Hammers\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Du erhältst 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Urteil ist gesprochen. Die Ordnung wird gewahrt. Der Gerechtigkeit ist Genüge getan."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c61a1225-9883-45cb-9eff-a6de25ca2a38\', \'multiverseId\': 355897}, \'multiverseid\': 355897}, {\'name\': \'Bajada del martillo\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi resolución es definitiva. Se ha mantenido el orden. Se ha hecho justicia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'829008cf-cc53-48ca-aa08-9fd4141e4f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 365619}, \'multiverseid\': 365619}, {\'name\': \'Chute du marteau\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Vous gagnez 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ma décision est sans appel. L\'ordre est maintenu. Justice est faite. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cc4985-f6d3-43f2-94ff-0c6985649f56\', \'multiverseId\': 356171}, \'multiverseid\': 356171}, {\'name\': \'Colpo del Martelletto\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il verdetto è raggiunto. L\\\'ordine è stato mantenuto. Giustizia è fatta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a89e6f-01c3-4c95-9161-741426090e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 356445}, \'multiverseid\': 356445}, {\'name\': \'閉廷宣言\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「判決を確定する。秩序は守られた。正義はなされたのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab07e02-28a6-4471-adb0-1a504e04a5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 356719}, \'multiverseid\': 356719}, {\'name\': \'법봉 소리\', \'text\': \'주문 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내 결정은 최종적이다. 질서가 유지되었고, 정의는 지켜졌다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8507723c-14bf-4e4e-a5c8-0f02474349c3\', \'multiverseId\': 357541}, \'multiverseid\': 357541}, {\'name\': \'Batida do Martelo\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Minha decisão é definitiva. A ordem foi mantida. A justiça foi feita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6c273d-c6bc-43b3-8368-cb1ffccdea71\', \'multiverseId\': 356993}, \'multiverseid\': 356993}, {\'name\': \'Удар Молотка\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мое решение окончательно. Порядок восстановлен. Правосудие свершилось».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30eaed8c-ac9a-4fa9-a1ee-f24ef93a317a\', \'multiverseId\': 355349}, \'multiverseid\': 355349}, {\'name\': \'落锤\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「判决已定。秩序已得维持。正义已得伸张。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e1a284-e11f-4fab-8fb2-cd450f31c6a7\', \'multiverseId\': 357267}, \'multiverseid\': 357267}, {\'name\': \'落鎚\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「判決已定。秩序已得維持。正義已得伸張。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d753d74-3b79-441e-84fa-03e1a1aa25ce\', \'multiverseId\': 355623}, \'multiverseid\': 355623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Horizont absuchen\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In Ravnica ist der Blick in die Ferne oft von aufragenden Glas- oder Steinspitzen verstellt und reicht nur selten bis zum Horizont.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b78166d-bb90-44cc-993f-0e051a6f6057\', \'multiverseId\': 355870}, \'multiverseid\': 355870}, {\'name\': \'Buscar el horizonte\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas y ponlas en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cubierta de picos verticales de cristal y piedra, las vistas de Rávnica apenas ofrecen un breve atisbo del horizonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8fb207f-cc5d-419b-a9c8-f753ef87aa76\', \'multiverseId\': 365592}, \'multiverseid\': 365592}, {\'name\': "À la recherche de l\'horizon", \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, révélez-les et mettez-les dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les paysages de Ravnica, encombrés de tours de verre et de pierre, permettent rarement de voir l\'horizon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356144&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6091de5-eaaf-498b-8eca-5e781ff6d534\', \'multiverseId\': 356144}, \'multiverseid\': 356144}, {\'name\': "Cercare l\'Orizzonte", \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte terra base, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Fra le miriadi di torri di vetro e pietra, a Ravnica sono visibili solo rari squarci di orizzonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5514bf52-8af8-47ae-9e85-17cc12794f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 356418}, \'multiverseid\': 356418}, {\'name\': \'地平の探求\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを最大３枚まで探し、それらを公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ガラスと石でできた垂直の建物が林立するラヴニカの街並みからは、地平線がわずかに顔を見せるのみである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5405e917-f0b7-4ef6-8d9d-51430a0a7df6\', \'multiverseId\': 356692}, \'multiverseid\': 356692}, {\'name\': \'지평선을 찾아서\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드를 최대 세 장까지 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그러고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'유리와 돌로 지은 뾰족한 첨탑들로 가득한 라브니카에서는 지평선을 보는 게 거의 불가능하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f8ade7-1eb9-44ce-879b-4dd949323b39\', \'multiverseId\': 357514}, \'multiverseid\': 357514}, {\'name\': \'Procurar o Horizonte\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório até três cards de terreno básico, revele-os e coloque-os em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Cortado por espigões verticais de pedra e vidro, o panorama de Ravnica oferece apenas um mero esboço do horizonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f134ad-a66a-41e3-b67e-2bef0e336c40\', \'multiverseId\': 356966}, \'multiverseid\': 356966}, {\'name\': \'Поиск Горизонта\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более трех карт базовых земель, покажите их и положите их в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Виды Равники, изрезанные торчащими шпилями из стекла и камня, закрывают от взгляда саму кромку горизонта.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2465061a-66b7-4dab-bd40-9be3c7a1116b\', \'multiverseId\': 355322}, \'multiverseid\': 355322}, {\'name\': \'探寻天际\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，展示这些牌，并将它们置入你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'拉尼卡的景色充斥耸立的玻璃与石头尖塔，只能得见少许的地平线。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcdd3bf9-ad15-4c98-9c8e-6fb5450db429\', \'multiverseId\': 357240}, \'multiverseid\': 357240}, {\'name\': \'探尋天際\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多三張基本地牌，展示這些牌，並將它們置入你手上。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'拉尼卡的景色充斥聳立的玻璃與石頭尖塔，只能得見少許的地平線。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c1cc59-9412-4bd2-9411-771fcd728fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 355596}, \'multiverseid\': 355596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Schädel zerreißen\', \'text\': \'Den Schädel zerreißen fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Jeder dieser Spieler wirft zwei zufällig bestimmte Karten aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir könnten niemals jemanden mit einem so hübschen Gesicht oder einem so gesunden Verstand akzeptieren." —Nyoser, Bluthaus-Rädelsführer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f12fc698-0c08-44ca-9871-8ffface1d31d\', \'multiverseId\': 355931}, \'multiverseid\': 355931}, {\'name\': \'Rasgar el cráneo\', \'text\': \'Rasgar el cráneo hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente. Esos jugadores descartan cada uno dos cartas al azar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamás aceptaríamos a nadie con una cara tan bonita ni una mente tan cuerda." —Nyoser, cabecilla de Casa Sangrienta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99bc3824-affc-43bd-98dc-c6798bd97cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 365653}, \'multiverseid\': 365653}, {\'name\': \'Arrachage de crâne\', \'text\': "L\'Arrachage de crâne inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire. Ces joueurs se défaussent chacun de deux cartes au hasard.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Pas question d\'accepter quelqu\'un avec des traits aussi réguliers et un esprit aussi sain. » —Nyoser, meneur de la Halle aux viscères", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e833c1e-cd50-4e25-b730-fc370ce01362\', \'multiverseId\': 356205}, \'multiverseid\': 356205}, {\'name\': \'Lacerazione Cranica\', \'text\': \'La Lacerazione Cranica infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario. Ognuno di quei giocatori scarta due carte a caso.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non potremmo mai accettare qualcuno con un viso così grazioso o con la mente così perfettamente sana." —Nyoser, capobanda della Casa del Sangue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b60ac5-5757-427a-8e68-cfbadfda3017\', \'multiverseId\': 356479}, \'multiverseid\': 356479}, {\'name\': \'頭蓋裂き\', \'text\': \'頭蓋裂きは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。それらのプレイヤーはカードを２枚無作為に選んで捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あんなに可愛い顔をしていたり、あんなにまともな精神をしている奴なんか、受け入れられるわけないだろ。」 ――流血の家の首謀者、ニョーゼル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9047b1cd-3525-4559-9f52-e52e986b810e\', \'multiverseId\': 356753}, \'multiverseid\': 356753}, {\'name\': \'해골 분쇄\', \'text\': \'해골 분쇄는 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입힌다. 그 플레이어들은 각각 무작위로 카드 두 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 얼굴이 예쁘거나 정신이 온전한 자는 절대 받아들일 수 없어." —핏덩이 회관의 주모자 뇨세르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c591db16-eb15-43d8-a51f-713c94a47802\', \'multiverseId\': 357575}, \'multiverseid\': 357575}, {\'name\': \'Partir Crânios\', \'text\': \'Partir Crânios causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente. Cada um desses jogadores descarta dois cards aleatoriamente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamais aceitaríamos alguém com um rosto tão bonito ou uma mente tão sã." — Nyoser, líder do Clube da Sangria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef2f6e4-88bf-42a4-8c89-afdee001c7e2\', \'multiverseId\': 357027}, \'multiverseid\': 357027}, {\'name\': \'Свежевание Черепа\', \'text\': \'Свежевание Черепа наносит 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту. Каждый из тех игроков сбрасывает две случайно выбранные карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы никогда не примем в свои ряды кого-либо столь красивого или разумного». — Ниозер, главарь Дома Крови\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf7f45a-35d4-49b6-99ec-234cb6382609\', \'multiverseId\': 355383}, \'multiverseid\': 355383}, {\'name\': \'撕裂头颅\', \'text\': \'撕裂头颅对每位对手各造成2点伤害。这些牌手各随机弃两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们永不接受长相好看或心智清醒者。」 ～嗜血屋魁首纽瑟\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c11324-9239-459c-902e-45ef13915859\', \'multiverseId\': 357301}, \'multiverseid\': 357301}, {\'name\': \'撕裂頭顱\', \'text\': \'撕裂頭顱對每位對手各造成2點傷害。這些玩家各隨機棄兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們永不接受長相好看或心智清醒者。」 ～嗜血屋魁首紐瑟\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa259f24-d963-4d29-8046-c4d1cbe9ce81\', \'multiverseId\': 355657}, \'multiverseid\': 355657}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Stadt durchsuchen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Die Stadt durchsuchen ins Spiel kommt, schicke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte mit dem gleichen Namen wie eine der ins Exil geschickten Karten spielst, kannst du eine der ins Exil geschickten Karten mit diesem Namen auf die Hand ihres Besitzers bringen. Falls dann keine Karten mehr im Exil sind, die mit Die Stadt durchsuchen ins Exil geschickt wurden, opfere sie. Falls du das tust, erhältst du nach diesem Zug einen weiteren Zug.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355785&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b97d63-632b-4f10-841c-c6ce478f0c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 355785}, \'multiverseid\': 355785}, {\'name\': \'Registrar la ciudad\', \'text\': \'Cuando Registrar la ciudad entre al campo de batalla, exilia las primeras cinco cartas de tu biblioteca.\\nSiempre que juegues una carta con el mismo nombre que una de las cartas exiliadas, puedes poner una de esas cartas con ese nombre en la mano de su propietario. Luego, si no hay cartas exiliadas con Registrar la ciudad, sacrifícala. Si lo haces, toma un turno adicional después de éste.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f1666b-7914-4968-a733-f49181b5fe96\', \'multiverseId\': 365507}, \'multiverseid\': 365507}, {\'name\': \'Fouille de la cité\', \'text\': "Quand la Fouille de la cité arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous jouez une carte ayant le même nom que l\'une des cartes exilées, vous pouvez mettre une de ces cartes ayant ce nom dans la main de son propriétaire. Puis, s\'il n\'y a aucune carte exilée par la Fouille de la cité, sacrifiez-la. Si vous faites ainsi, jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d4de29-b08d-47df-a7fa-379d649ff4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 356059}, \'multiverseid\': 356059}, {\'name\': \'Perlustrare la Città\', \'text\': \'Quando Perlustrare la Città entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio.\\nOgniqualvolta giochi una carta con lo stesso nome di una delle carte esiliate, puoi aggiungere una di quelle carte con quel nome alla mano del suo proprietario. Poi se non ci sono carte esiliate con Perlustrare la Città, sacrificalo. Se lo fai, gioca un altro turno dopo questo.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819e7cd2-c3a8-4496-9642-ac0a51b278c2\', \'multiverseId\': 356333}, \'multiverseid\': 356333}, {\'name\': \'市内捜査\', \'text\': \'市内捜査が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを追放する。\\nあなたが、追放したカードと同じ名前のカードを１枚プレイするたび、あなたはこれにより追放されているその名前のカードを１枚オーナーの手札に加えてもよい。その後、市内捜査によって追放されているカードがない場合、これを生け贄に捧げる。そうした場合、このターンの後に追加のターンを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2e86eb-dbd1-405d-925a-902ae3bb1596\', \'multiverseId\': 356607}, \'multiverseid\': 356607}, {\'name\': \'도시 수색\', \'text\': \'도시 수색이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 다섯 장을 추방한다.\\n당신이 그렇게 추방된 카드 중 하나와 이름이 같은 카드를 플레이할 때마다, 당신은 그 이름을 가진 카드 중 한 장을 소유자의 손에 넣을 수 있다. 그러고 나서 도시 수색이 추방한 카드가 남아 있지 않으면, 도시 수색을 희생한다. 그렇게 한다면, 이번 턴 후에 추가로 턴을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'927100ac-3623-42f1-bccb-0072b728717b\', \'multiverseId\': 357429}, \'multiverseid\': 357429}, {\'name\': \'Vasculhar a Cidade\', \'text\': \'Quando Vasculhar a Cidade entrar no campo de batalha, exile os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório.\\nToda vez que você joga um card com o mesmo nome de um dos cards exilados, você pode colocar um desses cards com esse nome na mão de seu dono. Depois, se não houver mais cards exilados com Vasculhar a Cidade, sacrifique-o. Se fizer isso, jogue um turno extra após este.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'474d5ea4-bdeb-4a2f-b2d0-da4c300f437c\', \'multiverseId\': 356881}, \'multiverseid\': 356881}, {\'name\': \'Поиски в Городе\', \'text\': \'Когда Поиски в Городе выходят на поле битвы, изгоните пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете карту с тем же именем, что у одной из изгнанных карт, вы можете положить одну из тех карт с тем именем в руку ее владельца. Затем, если после этого не осталось карт, изгнанных с помощью Поисков в Городе, пожертвуйте Поиски в Городе. Если вы это делаете, сделайте дополнительный ход вслед за этим.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35356585-4ba8-4c82-bfbc-f39169e9908c\', \'multiverseId\': 355237}, \'multiverseid\': 355237}, {\'name\': \'遍寻全城\', \'text\': \'当遍寻全城进战场时，放逐你牌库顶的五张牌。\\n每当你使用一张与以此法放逐的牌同名之牌时，你可以将其中一张具有该名称的牌置入其拥有者手上。然后如果已经没有牌被遍寻全城放逐，则牺牲之。若你如此作，于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'544fb1a5-e023-49fb-a3aa-7a2607e8b764\', \'multiverseId\': 357155}, \'multiverseid\': 357155}, {\'name\': \'遍尋全城\', \'text\': \'當遍尋全城進戰場時，放逐你牌庫頂的五張牌。\\n每當你使用一張與以此法放逐的牌同名之牌時，你可以將其中一張具有該名稱的牌置入其擁有者手上。然後如果已經沒有牌被遍尋全城放逐，則犧牲之。若你如此作，於本回合後進行額外的一個回合。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b22b980-3b4a-4dac-8631-e6401d6e01a4\', \'multiverseId\': 355511}, \'multiverseid\': 355511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Trümmer absuchen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Bringe einen 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins und Architekten kommen nur selten miteinander aus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d835b9d2-c3fc-425b-8070-e2164cdd3b14\', \'multiverseId\': 355843}, \'multiverseid\': 355843}, {\'name\': \'Inspección de los escombros\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo. Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos y los arquitectos no suelen llevarse bien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7437848a-3b0f-444e-a865-f04e99a20bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 365565}, \'multiverseid\': 365565}, {\'name\': \'Faire état des décombres\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le terrain ciblé. Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Gobelins et architectes font rarement bon ménage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06658871-c666-447a-93a6-957ea4edabd1\', \'multiverseId\': 356117}, \'multiverseid\': 356117}, {\'name\': \'Ispezionare le Macerie\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio. Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "I Goblin e gli architetti tendono a non andare d\'accordo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c4c2e0-890c-4f0d-bce0-ed3ebdc8505c\', \'multiverseId\': 356391}, \'multiverseid\': 356391}, {\'name\': \'瓦礫の調査\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリンと建築家が仲良くすることは滅多にない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b69bcbf6-bfe0-425a-95a4-149c986b5395\', \'multiverseId\': 356665}, \'multiverseid\': 356665}, {\'name\': \'잔해 조사\', \'text\': \'대지 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 파괴한다. 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'고블린과 건축가는 사이가 좋은 경우가 거의 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3d5ee2-29c3-4613-80eb-382ca551d667\', \'multiverseId\': 357487}, \'multiverseid\': 357487}, {\'name\': \'Perscrutar os Destroços\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo. Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins e arquitetos raramente se dão bem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f3b074c-be0d-48a7-9d32-0e4bf5295340\', \'multiverseId\': 356939}, \'multiverseid\': 356939}, {\'name\': \'Исследование Обломков\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю. Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Гоблины и архитекторы редко находят общий язык.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda9ce5e-e9d2-4533-8a4d-ec330372d1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 355295}, \'multiverseid\': 355295}, {\'name\': \'勘查残迹\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。将一个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪和建筑师鲜少处得来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22947be1-6914-4ec5-9b2f-3c4f41aa1d43\', \'multiverseId\': 357213}, \'multiverseid\': 357213}, {\'name\': \'勘查殘跡\', \'text\': \'消滅目標地。將一個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪和建築師鮮少處得來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df8bad6-8d13-4909-92e5-44e20bb9c20e\', \'multiverseId\': 355569}, \'multiverseid\': 355569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dolchkampfbahn-Bold\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazu erhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bold\', \'flavor\': \'Einer der vielen Gründe, weshalb Märkte im Freien bei Einbruch der Dämmerung schließen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a0df877-76ab-41a9-b746-4f7d7d247407\', \'multiverseId\': 355796}, \'multiverseid\': 355796}, {\'name\': \'Diablillo de Dagadromo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nVínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo\', \'flavor\': \'Uno de los muchos motivos por los que los mercados al aire libre cierran al anochecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a64586b4-dc57-48fa-affc-37f7c7d7d16b\', \'multiverseId\': 365518}, \'multiverseid\': 365518}, {\'name\': \'Diablotin de Daguedrome\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : diablotin\', \'flavor\': \'Une des nombreuses raisons expliquant la clôture des marchés en plein air à la tombée de la nuit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9653f0e1-d04c-4b60-92f8-56cbaa0b404f\', \'multiverseId\': 356070}, \'multiverseid\': 356070}, {\'name\': \'Imp del Dagadromo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLegame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Imp\', \'flavor\': "Uno dei vari motivi per cui i mercati all\'aperto chiudono al tramonto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e5f94b-20bc-4a06-b508-c2d04a97578f\', \'multiverseId\': 356344}, \'multiverseid\': 356344}, {\'name\': \'短剣広場のインプ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与える場合、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インプ\', \'flavor\': \'夕暮時に野外市場を閉める理由のうちの一つ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88418e34-2351-470a-b519-98f751d0ac49\', \'multiverseId\': 356618}, \'multiverseid\': 356618}, {\'name\': \'대거드롬 임프\', \'text\': \'비행\\n생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 이 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 임프\', \'flavor\': \'해가 지면 노천 시장이 문을 닫는 이유 중 하나다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f69b12a9-1ec9-4791-8978-94743fff6c40\', \'multiverseId\': 357440}, \'multiverseid\': 357440}, {\'name\': \'Diabrete de Cutelódromo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nVínculo com a vida (O dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabrete\', \'flavor\': \'Um dos muitos motivos pelos quais os mercados a céu aberto fecham ao pôr do sol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9daf50-c22c-4dc8-9896-feb46c3a7e24\', \'multiverseId\': 356892}, \'multiverseid\': 356892}, {\'name\': \'Бес с Кинжалодрома\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЦепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Бес\', \'flavor\': \'Одна из причин, по которым рынки под открытым небом закрывают с наступлением темноты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c38e38-b83b-4e21-b764-c41effe986fc\', \'multiverseId\': 355248}, \'multiverseid\': 355248}, {\'name\': \'竞斗场小恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～小恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'这是露天市场要在黄昏时收摊的许多理由之一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a3046a-4b1c-4877-8eb2-e09756050189\', \'multiverseId\': 357166}, \'multiverseid\': 357166}, {\'name\': \'競鬥場小惡魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～小惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'這是露天市場要在黃昏時收攤的許多理由之一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8ccffa-acb9-4f86-ad6a-98a6246dbaed\', \'multiverseId\': 355522}, \'multiverseid\': 355522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dramatische Rettung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hätte nie gedacht, dass ich mal so froh sein würde, zwei Tonnen Schnabel und Krallen mit der Geschwindigkeit eines Pfeils auf mich herabstürzen zu sehen." —Mirela, Azorius-Husarin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b28d64-5177-47d7-94d8-b4f1ee1c3237\', \'multiverseId\': 355892}, \'multiverseid\': 355892}, {\'name\': \'Rescate espectacular\', \'text\': \'Regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca creí que me alegraría tanto de ver dos toneladas de pico y garras lanzarse sobre mí como una flecha." —Mirela, húsar azoria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'031fc576-ac91-4ec2-a8bf-6a067af881c9\', \'multiverseId\': 365614}, \'multiverseid\': 365614}, {\'name\': \'Sauvetage dramatique\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez la créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'aurais jamais cru éprouver une telle joie de voir deux tonnes de bec et de griffes me fondre dessus comme une flèche. » —Mirela, hussarde d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9792c8f-044d-41cc-ab30-433111461b1e\', \'multiverseId\': 356166}, \'multiverseid\': 356166}, {\'name\': \'Salvataggio Spettacolare\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non avrei mai pensato di essere contenta di vedere un paio di tonnellate armate di becco e artigli dirette in picchiata su di me alla velocità di una freccia." —Mirela, ussara Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa5361dd-4a3e-4e62-b3f3-9380996e2f83\', \'multiverseId\': 356440}, \'multiverseid\': 356440}, {\'name\': \'劇的な救出\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「２トンの嘴と爪が矢のように自分に向かってくるのを見てこんなに嬉しくなるなんて、考えてもみなかった。」 ――アゾリウスの騎兵、ミレーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6a6bbd-84a7-415d-8a17-75fb250bb342\', \'multiverseId\': 356714}, \'multiverseid\': 356714}, {\'name\': \'극적인 구조\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"2톤이나 되는 부리와 발톱이 쏜살같이 나를 향해 낙하하는 것이 이렇게나 기쁠 줄이야." —아조리우스 경기병 미렐라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c231cf16-be23-4b61-91f8-fee58f6e74f8\', \'multiverseId\': 357536}, \'multiverseid\': 357536}, {\'name\': \'Resgate Dramático\', \'text\': \'Devolva a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca pensei que ficaria tão feliz ao ver duas toneladas de bico e garras voando na minha direção como uma flecha." — Mirela, hussarda azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343518d2-7711-4a4b-9934-0915f7f01f02\', \'multiverseId\': 356988}, \'multiverseid\': 356988}, {\'name\': \'Внезапное Спасение\', \'text\': \'Верните целевое существо в руку его владельца. Вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Никогда не думала, что буду так рада увидеть клюв и когти весом в две тонны, летящие ко мне со скоростью пущенной стрелы». — Мирела, гусар Азориусов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21efe9b8-fef6-45bb-9d87-1baaed4d57c5\', \'multiverseId\': 355344}, \'multiverseid\': 355344}, {\'name\': \'戏剧性拯救\', \'text\': \'将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我从未想过自己会希望两吨重的尖喙与利爪以飞箭之速朝我压过来。」 ～俄佐立轻骑兵米瑞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857e2886-399f-4822-9d08-4e7a9986e510\', \'multiverseId\': 357262}, \'multiverseid\': 357262}, {\'name\': \'戲劇性拯救\', \'text\': \'將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我從未想過自己會希望兩噸重的尖喙與利爪以飛箭之速朝我壓過來。」 ～俄佐立輕騎兵米瑞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de906d43-a8ce-473b-a502-136fe7f0cc52\', \'multiverseId\': 355618}, \'multiverseid\': 355618}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkler Wiedergänger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Dunkle Wiedergänger stirbt, lege ihn oben auf die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Der Mörder wurde vor den Azorius-Gerichten der Gerechtigkeit zugeführt, doch seine Seele wurde aufgrund einer Formalie freigelassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355797&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf92cbf3-d018-4b94-a315-a5cf8667eb46\', \'multiverseId\': 355797}, \'multiverseid\': 355797}, {\'name\': \'Aparecido oscuro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Aparecido oscuro muera, ponlo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'El asesino se enfrentó a la justicia en los tribunales azorios, pero su alma quedó en libertad debido a un tecnicismo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8018127-ffa0-4760-8fbc-7133d6851e55\', \'multiverseId\': 365519}, \'multiverseid\': 365519}, {\'name\': \'Obscur revenant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Obscur revenant meurt, mettez-le au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "L\'assassin est passé devant les tribunaux d\'Azorius, mais son âme a été libérée pour une raison procédurière.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06828cc5-a957-4831-8b30-44c34b298a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 356071}, \'multiverseid\': 356071}, {\'name\': \'Redivivo Oscuro\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Redivivo Oscuro muore, mettilo in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': "L\'assassino fu condotto dinanzi alla giustizia nelle corti Azorius, ma la sua anima venne lasciata libera per un cavillo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f0494f-92f1-4337-b73d-aed581c8e055\', \'multiverseId\': 356345}, \'multiverseid\': 356345}, {\'name\': \'闇の帰還者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n闇の帰還者が死亡したとき、これをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'殺人犯はアゾリウスの法廷で法の裁きを受けたが、彼の魂は規則に従って解放された。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6627d45d-48f9-45bc-98c5-ef74717927c9\', \'multiverseId\': 356619}, \'multiverseid\': 356619}, {\'name\': \'사악한 망령\', \'text\': \'비행\\n사악한 망령이 죽을 때, 사악한 망령을 소유자의 서고 맨 위에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'살인자는 아조리우스 법정에서 심판을 받았지만, 그의 영혼은 절차상의 문제로 풀려났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'886890b5-9174-49cb-9de9-96dd4fb749c7\', \'multiverseId\': 357441}, \'multiverseid\': 357441}, {\'name\': \'Espectro Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Espectro Sombrio morrer, coloque-o no topo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'O assassino enfrentou a justiça nos tribunais dos Azorius, mas a alma dele foi absolvida por uma falha de procedimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b930c5-a3d8-4647-9e4f-53946ec6e191\', \'multiverseId\': 356893}, \'multiverseid\': 356893}, {\'name\': \'Темный Призрак\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Темный Призрак умирает, положите его на верх библиотеки его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Убийца предстал перед судом Азориусов, однако с юридической точки зрения душа его была освобождена.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f79a63-c802-4086-8975-aa53b26f88fe\', \'multiverseId\': 355249}, \'multiverseid\': 355249}, {\'name\': \'黑暗复灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当黑暗复灵死去时，将它置于其拥有者的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'谋杀者在俄佐立法庭中面对法律制裁，但是他的灵魂却技术性地获释。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef541e3-fc8a-4aba-98f3-9ba7e0de358d\', \'multiverseId\': 357167}, \'multiverseid\': 357167}, {\'name\': \'黑暗復靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當黑暗復靈死去時，將它置於其擁有者的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'謀殺者在俄佐立法庭中面對法律制裁，但是他的靈魂卻技術性地獲釋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3197ac3c-84c7-4802-9d94-b64f5d0de20d\', \'multiverseId\': 355523}, \'multiverseid\': 355523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchsuchungsbefehl\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte, wie dieser Spieler Karten auf der Hand hat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Und könntest du vielleicht erklären, weshalb dein Beutel eine Aura instabiler Energie verströmt?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6883f2-3d15-4ac5-a29c-5d765999dcae\', \'multiverseId\': 355929}, \'multiverseid\': 355929}, {\'name\': \'Orden de registro\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo muestra su mano. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de cartas en la mano de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Y le importaría explicar por qué su bolsa irradia un aura de energía inestable?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dbafc46-be2c-43c4-ae98-b4d30d38a294\', \'multiverseId\': 365651}, \'multiverseid\': 365651}, {\'name\': \'Mandat de perquisition\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé révèle sa main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de cartes dans la main de ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Pourriez-vous nous expliquer l\'origine de l\'aura d\'énergie instable qui émane de votre besace ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac07c22-7167-4ec3-b398-7770fd5f277d\', \'multiverseId\': 356203}, \'multiverseid\': 356203}, {\'name\': \'Mandato di Perquisizione\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio rivela la propria mano. Guadagni punti vita pari al numero di carte in mano a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"E potresti spiegarci perché la tua sacca irradia un\\\'aura di energia instabile?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1606679c-fb51-412e-84d7-2beb73e9e111\', \'multiverseId\': 356477}, \'multiverseid\': 356477}, {\'name\': \'捜査令状\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはそのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの総数に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「で、おたくのカバンから不安定なオーラが漏れ出しているのはなぜか、ご説明願えますかね？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1345ca7-4ec8-4ecf-aec4-72e23b7ca36e\', \'multiverseId\': 356751}, \'multiverseid\': 356751}, {\'name\': \'수색 영장\', \'text\': \'플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 당신은 그 플레이어의 손에 있는 카드의 수만큼 생명점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자, 이제 당신 가방이 왜 불안정한 기운을 뿜어내고 있는지를 설명해 주실까?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aed16d02-6c54-4ff5-9189-70e3e7431f92\', \'multiverseId\': 357573}, \'multiverseid\': 357573}, {\'name\': \'Mandado de Busca\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo revela sua própria mão. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao número de cards na mão daquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"E você poderia explicar por que sua sacola está irradiando uma aura de energia instável?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28848e9a-bb0e-43bd-b320-764a875efc65\', \'multiverseId\': 357025}, \'multiverseid\': 357025}, {\'name\': \'Ордер на Обыск\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок показывает свою руку. Вы получаете столько жизней, сколько карт находится в руке того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Можете объяснить, почему это ваша сумка начала излучать нестабильную энергию?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d44848-8ad9-411a-9ac1-344adebb0f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 355381}, \'multiverseid\': 355381}, {\'name\': \'搜查令\', \'text\': \'目标牌手展示其手牌。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于该牌手手牌的数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你是否愿意解释一下，为何你的背包会散发能量不稳定的灵气？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e569cc-e45c-4a2a-b6ba-c8eeb96f15e9\', \'multiverseId\': 357299}, \'multiverseid\': 357299}, {\'name\': \'搜查令\', \'text\': \'目標玩家展示其手牌。你獲得若干生命，其數量等同於該玩家手牌的數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「你是否願意解釋一下，為何你的背包會散發能量不穩定的靈氣？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a900d88-4e1b-48c4-8aff-50628aaeccb2\', \'multiverseId\': 355655}, \'multiverseid\': 355655}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355986&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c7041fa-352e-48d6-a000-b90cc59ff63b', 'multiverseId': 355986}, 'multiverseid': 355986}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365708&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02d75024-7f94-4564-8c71-33773964ad5c', 'multiverseId': 365708}, 'multiverseid': 365708}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356260&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93aa8f04-796c-4d1d-a8c1-b85c41cd5ddd', 'multiverseId': 356260}, 'multiverseid': 356260}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356534&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33cda0a1-2cdd-4fc7-ba6c-7f4d151f7d3d', 'multiverseId': 356534}, 'multiverseid': 356534}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356808&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cd8c1e8-1fc2-4599-8f85-ed72eab1ae0d', 'multiverseId': 356808}, 'multiverseid': 356808}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357630&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd81fa954-56db-499c-858b-2e4787abb8d0', 'multiverseId': 357630}, 'multiverseid': 357630}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357082&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc25f020-ea26-41fa-a7cb-5f7253756b31', 'multiverseId': 357082}, 'multiverseid': 357082}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355438&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '426b1a8e-2d41-431c-aa0d-32e69e39cdb8', 'multiverseId': 355438}, 'multiverseid': 355438}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357356&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f420ea5-c64d-41fe-aa71-33fc8243163e', 'multiverseId': 357356}, 'multiverseid': 357356}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355712&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '757297b7-b6c6-4514-9e47-62f04d68bf26', 'multiverseId': 355712}, 'multiverseid': 355712}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355987&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7405b8c-782a-41d6-bcb3-c46420b2bcd9', 'multiverseId': 355987}, 'multiverseid': 355987}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365709&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd849c97c-782b-4282-b9a0-88c1c534d04d', 'multiverseId': 365709}, 'multiverseid': 365709}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356261&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c35c1cd1-46a0-4b8b-b0ea-767b39d843e8', 'multiverseId': 356261}, 'multiverseid': 356261}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356535&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e99c92e-c3a9-45a4-ab51-085cec6a6dc3', 'multiverseId': 356535}, 'multiverseid': 356535}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356809&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9e1aefa-d602-4bd8-9499-fec30dab0ee2', 'multiverseId': 356809}, 'multiverseid': 356809}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357631&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c987a6bd-7362-468f-8db6-50c599f3236c', 'multiverseId': 357631}, 'multiverseid': 357631}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357083&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '988ba3d2-76bb-4427-860b-4818bc26b31b', 'multiverseId': 357083}, 'multiverseid': 357083}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355439&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b4099c7-2f1a-44db-9397-29af2fe9957e', 'multiverseId': 355439}, 'multiverseid': 355439}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357357&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afb48ed2-f0c1-41a2-8ea7-28daaee302e7', 'multiverseId': 357357}, 'multiverseid': 357357}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355713&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12593d54-1bea-44c3-8a3f-89de6a7a6c58', 'multiverseId': 355713}, 'multiverseid': 355713}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355988&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b5ace2f-036b-488a-9880-148eb5eac1ea', 'multiverseId': 355988}, 'multiverseid': 355988}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365710&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e72974b-df6f-4241-ac4e-6af4cc2aa7e9', 'multiverseId': 365710}, 'multiverseid': 365710}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356262&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2066cb5-874f-46b5-a181-e29ee987ba07', 'multiverseId': 356262}, 'multiverseid': 356262}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356536&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7284defa-f2cf-426a-9554-651eb51b958f', 'multiverseId': 356536}, 'multiverseid': 356536}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356810&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ad1fdbb-6d16-44c0-8d25-4be9b2ef1661', 'multiverseId': 356810}, 'multiverseid': 356810}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357632&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8a9d12b-55fd-4214-9b7c-c976ed322dc6', 'multiverseId': 357632}, 'multiverseid': 357632}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357084&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08d82e99-6c50-4b56-9d3a-f7d07d06a75a', 'multiverseId': 357084}, 'multiverseid': 357084}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355440&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73db9c8b-9a41-49c7-98cd-0b01a1efe420', 'multiverseId': 355440}, 'multiverseid': 355440}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357358&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '031ef1cc-9a45-4c42-b2ae-5f7c55bdbea3', 'multiverseId': 357358}, 'multiverseid': 357358}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355714&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c5bdab5-62fc-489a-991b-b21328cc6bb5', 'multiverseId': 355714}, 'multiverseid': 355714}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=355989&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e6af4f8-0484-4b7a-b3bf-32c030580100', 'multiverseId': 355989}, 'multiverseid': 355989}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=365711&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59553e61-ec73-4a4c-96eb-29b70ce2ef67', 'multiverseId': 365711}, 'multiverseid': 365711}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356263&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddc28315-bb81-43ef-beea-008d5c68475e', 'multiverseId': 356263}, 'multiverseid': 356263}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356537&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46d7283d-77ac-4b38-b9d2-10b1399bde82', 'multiverseId': 356537}, 'multiverseid': 356537}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=356811&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '164e0e96-eabb-4a93-879f-43bfadb7c20b', 'multiverseId': 356811}, 'multiverseid': 356811}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=357633&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f4365bb-c5d6-4d92-