s +1/+1 and gains intimidate until end of turn.\\n{2}{B}{G}, Sacrifice a nontoken creature: Put X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens onto the battlefield, where X is the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '{1}{R}: Bellows Lizard gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{1}{U}{R}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '{2}{B}: Stonefare Crocodile gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', "{2}{G}, Sacrifice Centaur's Herald: Put a 3/3 green Centaur creature token onto the battlefield.", '{2}{U}, {T}: Target creature gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', "{4}{G}{W}: Put a 3/3 green Centaur creature token onto the battlefield.\\n{2}{G}{W}: Populate. (Put a token onto the battlefield that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", '{5}{G}: Regenerate Selesnya Sentry.', '{B}{R}: Target blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\n{B}{R}: Target player who lost life this turn loses 1 life.', '{G}, Sacrifice another creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Gobbling Ooze.', '{T}, Pay 3 life: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, you gain 6 life.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{3}{G}{W}, {T}, Tap two untapped creatures you control, Sacrifice Grove of the Guardian: Put an 8/8 green and white Elemental creature token with vigilance onto the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature is unblockable this turn.', '{T}: Add {B} or {G} to your mana pool.\\n{B}{G}: Golgari Keyrune becomes a 2/2 black and green Insect artifact creature with deathtouch until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {B} or {R} to your mana pool.\\n{B}{R}: Rakdos Keyrune becomes a 3/1 black and red Devil artifact creature with first strike until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool.\\n{G}{W}: Selesnya Keyrune becomes a 3/3 green and white Wolf artifact creature until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {U} or {R} to your mana pool.\\n{U}{R}: Until end of turn, Izzet Keyrune becomes a 2/1 blue and red Elemental artifact creature.\\nWhenever Izzet Keyrune deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', '{T}: Add {W} or {U} to your mana pool.\\n{W}{U}: Azorius Keyrune becomes a 2/2 white and blue Bird artifact creature with flying until end of turn.', '{T}: Exile target land card from a graveyard. Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.\\n{B}, {T}: Exile target instant or sorcery card from a graveyard. Each opponent loses 2 life.\\n{G}, {T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. You gain 2 life.', '{T}: Target player puts the top card of his or her library into his or her graveyard.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Codex Shredder: Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{UR}: Frostburn Weird gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', "{U}, {T}: Draw two cards.\\n{R}, {T}, Discard a card: Mercurial Chemister deals damage to target creature equal to the discarded card's converted mana cost.", "{W}{U}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\\n{3}{W}{U}: Detain target nonland permanent an opponent controls. (Until your next turn, that permanent can't attack or block and its activated abilities can't be activated.)"]
